  <para style="h">Etenda yo Tunganda</para>
  <para style="toc1">Etenda yo Tunganda</para>
  <para style="toc2">Etenda</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ete</para>
  <para style="mt1">Etenda</para>
  <para style="mt2">yo</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tunganda</para>
  <para style="rem">ECIDIMUKITHSA</para>
  <para style="rem">Ethzi po vuka thzo muthsidi ethzi a ñorire Luka. Mu vuka thzenthzi thzo kutanga shime a ñorire yo mwoyo wa Yesu pano pashi, kufa kwenthzi no kupinduka kwenthzi kwafu. Mothzi vuka thzetenda mwaa monithsa Mupepo Oukenu edi wa keyire, makereke oape edi a keyire, etenda yo tunganda neyi yakwerume aidi a Peturu na Paulu. Karo ethzi vuka thzaa tu monithsa enu ine, akwakutawa edi a romberangire Nyambi, Majuda edi a kanine ku tambura Evangeli, Maroma edi a nyandithsire anua Nyambi, nEvangeli edi thza thzire mu matunga oahe.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CT, TA, CC, HS, Par</para>
  <para style="s1">Thsikumbwethzo thso Mupepo Oukenu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Ku koe shokuru Teofile, mu vuka thzange thzo kutanga na ni ku ñorera enu yoihe eyi a tatekire ku kwama Yesu neyi a rongithsire, <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />shime ku na kuma mu diyuwa edi a mu shimbire Nyambi ku mu twara ku wiru, o ku na mana ku pa eraerera ko Mupepo Oukenu ku tunganda twenthzi otu a hangurire. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Munyima thzo dikando dyenthzi pa mbinda, wa cimonithsire kukwo no ku wa rakwithsa shemwa momungi ci nedi muyumi. Mu mayuwa o makumi ane wa hokokangire kukwo no ku wa tongwera yo Kutumina kwa Nyambi.<verse eid="ACT 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Diyuwa dimweya o ku dino, wa wa raererire ci: “Mwa ku tunda muno mu Yerusalema, unone mwa ku taterere shime tango Tata ou a ku mi tumena thsipa ethsi a kumbwethzire, eci diya na mu yuvu o ku ni i amba. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Inene Johani shime a korovethzire ko meyu, unone amwe munyima thzo mayuwa oapu kenge mwa ku korovethziwa ko Mupepo Oukenu.”<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa thzina mu wiru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Ou yekarire pofoci na Yesu ya hukahukerire ku mwipura ci: “Fumu, ene thso thsikati thsino honi wa ku huthsera kutumina ku Maisiraele nji?”<verse eid="ACT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Wa wa tawire ci: “Tata yodiyo o di nokoro o ku dimuka ekati nji myaka, karo eyo po kadi yenu ci mu i dimuke. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Unone kenge mwa ku tambura okoro Mupepo Oukenu apa wa ku keya pa penu. Kenge mwa kwikara mambangi ange ku tongwera anu keyi yange mu Yerusalema, mu Judea yomuhe no mu Samaria, shime ku ka kuma ku hura o kaye.”<verse eid="ACT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Ou a manine ku amba eyi, wa shimbiwire ku twariwa mu wiru o kwa na mu tanekera, karo divui dya mu thsikire. <verse eid="ACT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />O kwa na mu rupukera kengeyo o ku kengena mu wiru, popo akwerume aidi awa vatire evata yo ku vyakima a nemanine ku nyonga thzo. <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />A ambire ci: “Amwe mwakwerume o ku Galilea, ine eyi mu nemanena kuno o ku mu na rupukera ku wiru? Oyu Yesu na shimbiwa ku kwenu ku twariwa mu wiru kenge a ku ka huka dyodi mu na mu mono o ku thza mu wiru.” <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus ascends to heaven" file="gt00105.tif" size="col" loc="Act 1:9-11" copy="Gordon" ref="1.9-11">Yesu aa thzina mu wiru</figure><verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Matiasi aa hanguriwa ku shwana Judasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Tunganda ngou twa hukire ku Yerusalema ku tunda pa Mukinya wEtondo yo Miywera, muendo o ku kwana kanano kofoci.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ruendo ro ku tawethza Majuda ku enda dyo Savata.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Ou a ka kumine, a ka thzinine ku koroi omu ekarangire.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 1:13">Mathzina owa ekariremo po aa: Peturu, Johani, Jakovo, Andereasi, Filipu, Tomasi, Batolomeu, Mateu, Jakovo mwana Alufea, Simoni oyu nethsiwa Zeloti no Judasi mwana Jakovo. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Awa wahe a cikwatire pofoci no ku tanarithsa erombero, mofoci kengeyo no waya ambuyama na Madiya mama wa Yesu namina Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Mwethso thsikati akwakutawa o kukwana makumi o dikumi no makumi edi (120) a ciwanine pofoci. Peturu wa katukire no ku amba ci: <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />“Andengenu, Mañoro naa citombora neyi wa ambire Mupepo Oukenu ka Fumu Davida ku kare keyi ya Judasi Isikariota, oyu naa tangerera waya na kwata Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Judasi shime na ekara yumweya o mu thsipani thsetu no ku ciera mwikwama yetu.”<verse eid="ACT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />(Pa madi aa naa wana pekwama yenthzi yoimango, Judasi naa urupo dikanda omu naa ka fera. Naa u ku tangerithsa mutwi, erama yenthzi na i yatuka mu kaci no mihoe thzenthzi thzothzihe na thzi ruputukera pora. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Eyo ya yukire kwanu wahe o mu Yerusalema, ngou a tire edyo dikanda mu mushovo wo ci: “Akeludama, ku amba ci Dikanda dyOnyinga.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu mushovo o Thsiaramaiki.</char></note>).<verse eid="ACT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />Peturu wa shumunine ci: “Inene ya ñoriwire mu Vuka thzo Membo ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">“ ‘Mu thsie diumbo dyenthzi dikare diundu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 1:20">A ku tungamo munu.’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">“Karo ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Mu ndau thzenthzi ku shwane wao.’<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />“Mweyo, tu hangurenu munu oyu shwana mu ndau thza Judasi, kwakwerume awa nekaranga netu thsikati thsothsihe uya naa endauranga netu Fumu Yesu, <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />ku tatekera apa a mu korovethzerire Johani shime ku na kuma mu diyuwa edi naa mu shimbi Nyambi ku kwetu ku mu twara mu wiru. Oyu hanguriwa aa roera kwikara netu mbangi o kupinduka kwa Yesu kwafu.”<verse eid="ACT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Ngou emekire akwerume aidi, Josefa oyu nethsiwa Basabasi karo oyu wethsiwire ci Jusitasi, no Matiasi. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Ngou a romberire wahe ci: “Fumu, owe na dimuka micima thzanu wahe, o tu monithse oyu o na hangura powa akwerume aidi, <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />oyu nga o shwana ndau thza Judasi Isikariota muno mwikwama yonganda eyi naa thsii no ku thza ku ndau ethzi thzi na mu roera.” <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Ngou okire ko ñera, Matiasi wa hanguriwire kwikara kanganda no ku mu vungithsa po tuya to dikumi na kofoci.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CT, CC, HS, TA</para>
  <para style="s1">Kukeya ko Mupepo Oukenu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Mu diyuwa dyo Pentekota,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Diyuwa dyo ku kwanithsa mayuwa makumi mutanu ku tunda pa Paseka.</char></note> akwakutawa wahe a ciwanine mu ndau thzofoci. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Popo kwa yuvaharire muvumo o ku cipitura eci o kakundukundu ou wa tundire ku wiru, wa na yarire mu nthzio omu ekarire. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Ngou kwa monaharire madimi o kupitura eci o mudiro aa a nekarire peuru thzo munu no munu. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Wahe a yarire Mupepo Oukenu no ku tateka ku amba mu mishovo thzathzo ethzi wa wa ambithsire Mupepo Oukenu.<figure style="fig" alt="Tongues of fire on the disciples" file="cn01890c.tif" size="col" loc="Act 2:1-4" copy="Cook" ref="2.1-4">Madimi o mudiro pa mitwi thzerongwa</figure><verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Kethsiya thsikati mu Yerusalema kwekarire Majuda awa remekire Nyambi, awa tundire mu matunga oahe o mu kaye. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Ou a yuvire ou muvumo, mbunga thzothzikuru thza na ciwanawanenineko. Ya wa tanganithsire ou a na yuvire wahe mishovo thzo o kwa thzi amba akwakutawa.<verse eid="ACT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />A komokire nene no ku amba ci: “Eyi ne ngepi i nekara? Awa anu awa ne kadi wahe AkwaGalilea nji? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Unone kwaa keya ngepi ci munu no munu ku kwetu aa wa yuva o kwa amba mishovo thzetu? <figure style="fig" file="GPS_Pentecost B&amp;W final3.tif" size="span" ref="2.5-11" /> <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />AkwaPatia, AkwaMede, AkwaElami, anu o ku Mesopotamia, ku Judea, ku Kapadosia, ku Pontasi no Asia. <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />Amweya aa tunda ku Firigia, ku Pamfilia, ku Egepita no mandau a Libia aa a na cihata na Sirene, nenda o ku Roma, <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />(Majuda nanukenge awa cipirurire kwikara Majuda), AkwaKirete nAkwaArabia. Twahe twaa wa yuva o kwa amba mu mishovo thzetu enu yoikuru eyi naa kwama Nyambi!” <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Wahe a komokire no ku cinjembukera, a cipaurire ci: “Eyi ne ya ngepi?”<verse eid="ACT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Unone amweya mu mbunga a wa teururire no ku amba ci: “Awo anu a na pende waine omupe.”<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maywi a Peturu ku mbunga</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Peturu ngou emanine naenthzenthzi tunganda to dikumi na kofoci, wa yerurire ku diywi no ku amba ku mbunga ci: “Amwe mwaenthzange Majuda namwe mwahe mu na tungu mu Yerusalema, mu ni teerere nawa karo mu dimukere eyi ni mi tongwera. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Inene awa anu po ka pendire eci edi mu anekera amwe, mathsikuthsiku ano mbeci thsi kwane thsikati thso 9 thzo mathsikuthsiku. <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Uno honi, eyi po yodiyo eyi aa ambire mukwakukethza Joele yo kuninga ci:<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />‘Nyambi aa amba ci, Mu mayuwa o mahurerero,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">kenge mbo ni pa kongi Mupepo wange kwanu wahe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">Anenu wakwerumeana na mbuyamaana kenge mbokethza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">mishumba thzenu kenge mba mona emona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">akuru wakwerumenu kenge mba rota erota.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Mwao mayuwa ao kenge mbo ni pa kongi Mupepo wange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">kwapikange wakwerume nambuyama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">mweyo, kenge mbokethza.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Kenge mbo ni kwama ekomokithsa ku wiru mu diwiru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">nemonithso mu kaye pano pashi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">onyinga, mudiro no thsimemba thso mwithse kenge mbo ikarako.<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Diyuwa kenge mbo di nyora,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">ngonda kenge mbo thzi kiha eci onyinga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">o ku di shime ku keya edyo diyuwa dyoshokuru dyo kutethzima dya Fumu.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Munu yomuhe o kwithsa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:21">pa dithzina dya Fumu, kenge mba a yoyithsiwa.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:28-32">Joe 2.28-32</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />“Amwe mwaenthzange mwa kwa Isiraele, mu ni teerere! Yesu wa Nazareta po nedi munu oyu naa hangura Nyambi kekwama yoikuru nekomokithsa nemonithso eyi naa kwama Nyambi kenthzi mu kaci kenu, eci dyodi mu na i cidimukera. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Oyu munu shime mwa mu piwire kesheteka no ku dimuka cimo kwa Nyambi, amwe ko ku kwathsiwa kwanu a shiremeka murao na mu mwipaa ko ku mwamba pa mbinda. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Unone Nyambi naa mu pindura kwafu no ku mu tundithserera ku dikando dyo kukora ko kufa, inene ka ya tawire ci kufa kwikare nokoro peuru thzenthzi. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Inene Davida wa ambire keyi yenthzi ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">‘Na monine Fumu pa rupara rwange thsikati thsothsihe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">Inene ku rudyo rwange a di ci nga na karupera.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Mweyo, mucima wange u na nyanyuka nene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">no maywi ange a na roera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">nerama yange kenge ya ku turumwithsa mukurupero.<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />Inene ko wa ku thsierera mwoyo wange mu ndau thzafu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dihere.</char></note>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">nji ku tawethza o Mukenu woe ci orere mu thsidi.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />No ni dimukithsa makuñwa o mwoyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:28">kenge wa ku ni yarithsa thsinyanyu pa kwikara nange.’ ”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:8-11">Mem 16.8-11</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />Peturu wa shumunine ku amba ci: “Andengenu, naa roera ku mi tongwera yoshemwa ya mukwathsañuru wetu Davida. Wa fire no ku vumbekiwa, thsidi thsenthzi, thsothsi no rerodino. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Pakuninga ci nedi mukwakukethza karo ko ku dimuka ci Nyambi wa cethzerire ngoro ku kwenthzi ci kenge a ku paka yumweya kwanahokenthzi pa ngunja thzenthzi, <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Davida wa monine yo ku rupara no ku amba keyi yo kupinduka kwafu kwa Krisitu ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:31">“ ‘ka a thsiereriwire mu ndau thzafu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:31">nji ku tawethza erama yenthzi kworera mu thsidi.’<verse eid="ACT 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />“Nyambi naa mu pindura kwafu oyu Yesu, atwe twahe twa mambangi weyi enu eyi. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Ko ku thzinekiwa ku dyoko dyo rudyo dya Nyambi, naa ka tambura kwa Tata Mupepo Oukenu oyu wa kumbwethziwire karo naa u tu pingurwera eci edi mu cimonena no ku ciyuvera. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Inene Davida aye ka a thzire ku wiru, unone wa ambire ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">“ ‘Fumu wa amberire Fumu wange ci:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:34">“O wikare ku rudyo rwange,<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />shime ku ka kuma apa na ku tendera akwethzimbo yoe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:35">thsipura apa a ku dyaterera mauru oe.” ’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Mem 110.1</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />“Mweyo, anu o mu Isiraele wahe a dimuke shemwa ci oyu Yesu na mwamba pa mbinda, Nyambi naa mu paka kwikara Fumu no Mesiya.”<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Anu ou a yuvire eyi, ya wa kiñine ku micima, ngou a amberire Peturu no tunganda tumweya ci: “Andengenu, ine tu na roera ku tenda?” <verse eid="ACT 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Peturu wa tawire ci: “Munu no munu ku kwenu a cere evi yenthzi no ku korovethziwa mu dithzina dya Yesu Krisitu ci mu wane otetero wevi yenu, wangu mwa ku tambure thsipa thso Mupepo Oukenu. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Ethsi thsikumbwethzo po thsenu nanenu, nanu wahe awa di kokure, wahe awa ethsa Fumu Nyambi wetu.”<verse eid="ACT 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Ko maywi amweya oangi, Peturu wa wa nomenithsire no ku wa tanarithsa ci: “Mu ciyoyithse mwathsinda kwanu o rerodino wetenda yoimango!” <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Mweyo, awa tawire maywi enthzi a korovethziwire. Diya diyuwa anu o ku kwana makumi o dikumi dyo makumi ahatu (3,000) a vungithsiwire ku taro thzakwakutawa.<verse eid="ACT 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Thsiciwano thsakwakutawa</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Wahe a tanarithsire erongithsa yo tunganda, thsiciwano, murarero wa Fumu nerombero.<verse eid="ACT 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Wowa oukuru wengenenine anu wahe mukaci kekomokithsa nemonithso yoingi eyi twa kwamine tunganda. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Akwakutawa wahe shime ekarire thsipani thsofoci karo a cierangire yoihe eyi ekarangire nayo. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Shime urithsangire rufumo neyi ekarangire nayo yoihe no ku era ao madi kwanu wahe awa pirire. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Diyuwa no diyuwa a ciwanangire pofoci mu Tembere. A dyerangire murarero wa Fumu mu manthzio o, karo a dyerangire pofoci edya yo ko thsinyanyu no micima thzothziwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />A shangarangire Nyambi, karo a wa nyanyukerire anu wahe. Fumu wa vungithsire ku taro thzowa a yoyithsiwangire diyuwa no diyuwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CT, CC, HS, TA</para>
  <para style="s1">Peturu aa porithsa thsikunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Diyuwa dimweya, Peturu na Johani shime a kambamine ku thza ku Tembere ko thsikati thso ku rombera, ko thsikati thso muthsihatu runguro. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Mwethso thsikati o ku ku retiwa ku Tembere mukwerume oyu wekarire thsikunga ku tunda ku kwerekiwa. Shime mu pakangire diyuwa no diyuwa pa thsero thzo Tembere ethzi thzi nethsiwa ci Thsero Thzothziwa, ci a rombe madi kwanu awa engena mu Tembere. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Ou a monine Peturu na Johani o kwa fota kwingena mu Tembere, wa wa rombire madi.<verse eid="ACT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Peturu na Johani a mu rupukerire, Peturu ngou a ambire ci: “O tu kenge!” <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Oya mukwerume wa wa kengererire ko thsithzui ko ku kurupera ci kenge a tambura thsimweya kukwo. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Unone Peturu wa mu amberire ci: “Ka ni di no silivera nji gauda ci ni ku pe, unone kenge ni ku pa eyi ni di nayo. Mu dithzina dya Yesu Krisitu wa Nazareta, o katuke o ende!”<verse eid="ACT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Peturu ngou a mu kwatire ku dyoko dyo rudyo ku mu kwathsa ci a katuke. Popo edyato no mangongo enthzi ya tanarire. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Wa reerire mu wiru no kwimana ko mauru enthzi, ayepo tateka ku enda. Ngou a thzireno mu Tembere o ku thza o enda no ku rearea o ku shangara Nyambi.<verse eid="ACT 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Anu wahe a mu monine o ku enda noku shangara Nyambi, <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />no ku mu dimuka ci yodiyo oya na ekaranga pa Thsero Thzothziwa thzo Tembere o ku romba ekwathsa. A njembukire no ku komoka eyi ya tendaharire ku kwenthzi.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peturu aa rongithsa mu Tembere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Oyu munu o ku na kakatera a Peturu na Johani, anu wahe a komokire no ku cirera ku Makeke a Solomoni oku ekarire a Peturu na Johani.<verse eid="ACT 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Peturu ou a i monine wa wa amberire ci: “Amwe mwakwerume a Isiraele, ine eyi mu i njembukera eyi, karo ine eyi mu tu rupukera eci yatwe tu na twethsa ku endithsa oyu munu kokoro nokenu wetu? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Nyambi wa Aburahama, Isaka na Jakovo, aye Nyambi wakwathsañuruetu naa paka mu kutethzima Mupikenthzi Yesu, oyu mwa pire no ku mu hamura pa meho a Pilatu shaanga ci aye shime a fotire ku mu rukurura. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Unone amwe mwa kanine aye o Mukenu nOwawa no ku romba ci a mi rukurwere thsipaanu. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Mwepaire aye mukwa ku pa mwoyo, unone Nyambi naa mu pindura kwafu. Atwe po twa mambangi wayo eyo.<verse eid="ACT 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />“Ko thsitawo mu dithzina dya Yesu, oyu mukwerume mu mona no ku dimuka na tanarithsiwa. Ko thsitawo mu dithzina dya Yesu eyi i na mu porithserera o ku mu cimonena mwahe.<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />“Pano honi andengenu, naa mona ci eyi mwa tendire amwe naendithsi enu, shime mwa i tendire ko kukana ku dimuka. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Unone Nyambi wa kwamine eyi ci i citombore neyi okethzire kakwakukethzenthzi wahe ku kare, yo kuninga ci Mesiya wenthzi kenge a ku nyanda. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Mweyo, mu cere no ku thsiurukera kwa Nyambi ci evi yenu i teteriwe, <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />ci ekati yo ku yooyera nga ya ku keye ku tunda kwa Fumu, karo ci nga a ku tume Mesiya oyu a mi hangwerire ku kare, aye Yesu, <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />oyu na roera kwikara mu wiru shime apa thsa ku keyera thsikati thso ku huthsera enu yoihe, eci edi a kumbwethzire Nyambi ku kare kakwakukethzenthzi owakenu. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Mushe wa ambire ci: ‘Fumu Nyambi kenge a ku mi tumithsera mukwakukethza eci ame ku tunderera mu kaci kanuenu. Mwa ku teerere yoihe eyi a ku mi tongwera. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Munu yomuhe oyu mbo kana ku teerera eyi a ku amba oyo mukwakukethza, kenge mba a cinuniwa kwanua Nyambi no ku nongithsiwa.’<verse eid="ACT 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />“Akwakukethza wahe ku tatekera kwa Samuele, okethzire keyi i tendahara thsino thsikati. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Eyi a kumbwethzire Nyambi kakwakukethza no thsiyuvano thsiya a cikwatire nakwathsañuruenu po yenu. Wa amberire Aburahama ci: ‘Kenge na ku fiyawera anu wahe o kaye kanahokoe.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Mweyo, Nyambi ou a manine ku pindura mupikenthzi kwafu, wa mu tumine tango ku kwenu ci naa mi fiyawere ko ku thsiithsa munu no munu omango wenthzi ouhe.”<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CC, HS, CT, TA</para>
  <para style="s1">Peturu na Johani aa pakiwa mu kamenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />A Peturu na Johani o kwa ambaura nanu, kwa keyire mapurisita, thsitumi wakwakunyunga Tembere nAsaduki. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Shime a anthzipire pakuninga ci Peturu na Johani shime a rongithsire anu ci mwa Yesu ko ku di kupinduka kwafu. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Angire oto tunganda no ku tu paka mu kamenga katere diyuwa edi dya randireko pakuninga ci nedi runguro. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Unone ongi wanu awa yuvire maywi a Peturu na Johani a tawire. Mwedyo diyuwa taro thzakwakutawa thza fotire ku kuma mu tukore to mutanu (5,000).<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Anaci mathsiku aendithsi o Majuda, akuru o mbunga narongithsi o murao a ciwanine mu Yerusalema. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Anasi mupurisita shokuru pa ekarire, mofoci kengeyo no Kayafa, Johani, Alekisanda namweya apa mupurisita shokuru. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />A retire a Peturu na Johani mu kaciko no ku wepura ci: “Kokoro wadye nji mu dithzina dyadye na mu kwama eyi?”<figure style="fig" alt="Peter and John before the Jewish Council" file="cn01901c.tif" size="col" loc="Act 4:5-10" copy="Cook" ref="4.5-10">Peturu na Johani mu Nthzango thzo Majuda</figure><verse eid="ACT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Ko ku yara Mupepo Oukenu, Peturu ngou a wa amberire ci: “Amwe mwaendithsi namwe mwakuru o mbunga! <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />Ngeci eyi twipaweriwa rero po yekwama yoiwa eyi na i tendiwa ku thsikunga ci ngepi naa porithsiwa, <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />amwe mwahe nanu wahe o mu Isiraele mu dimuke kenge ci ko dithzina dya Yesu Krisitu o ku Nazareta oyu mwambire pa mbinda, oyu a pindurire Nyambi kwafu, yo naa reta ci oyu mukwerume nemana pa rupara rwenu a pore. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Yesu po yodiyo oyu variwa mu Mañoro kuninga ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">“ ‘Diwe edi na mu kende amwe mwakwakuumba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:11">na di piruka diunthzi dyodikuru mu thsivaka mu mbango.’<verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />“Kuyoyithsiwa ka ku waniwire kwa wao, inene kwithsa dithzina dimweya muno mu kaye edi na di piwa munu ci tu roere ku yoyithsiwa kadyo.”<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Nthzango ou thza monine ondume wa Peturu na Johani no ku dimuka ci nedi anu o kukana ku cirongithsa, anu kawaye pohuma, thza komokire. A dimukire ci Peturu na Johani shime a ekaranga na Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Unone ko ku mona oya mukwerume wa porithsiwire o ku nemanano, a pirire thso ku amba. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Uno honi a tuminine ci a Peturu na Johani a tunde mu Nthzango, ngou honi a tatekire ku ciyongora mu kaciko. <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />A ambire ci: “Ngepi tu wa tenda awa akwerume? Inene wahe awa a na tungu muno mu Yerusalema a na dimuka nawa ci a na kwama thsimonithso thso ku komokithsa, karo tumba tu twethsa ku thsi hamura. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Uno honi ci eyi ya yuka, tu wa nomenithse ci a ku amba karo ku munu yupi nji yupi mu dithzina dya Yesu.” <verse eid="ACT 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Ngou a wethserire mu Kuta karo no ku wa raerera nene ci katere a ku hukerepo ku amba nji ku rongithsa mu dithzina dya Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Unone Peturu na Johani a tawire ci: “Mu rature yoyamwe mwathsinda, ethsi thsi na roera ne thsipi, ku yuvera amwe nji ku yuvera Nyambi? <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Eciko atwe po tumba tu twethsa ku thsia ku amba eyi na tu mono no ku yuva.”<verse eid="ACT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Ou a manine ku wa nomenithsa nene, a wa rukururire. Akwakuta a kwangire ku wana murandu o ku wa pera humbithso, inene anu wahe shime shangarire Nyambi mukaci keyi ya tendaharire. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Inene oya mukwerume wa porithsiwire ko thsimonithso po nedi wa myaka thzo ku piterera makumi ane (40).<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Thsirombero thsakwakutawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Ou a rukururiwire, a Peturu na Johani a hukire kwaenthzo, no ku ka wa tongwera eyi a ka wa amberire akuru o mapurisita nakuru. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Ou a yuvire eyo, akwakutawa a ciwanine no ku romba Nyambi ci: “Fumu, yowe wombire diwiru no kaye no mawate neyi i dimo yoihe. <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />Wa ambire ko Mupepo Oukenu ko kanwa ka mupikoe mukwathsañuru wetu Davida ou aa ambire ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">“ ‘Ine matunga eyi a na anthzipera?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:25">Ine eyi a yongwera mambunga enu yo mbango?<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Mafumu o kaye a ciroithserire,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">karo naendithsi nawo a ciwanine,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">ku rwithsa Fumu na Mesiya wenthzi.’<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />“Yoshemwa Heroda na Ponso Pilatu a ciwanine pofoci muno mu mbongi nAnukenge no Maisiraele ku rwithsa Yesu mupikoe o mukenu oyu wa wethsire. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Yoihe eyi a kwamine, a i kwamine kokoro neshima yoe eci edi wa i pakire cimo. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Fumu, o mone edi a tu kanya, karo o tu pe atwe twapikoe ku tongwera anu diywi dyoe kondume oukuru. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />O orore dyoko dyoe ku porithsa ekora, emonithso nekomokithsa i tendiwe ko dithzina dya mupikoe Yesu o Mukenu.”<verse eid="ACT 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Ou a manine ku rombera, omo mu ndau ekarire thza ngangamine. Wahe a yarire Mupepo Oukenu, no ku tateka ku amba diywi dya Nyambi kondume.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kucishima kwakwakutawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Wahe akwakutawa ekarire no mucima ofoci, neanekera yofoci pohuma, kwithsa oyu wa ningire ci rufumo oru ekarire naro po rwenthzi yofoci, unone shime a i cierangire yoihe wahe mu kaciko. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Kokoro oukuru, tunganda twa pire ombangi o kupinduka kwa Fumu Yesu kwafu, karo thsihemo thsa Nyambi thsothsikuru thsekarire kukwo wahe. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Kwithsa oyu wa pirire thsinu mu kaciko, pakuninga ci awa ekarire no makanda nji manthzio a a urithsire no ku reta madi aa wanine pa miuro thzo. <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />Shime a retangire ku tunganda ao madi, awo aa erangerire munu no munu omu a foterire.<verse eid="ACT 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Eci edi a tendire Josefa o Mulivi o ku diongo dya Sipera oyu wethsiwire ku tunganda ci Banabasi (kuninga ci Mwana Kutanarithsa). <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />Wa urithsire dikanda dyenthzi no ku reta madi ku tunganda.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CC, HS, CT, TA</para>
  <para style="s1">Ananiasi na Safira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Uno honi mukwerume o dithzina dyo Ananiasi, na munuwenthzi Safira, nawo a urithsire dikanda dyo. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Ko kuciyuva na munuwenthzi, wa cipakerireko amweya ko aya madi a wanine, amweya waa twarire ku tunganda.<verse eid="ACT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Peturu ngou a amberire Ananiasi ci: “Ananiasi! Ine eyi o na tawethzera Satana ku endithsa mucima woe kwangera Mupepo Oukenu ko ku cipakera amweya ku madi aa no urithsa pa dikanda dyoe? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />O ku di shime ku urithsiwa edyo dikanda ne kadi nedi dyoe nji? Karo ou na di pu ku urithsiwa ne, ao madi ne kadi nedi oe nji? Thsine ethsi na thsi reta ci o anekere enu yo kengeyo mu mucima woe? Ko wangerire anu, unone Nyambi o nangera.”<verse eid="ACT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Ananiasi ou a yuvire eyi, wa wererire pashi no ku fa. Wowa oukuru wengenenine wahe awa yuvire eyi ya tendaharire. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Mishumba ngou thza keyire no ku na mu peta no ku mu twara ku ka mu vumbeka.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Ou kwa pitire etunde ihatu, munu wa Ananiasi wa keyire ko kukana ku dimuka ethsi thsa tendaharire. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Peturu wa mwipurire ci: “O ni tongwere, ene aa ne odiyo madi aa na mu urithsa na munuwoe pa dikanda nji?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:8">Wa tawire ci: “Ii, po a hura oahe.”<verse eid="ACT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Unone Peturu wa mu amberire ci: “Ngepi edi na mu ciyuvu ku ereka Mupepo wa Fumu? O mone! Anu awa na ka vumbeka munuwoe pa thsero a di, kenge a ku shimba nowe!”<verse eid="ACT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Popo wa wererire ku mauru a Peturu no ku fa. Awo mishumba a ka vumbekire munuwenthzi ou a ka hukire a na mu wanine o ku na fu, a mu shimbire no ku ka mu vumbeka ku mbadi thza munuwenthzi. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Wowa oukuru wengenenine kereke thzothzihe namweya wahe awa yuvire eyi ya tendaharire.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Emonithso nekomokithsa yo tunganda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Tunganda twa kwamine emonithso nekomokithsa yoingi mukaci kanu. Akwakutawa shime a ciwanangire pofoci mu Makeke a Solomoni. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Kwithsa munu wao oyu wa keshukire ku civandakanano, shaanga i ninge ci a remekiwire nene kwanu. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Shaanga ikare kengeyo, mungi wanu, akwerume nambuyama a tawire kwa Fumu Yesu no ku vungithsiwa ku taro thzo. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Mukaci kekwama eyi twa kwamine tunganda, akwakukora a shimbiwangire ku wa twara ku makurukuñwa no ku wa paka pa madidi no pa tunaha ci Peturu ou a pita ngwa muthzimbimbi wenthzi kenge u thsikapo amweya. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Anu owangi awa tundire mu maumbo o pepi na Yerusalema, a retangire ethzi wo nowa a nyandithsangire mathzimu, karo wahe a porithsiwire.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kunyandithsiwa ko tunganda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Mupurisita shokuru wa katukire, nowa ekarire nenthzi wahe awo akwa thsipani thso Masaduki, a tenderire nene mbamba tunganda. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />A kwatire tunganda no ku tu paka mu kamenga ko mbunga. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Unone othsiku kangeru ka Fumu ka na yanthzururire mathsero o kamenga no ku punithsa tunganda, no ku wa ambera ci: <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />“Mu thze mu kemane mu Tembere, mu ka tongwere anu maywi oahe o mwoyo oupe.”<verse eid="ACT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Tunganda ou twa yuvire eyi, popa dya vire diyuwa mathsikuthsiku shemwa twa kengenine mu Tembere no ku tateka ku rongithsa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Mupurisita shokuru naenthzenthzi ou a kumine, a wanekire Nthzango, akuru wanu a Isiraele wahe, no ku tuma anu ku ka shimba tunganda mu kamenga. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Unone tupathso ou twa ka kumine ka twa ka waninemo munu mu kamenga. Ngou twa ka hukire ku na tongora ku Nthzango ci: <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />“Ou tu na ka kuma ku kamenga, twaa ka wana ci ekwaro yoihe i na yanthzeriwa no ku patiwa nawa, nakwakunyunga o kwa nemana pa mathsero, unone ou tu na ka yanthzurura ka tu ka waninemo munu.”<verse eid="ACT 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Ou a i yuvire thsitumi wakwakunyunga Tembere nakuru o mapurisita ya wa tanganithsire no ku komoka eyi ya tendaharire ku tunganda. <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Ngou kwa keyire munu no ku na wa tongwera ci: “Mu teerere! Waya akwerume na mu paka mu kamenga a nemana mu Tembere ku rongithsa anu!”<verse eid="ACT 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Thsitumi wakwakunyunga Tembere wa thzire nanuenthzi ku ka shimba tunganda, unone ka ka tu shimbire kokoro inene shime a yapire ku povauriwa no mawe kwanu. <verse eid="ACT 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Ou a na kumithsire tunganda, a twimekire pa meho o Nthzango. Mupurisita shokuru ngou epurire oto tunganda ci: <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />“Na tu mi nomenithsa nene amwe ci mwa ku rongithsa karo mu dithzina dyoyu munu oyu. Uno honi mu na yarithsa Yerusalema yomuhe erongithsa yenu, karo mwaa fota ci kufa kwenthzi kwa ku tu rumbere.”<verse eid="ACT 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Unone Peturu naenthzenthzi tunganda a ambire ci: “Twaa roera ku yuvera Nyambi kadi anu. <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Nyambi wakwathsañuruetu naa pindura kwafu oyu Yesu na mwipaa amwe ko ku mwamba pa mbinda. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Nyambi wa mu pindwerire ku rudyo rwenthzi ci ekare Muendithsi no Muyoyithsi, a pe ana Isiraele ndau thzo ku cera no ku teteriwa evi yo. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Atwe po twa mambangi weyi enu, mofoci kengeyo no Mupepo Oukenu oyu naa pa Nyambi kowa a na mu yuvera.”<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Ou a yuvire eyi, Nthzango thza anthzipire nene no ku fota kwipaa tunganda. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Unone mu kaciko, kwekarire Mufarithsi o dithzina dyo Gamaliele, murongithsi o murao oyu wa remekiwire nene kwanu wahe. Wemanine mu Nthzango no ku raerera ci tunganda tu punithsiwe pora thsikati thsothsipu. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Wa amberire Nthzango ci: “Amwe mwakwerume a Isiraele, mu mamere keyi mu fota ku tenda kowa akwerume awa. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Inene mu thsikati thso ku manyima shime kwaa keya munu o dithzina dyo Teudasi, oyu wa cithsire ci munu o mukuru mu thsivaka, oyu wa shupweriwire kwanu o ku fota ku kwana makumi o dikumi ane (400). Ou a paiwire, awa mu shupwerire a cishandukire no ku pwa po ya pwererire yenthzi apo. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Munyima thzenthzi, mu thsikati thso diñorithsa kwa keyire Judasi o ku Galilea. Naye karo thsa mu shupwerire thsipani thsanu thsothsikuru, naye karo ou a paiwire anuenthzi wahe a cishandukire.<verse eid="ACT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />“Mweyo, pano honi naa mi tongwera ci mwa wa tenda thsimweya awa anu awa. Mu wa thsie, inene ngeci po eanekera nekwama yo po yaa tunda kwanu, kenge ya ku pwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Unone ngeci yaa tunda kwa Nyambi ka mwa ku twethsa ku i pwithsa, mwaa twethsa ku ciwana ci mwaa rwithsa Nyambi!” Nthzango thza shupwerire maywi a Gamaliele.<verse eid="ACT 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Tunganda twethsiwerire mu Nthzango, a tu furire no ku tu nomenithsa ci katere twa ku ambe karo mu dithzina dya Yesu no ku tu thsia ci tu thze.<verse eid="ACT 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Tunganda twa tundire mu Nthzango o ku tu na nyanyuka pa ku mona ci Nyambi o na tu vara ci twaa roera ku nyandera dithzina dya Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Diyuwa no diyuwa mu Tembere no mu manthzio ka twa thsiire ku rongithsa no ku honga Muthzimbu Ouwa ci Yesu po yodiyo Mesiya.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CC, HS, CT, TA</para>
  <para style="s1">Akwerume o mutanu naidi aa hanguriwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Mwao mayuwa, erongwa ou ya thzire o vura, kwekarire kooko mu kaci ko Majuda o Thsigerike no Majuda o Thsiheveru. Majuda o Thsigerike a ningire ci mafakathzi o ka a erangire nawa kwikwathsa eyi ya eriwangire diyuwa no diyuwa. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Tunganda to dikumi na twidi ngou twethserire mbunga thzakwakutawa pofoci no ku amba ci: “Ka ku roerire ci tu thsie ku rongithsa diywi dya Nyambi ci tu erange edya. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Mweyo, andengenu, mu hangureko akwerume o mutanu naidi mukaci kenu awa na remekiwa, awa na yara Mupepo Oukenu nonyanyami awa tu pa eyi ekwama. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />Atwe tu mone pohuma yo ku rombera no ku rongithsa diywi dya Nyambi thsikati thsothsihe.”<verse eid="ACT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Eyi twa ambire tunganda ya roerithsire mbunga thzothzihe. Ngou a hangurire Setefani mukwerume oyu wa yarire thsitawo no Mupepo Oukenu, Filipu, Porokoro, Nikanora, Timoni, Paramena no Nikolasi o ku Antioke, Munukenge oyu wa cipirurire Mujuda. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Ngou a wa retire pa meho o tunganda, awa a wa rombererire no ku wa kambeka moko.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Diywi dya Nyambi dya twarire ku rupara ku henya. Taro thzerongwa thza vurire nene mu Yerusalema, no mapurisita owangi a cipakire ku thsitawo.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Setefani aa kwatiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Setefani, mukwerume oyu wa yarire thsihemo nokoro wa Nyambi, wa kwamine ekomokithsa yoikuru nemonithso mu kaci kanu. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Unone anu amweya o mu sinagoge thzAkwakurukuruka (eci edi thzethsiwire), Majuda o ku Sirene no ku Alekisandiria mofoci kengeyo nakwa Silisia nakwa Asia a tatekire ku cikanyeka na Setefani. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Unone a kwangire ku tata onyanyami no Mupepo ou a ambithsire.<verse eid="ACT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Ngou a hongaurire anu ku mukunda ci a ambe ci: “Shime twaa mu yuva o ku yengwera Mushe na Nyambi.” <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Eyi ya anthzipithsire anu nakuru narongithsi o murao. A kwatire Setefani no ku mu purututa ku mu twara mu Nthzango.<verse eid="ACT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />A retire mambangi o mbango awa ambire ci: “Oyu munu oyu thsikati thsothsihe aa yengweranga thzino Tembere thzo shokenu no murao wa Mushe. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Inene shime twaa mu yuva o ku amba ci: ‘Oyu Yesu wa Nazareta kenge a ku umburura thzino Tembere no ku pirura ethsemwa eyi a tu thsierire Mushe!’”<verse eid="ACT 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Wahe awa ekarire mu Nthzango a rupukerire Setefani, a monine ci rupara rwenthzi rwa monaharire eci ro kangeru.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CC, HS, CT, TA</para>
  <para style="s1">Eyi a ambire Setefani mu Nthzango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Mupurisita shokuru ngou epurire Setefani ci: “Ene eyi ne ya shemwa nji?”<verse eid="ACT 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Setefani aye wa tawire ci: “Amwe mwaenthzange namwe mwatata, mu ni teerere nawa! Nyambi o kutethzima wa monaharire kwa mukwathsañuru wetu Aburahama, o ku di mu ditunga dya Mesopotamia, o ku shime ku thza ku mbongi thza Harani. <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />Nyambi wa amberire Aburahama ci: ‘O thsie ditunga dyoe nanuoe, o thze ku ditunga edi ni ku monithsa.’<verse eid="ACT 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />“Ngou a tundire mu ditunga dyo Makaladea no ku thza ku Harani o ku a ka tungire. Munyima thzo kufa kwa tata wenthzi, Nyambi wa mu yarukithserire muno mu ditunga mu na tungu rerodino.<verse eid="ACT 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />“Unone Nyambi ka a mu pire ku tambura edi ditunga, shaanga ndau thzo ku kuma pa muro o diuru. Unone Nyambi wa kumbwethzire ku di mu pa aye nanahokenthzi munyima thzenthzi, shaanga ci mwethsiya thsikati Aburahama ka ekarire no mwana. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Nyambi wa mu amberire kenge ci: ‘Anahokoe kenge a ku kekara matundakure mu ditunga dyadyo, karo kenge a ku ka pikuriwa, no ku nyandithsiwa mu myaka thzo dikumi dyo makumi ane.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Nyambi wa ambire ci: ‘Uno honi kenge na ku ratura diya ditunga dya ku wa pikura, karo munyima thzeyo kenge a ku tunda muya mu ditunga no ku na ni rombera muno mu ndau.’<verse eid="ACT 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />“Nyambi wa cikwatire thsiyuvano thso mukanda na Aburahama. Aburahama ou erekire Isaka, wa mu twarire ku mukanda munyima thzo mayuwa o mutanu na ahatu ku tunda pa kwerekiwa kwenthzi. Isaka ou erekire Jakovo naye wa kwamine kengeyo, Jakovo naye wa kwamine kengeyo kwatata wetu o dikumi naidi.<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />“Awa akwathsañuruetu a tenderire mbamba mino Josefa, ngou a mu urithsire kupika ku ditunga dya Egepita. Unone Nyambi wekarire nenthzi, <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />no ku mu patura ku makando enthzi oahe. Nyambi wa mu pire onyanyami no ku hemiwa nene kwa fumu Faro o mu Egepita. Faro wa mu pire ku endithsa ditunga dya Egepita no thsikuña thsenthzi thsothsihe.<verse eid="ACT 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />“Uno honi kwekarire ndombo mu Egepita yomuhe no mu Kanana. Kwekarire kunyanda kokukuru, akwathsañuruetu a kwangire dyo ku wana edya. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Unone Jakovo ou a yuvire ci ko i di edya ku Egepita, wa tumineko akwathsañuruetu ro kutanga ci a ka ureko. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Ou a wa tumine ro muthsidi, Josefa wa ka citongorire kwakurwenthzi noku kwaminenthzi Benjamini, karo mukuta wa Josefa awopo u dimukiwa kwa Faro. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Munyima thzeyo, Josefa wa raire ci tata wenthzi Jakovo a ka retiwe no rupathsi rwenthzi roruhe. Ku wa pakerera a kumine mu makumi o mutanu na edi nanu mutanu (75). <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Jakovo ngou a urumukire ku thza ku Egepita, oku a ka fererire aye nakwathsañuruetu. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Ethzimbi yo ya huthsiwangire ku Shekemu no ku pakiwa mu mararo aa a urire Aburahama ko taro thzo madi o silivera kwana Hamori mu Shekemu.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />“Thsikati ou thsa kokerire po pepi ci i citombore eyi a kumbwethzire Nyambi Aburahama, thsipani thsanuetu mu Egepita thsa vurire nene. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Ngou kwa shwanine fumu yumweya mu Egepita oyu wa kanine ku dimuka thsimweya keyi ya Josefa. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Wangerire no ku nyandithsa nene anuetu, no ku ootera akwathsañuruetu ku konthza tumbu two ci tu fe. <verse eid="ACT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />Mwethsiya thsikati Mushe werekiwire, wekarire mwana o muwa nene pa meho a Nyambi. Shime a reriwerire mu nthzio thza tata wenthzi maonda ahatu. <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />Ou a punithsiwire pora, mwana Faro o mbuyama wa mu shimbire no ku mu rera kwikara mwanenthzi. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Mushe wa rongithsiwire onyanyami ouhe o Maegepita, karo wekarire nokoro mu kuamba no mwitenda.<verse eid="ACT 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />“Mushe o ku di no myaka thzo makumi ane, wa anekerire ku hungerithsa aenthzenthzi Maisiraele. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Wa monine Muegepita o kwipithsera Muisiraele, wa amwenine Muisiraele muenthzenthzi, naye sho ku huthsera ku fura Muegepita no ku mwipaa. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Mushe shime a anekerire ci Maisiraele aenthzenthzi nga nangurire ci Nyambi shime a cikwathsithsire aye ku wa patura, unone awo ka i nangurire. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Diyuwa edi dya randireko, Mushe wa wanine Maisiraele aidi o kwa rwa. Wa erekire ku wa ninga ci a ciyuve no ku wa ambera ci: ‘Amwe mwanu, amwe po mo mu mukuta wenu, ine eyi mu cikurwera?’<verse eid="ACT 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />“Unone oyu wepithserire muenthzenthzi wa thsindekire Mushe no ku amba ci: ‘Edye naa ku tende muendithsi no mukwakuratura peuru thzetu? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Ene waa fota ku nipaa eci diya no wipaa oya Muegepita yana nji?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Mushe ou a yuvire kengeyo, wa cirerire ku ditunga dya Midiani oku a kekarire mutundakure, kodiyo a kerekerire ana aidi wakwerume.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />“Ou kwa pitire myaka thzo makumi ane, kangeru ka hokokire kwa Mushe mu mirengi mu thsipukumuna ethsi thsa yuumine mu dikunguthsitu pepi no Mukinya wa Sinai. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Mushe ou a monine eyi, wa komokire. Ou a henyenineko ci a mone nawa, wa yuvire diywi dya Fumu o ku di amba ci: <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />‘Yame no Nyambi wakwathsañuru oe, Nyambi wa Aburahama, wa Isaka na Jakovo!’ Mushe wa cishutukire ko wowa, ka a keshukire shaanga ku kengako. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Fumu Nyambi ngou a mu amberire ci: ‘O shupure mashangu kwidyato yoe, inene apo pa ndau o nemana po muve oukenu. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Ni na mono shemwa dikando dyanuange mu Egepita, karo ni na yuvu thsishiro thso. Yodiyo ni na keyera ku na wa patura. Pano honi owe kenge ni ku tuma ci o huke ku Egepita.’<verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />“Oyu Mushe a kanine ko ku amba ci: ‘Edye oyu naa ku tende muendithsi no mukwakuratura mu kaci ketu?’ Yodiyo a tumine Nyambi kwikara muendithsi no muyoyithsi wo, ko kangeru aka ka hokokire ku kwenthzi mu thsipukumuna thso ku yuuma. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Mushe wa tangererire Maisiraele ku tunda mu ditunga dya Egepita, wa tendire ekomokithsa nemonithso mu Egepita, mu Diwate Dyodikihu no mu dikunguthsitu, mu myaka thzo makumi ane.<verse eid="ACT 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />“Mushe yodiyo wa amberire Maisiraele ci: ‘Nyambi kenge a ku mi tumena mukwakukethza eci ame o mu mukuta wenu.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Yodiyo oya wekarire mu mbunga thzanua Nyambi mu dikunguthsitu no kaya kangeru ka ambire nenthzi pa Mukinya wa Sinai, karo ka ambire nakwathsañuruetu. Wa tamburire maywi o mwoyo no ku na a tu pa.<verse eid="ACT 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />“Unone akwathsañuruetu ka mu yuverire, a mu kanine karo mu micima thzo a hukire ku Egepita. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />A amberire Aroni ci: ‘O tu kwamene anyambi awa a tu tangerera, inene oyu Mushe naa ka tu tundithsa mu ditunga dya Egepita po ka tu dimuka eyi i na ka tendahara ku kwenthzi.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Mo aya mayuwa ngou a cikwamenine thsikupuro thso pohoana karo a thsi kwamenine thsiyambero no thsidika ku nyanyukera ekwama yo moko o. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Unone Nyambi wa wa pire muongo no ku wa thsia ci a rombere matungwethzi o ku wiru, eci edi i na ñoriwa mu vuka thzakwakukethza ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">“ ‘Amwe mwana Isiraele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">ene kadi yame mwa kwamenine eyambero no nupu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">mu myaka thzo makumi ane mu dikunguthsitu?<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Shime mwa shimbire diyambero dya Moloki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">no ditungwethzi dya nyambi wenu Refani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">ekupuro eyi mwa kwamine ku i rombera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">Mweyo, kenge na ku mi yarukithsera</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">ku thsambwadiya thzo ditunga dya Babilona.’<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />“Akwathsañuruetu shime ekarire no tende thzombangi mu dikunguthsitu. Shime thza kwamiwire komu a i raererire Nyambi kwa Mushe ku thza ko thsikupuro ethsi a monine. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Ethzo tende thza tamburiwire kwakwathsañuruetu awa a randireko, awa ekarire na Joshua uya a kuparire uya muve a wa pire Nyambi, omu a rundurire Anukenge awa a tungiremo. Ethzo tende thzekariremo shime ku na kuma mu thsikati thsa Fumu Davida, <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />oyu wa wanine thsihemo kwa Nyambi, karo Davida wa rombire ci a umbere Nyambi wa Jakovo ditungo. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Unone Solomoni yowa thzi mu umberire.<verse eid="ACT 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />“Uno honi Nyambi o Kuthzinama Nene ka a yoya mu manthzio o ku kwamiwa ko moko anu. Eci edi a amba mukwakukethza ci:<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />“ ‘Diwiru po thzodiyo ngunja thzange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">kaye po thsipura thso mauru ange.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Nthzio thzo ngepi ethzi nga mu ni umbera?’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">kwaa amba Fumu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">‘Nji ndau thzo ngepi thzo diturumwithsero dyange?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Ene kadi moko ange ombire diwiru no kaye neyi i dimo yoihe?’<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />“Amwe mwakwa mukanayuva, o micima no matwi o kukana ku yuva oshemwa! Mwaa cipitura eci akwathsañuruenu, mwaa kanenanga Mupepo Oukenu thsikati thsothsihe! <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Yupi mukwakukethza oyu a kanine ku nyandithsa akwathsañuruenu? Epaire shaanga awa okethzire yo kukeya koyu o Muwawa, aye Mesiya oyu na mu kwatithsa no ku mwipaa! <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Amwe mwa tamburire murao wa Nyambi ou twa retire tungeru twenthzi, unone mwaa kana ku u hengeka.”<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kufa kwa Setefani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Aendithsi o Majuda ou a yuvire eyi a ambire Setefani, a anthzipire nene no ku cihuma nwaeo. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Unone Setefani ko kuyara Mupepo Oukenu wa kengererire ku wiru. Wa monine kutethzima kwa Nyambi no Yesu o ku nemana ku dyoko dyo rudyo dya Nyambi. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Setefani wa ambire ci: “Mu mone! Naa mona diwiru di na yanthzururiwa no Mwana Munu o ku nemana ku dyoko dya Nyambi dyo rudyo.”<verse eid="ACT 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Unone ou a yuvire kengeyo, a civukire mu matwi no ku kumba ko diywi dyodikuru o kwa cirera ku kwenthzi. <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />A mu purututire ku mu tundithsa mu mbongi no ku tateka ku mu povaura no mawe. Mambangi ngou a pakire ekoveyo yo yo peuru ku mauru o mushumba oyu nethsiwa Saule. <figure style="fig" alt="Stephen is stoned to death" file="cn02154b.tif" size="span" loc="Act 7:54-60" copy="Cook" ref="7.54-60">Setefani aa povauriwa no mawe</figure><verse eid="ACT 7:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />O kwa mu povaura kengeyo, Setefani wa romberire ci: “Fumu Yesu, o tambure mupepo wange.” <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Wa tongamine ku manwi no ku kumba ko diywi dyodikuru ci: “Fumu, wa wa pakera ethsi thsivi.” Ou a manine ku amba kengeyo wa fire.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CC, HS, CT, TA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Saule wa tawethzire kwipaiwa kwa Setefani.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="ACT 8:1">Kereke thzaa nyandithsiwa no ku shandoka</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Ku tunda edyo diyuwa, kereke thzo mu Yerusalema thza nyandithsiwire nene, akwakutawa wahe a panthzaanine ku thza mu matunga a Judea na Samaria, shime tunganda to twa thsiarire. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Akwerume awa a cipakire kwa Nyambi a ka vumbekire Setefani no ku mu dira nene.<verse eid="ACT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Unone Saule wa tatekire ku hanyahanya kereke. Wa thzire mu nthzio no nthzio ku ka purututa akwakutawa wakwerume nambuyama no ku wa paka mu kamenga.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Filipu aa rongithsa mu Samaria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Awo akwakutawa a panthzaanine shime a thzire o honga diywi dya Nyambi kokuhe oku a thzire. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Filipu wa urumukire ku thza mu mbongi thzo mu Samaria. Wa ka hongiremo ya Mesiya. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Anu owangi a takamithsire ku teerera ku maywi a Filipu ou a yuvire no ku mona emonithso eyi a kwamine. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Mipepo thzothzimango thza tundire kwanu owangi o ku thzi thza o kumba, karo anu wekunga nerema owangi a porithsiwire. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Mweyo, kwekarire thsinyanyu thsothsikuru omo mu mbongi.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Simoni o masheno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Uno honi kwekarire mukwerume o dithzina dyo Simoni omo mu mbongi oyu wa komokithsangire anu o mu Samaria ko masheno enthzi mu myaka thzothzingi. Shime a cinunekangire ci munu o mukuru mu thsivaka. <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />Anu wahe, akuru nanuke a mu twarerire nene maano, no ku amba ci: “Oyu mukwerume yodiyo okoro wa Nyambi ou u nethsiwa ci Oukuru.” <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />A mu twarerire nene maano inene wa shimbire thsikati thsothsire o ku wa komokithsanga ko masheno enthzi.<verse eid="ACT 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Uno honi anu ou a tawire Filipu ou a hongire yo Muthzimbu Ouwa o Kutumina kwa Nyambi no dithzina dya Yesu Krisitu, akwerume nambuyama a korovethziwire. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Mane naye Simoni wa tawire no ku korovethziwa. Wekarangire pofoci na Filipu, karo wa komokangire emonithso nekomokithsa yoikuru eyi naa kwamanga.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Tunganda to mu Yerusalema ou twa yuvire ci akwa Samaria a na tambura diywi dya Nyambi, a tumineko Peturu na Johani. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Ou a ka kumineko a ka wa rombererire ci a tambure Mupepo Oukenu, <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />inene Mupepo Oukenu o ku shime ku tura shaanga pa munu yofoci kukwo, unone shime a korovethziwire pohuma mu dithzina dya Fumu Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />A Peturu na Johani ngou a wa kambekire moko o, awopo a tambura Mupepo Oukenu.<verse eid="ACT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Simoni ou a monine ci Mupepo wa piwire kwakwakutawa ko ku wa kambeka moko tunganda, wa wa pire madi ci a ure oo okoro. <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />Wa ambire ci: “Name mu ni peko oku kukoro ci munu yomuhe oyu na ku kambeka moko ange a ku wane Mupepo Oukenu!”<verse eid="ACT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Peturu wa mu tawire ci: “O fe no madi oe, owe ne waa anekera ci thsipa thsa Nyambi kenge nga o thsi ura no madi! <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Ko piwa shaanga kacimbi mweyino ekwama, inene mucima woe kadi uwawa pa meho a Nyambi. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />O cere mwitenda yoe karo o rombere kwa Fumu, kuinashimi kenge a ku tetera mwianekera yo mucima woe. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Inene naa mona ci o na yara ndurungera, karo o nangiwa kumango.”<verse eid="ACT 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Simoni ngou a tawire ci: “Mu ni romberereko kwa Fumu yoyamwe ci eyi mu na amba katere i tendahare ku kwange.”<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Ou a manine ku pa ombangi no ku honga diywi dya Fumu, Peturu na Johani a hukire ku Yerusalema. A thzire o honga Muthzimbu Ouwa mu maumbo oangi a Samaria.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Filipu no nduna o Muetiopia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Kangeru ka Fumu ngou ka amberire Filipu ci: “O katuke o thze ku mboera ku mukwakwa o mu dikunguthsitu ou u urumuka ku tunda ku Yerusalema ku thza ku Gaza.” <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Ngou a thzire, mu dikuñwa wa ciwanine no Muetiopia. Oyo mukwerume po nedi nduna o mukuru mu thsivaka, yodiyo wekarire mukwakunyunga rufumo rwa fumu o mbuyama Kandase o ditunga dya Etiopia. Shime a tundire ku Yerusalema oku a thzire ku ka rombera. <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />Apo honi o ku huka, o ku nekara mu ditemba dyenthzi o ku tara ko ku tanarithsa mu vuka thza mukwakukethza Isaya. <figure style="fig" alt="Philip meets the Ethiopian eunich" file="wa03956b.tif" size="span" loc="Act 8:26-30" copy="Wade" ref="8.26-30">Filipu aa ciwana no nduna o Muetopia</figure><verse eid="ACT 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Mupepo Oukenu wa amberire Filipu ci: “O henyene oko ku ditemba, o ka endere ku nyonga thzadyo.” <verse eid="ACT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Filipu ngou a cirerire oko ku ditemba no ku yuva oyu mukwerume o ku tara mu vuka thza mukwakukethza Isaya. Filipu wa mwipurire ci: “Ene waa i yuvithsithsa eyi o tara?”<verse eid="ACT 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Wa tawire ci: “Ngepi nga ni i yuvithsithsa, shime ci munu a i ni tongwenene.” Ngou a rombire Filipu ci a thzine mu ditemba a kekare nenthzi.<verse eid="ACT 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Eyi a varire omo mu Mañoro po eyi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">“Aa cipitura eci dingu edi di twariwa ku ka paiwa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">Karo aa cipitura eci dinguana dyo kukana ku dira o ku di keriwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">ka a ambire thsimweya.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Wa shwahuriwire karo wa tendiwire dipethso.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Edye nga tongonona yanahokenthzi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Pakuninga ci mwoyo wenthzi wa shimbiwire pano pashi.”<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Oyo nduna wepurire Filipu ci: “O ni tongwere eyi a ambire mukwakukethza, ene yenthzi nji ya munu wao?” <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Filipu ngou a mu tongwenenine ku tatekera kao Mañoro ao, no ku mu tongwera yo Muthzimbu Ouwa wa Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />O kwa enda kengeyo omo mu mukwakwa a kumine apa kwekarire meyu. Oya nduna wa amberire Filipu ci: “O mone, meyu aa! Thsine thsi ni kwangithsa ku korovethziwa?” <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />[Filipu wa tawire ci: “Kamona o tawa ko mucima woe ouhe waa twethsa ku korovethziwa.” Aye wa tawire ci: “Naa tawa ci Yesu Krisitu po Mwana Nyambi.”]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka thzi di mu mañoro kutanga.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Wa tuminine ci ditemba dimane. Filipu noyo nduna ngou a urumukire mu meyu momu widi wo, oyo nduna ayepo korovethziwa.<verse eid="ACT 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Ou ombokire mu meyu, Mupepo wa Fumu wa twarire Filipu kwako, oya nduna ka a mu monine karo, unone wa shumunine mu ruendo rwenthzi o ku na nyanyuka nene. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Unone Filipu wa ka ciwanine mu mbongi thza Azoto. Wa ka thzire o honga Muthzimbu Ouwa mu mambongi oahe mane shime ku ka kuma ku Sesarea. <figure style="fig" file="GPS_Philip's Travels B&amp;W-final2.tif" size="col" ref="8.4-40" /><verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CC, HS, CT, TA</para>
  <para style="s1">Saule aa piruka Mukrisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">Ete 22.6-16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26.12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Mwethso thsikati Saule wa cikanyine kwipaa erongwa ya Fumu, wa thzire kwa mupurisita shokuru. <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />Wa ka rombireko mañoro o ku thza nao ku masinagoge o mu Damaseka ci ngeci waa ka wane anu, akwerume nji ambuyama awa shupwera Dikuñwa dya Fumu Yesu, a ka wange no ku wa reta mu kamenga mu Yerusalema. <figure style="fig" alt="Paul on the Damascus road" file="cn02023c.tif" size="span" loc="Act 9:1-7" copy="Cook" ref="9.1-7">Paulu o ku di mu dikuñwa ku thza ku Damaseka</figure><verse eid="ACT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />O ku di mu dikuñwa kengeyo, o ku kokera ku Damaseka, popo mumunyi o kwethsa nene wa tundire ku wiru wa munekire ku mu paka mu kaci. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Wa wererire pashi, karo wa yuvire diywi edi dya mu amberire ci: “Saule, Saule, ine eyi o ni nyandithsera?”<verse eid="ACT 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Saule wepurire ci: “Yowe odye, Fumu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:5">Aye wa tawire ci: “Yame no Yesu oyu o nyandithsa. <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />O katuke honi o thze mu mbongi, kenge o ka tongweriwa eyi o na roera ku tenda.”<verse eid="ACT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Akwerume awa endire na Saule emanine pohuma kuruu, a yuvire diywi, unone kwithsa oyu a monine. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Saule wa katukire pashi, unone ou a kengire ka a twethsire ku mona thsinu. Ngou a mu kwatererire ku dyoko no ku mu twara mu Damaseka. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Wa shimbire mayuwa ahatu kwithsa ku mona, nji ku dya no ku nwa.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Omo mu Damaseka mwekarire thsirongwa thso dithzina dyo Ananiasi. Fumu wa mu amberire mu thsimona ci: “Ananiasi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:10">Aye wa tawire ci: “Yamono, Fumu.” <verse eid="ACT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Fumu wa mu amberire ci: “O katuke o thze mu Mukwakwa o Kuoroka ku nthzio thza Judasi, o kepureko munu oyu naa tundu ku Tarese o dithzina dyo Saule, yoyu rombera pano. <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />O na mono mu thsimona mukwerume o dithzina dyo Ananiasi o ku keya no ku na mu kambeka moko ci a mone karo.”<verse eid="ACT 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Ananiasi wa tawire ci: “Fumu, na ni yuvu kwanu owangi etenda yoyu munu neyi yoimango eyi naa tende kwanuoe owakenu mu Yerusalema. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Naa keya kuno nokoro o ku tunda kwakuru o mapurisita ku nanga anuoe wahe a wethsa pa dithzina dyoe.”<verse eid="ACT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Unone Fumu wa tawire Ananiasi ci: “O thze, inene oyu munu ni na mu hangura ku twara dithzina dyange kwAnukenge, ku mafumu no ku Maisiraele. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Karo kenge na ku mu monithsa ci a ku kuma kupi makando aa a na roera ku nyanda mukaci ko dithzina dyange.”<verse eid="ACT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Ananiasi ngou a thzire no ku kengena omo mu nthzio. Wa ka kambekire moko Saule, no ku amba ci: “Shadi Saule, Fumu Yesu oyu naa hokoka ku koe mu dikuñwa o ku keya kuno yo na ni tumu ci nga o twethse ku mona karo, no ku ninga ci o yare Mupepo Oukenu.” <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Popo enu yo ku pitura eci nyathzi ya tundire mu meho a Saule, ayepo mona karo. Ngou emanine no ku korovethziwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />Ou a manine ku dya wa tanarire.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="ACT 9:19">Saule mu Damaseka no mu Yerusalema</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Saule wekarire mayuwa oapu nerongwa mu Damaseka. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Popo wa tatekire ku honga mu masinagoge ci Yesu po Mwana Nyambi.<verse eid="ACT 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Wahe awa mu yuvire a komokire no ku cipura ci: “Oyu ne kadi yodiyo oya naa nyandithsanga dyodimango anu awa ethsa podi dithzina mu Yerusalema? Ene kadi yodiyo na a keyera kuno oyu, ku na wa twara kwakuru o mapurisita o kwa nangiwa?”<verse eid="ACT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Unone Saule wa twarire ku rupara ku koropa nene, mane shaanga Majuda o mu Damaseka a kwangire dyo ku kana erongithsa yenthzi yo kuninga ci Yesu po yodiyo Mesiya.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Ou kwa pitire mayuwa oangi, Majuda a ciwanine no ku yongora kwipaa Saule. <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Uno honi wa dimukire eanekera yo. Awo shime mundamenangire pa mathsero o mbongi othsiku no mutenya ci a mwipae. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Unone diyuwa dimweya othsiku, erongwa yenthzi ya mu pakire mu diyongo no ku mu shurumwena mu diporwa dyo pa dimota dyo mbongi.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Saule mu Yerusalema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Saule ou a kumine mu Yerusalema wa erekire ku cipakerera naenthzenthzi erongwa, unone wahe a mu yapire inene ka tawire ci naye nedi thsirongwa shemwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Unone Banabasi wa mu shimbire no ku mu twara ku tunganda. Wa ka tongwerire tunganda ya Saule edi a monine Fumu o ku thza ku Damaseka nedi a ambaurire nenthzi Fumu. Karo wa wa tongwerire edi a ka hongire kondume mu dithzina dya Yesu mu Damaseka.<verse eid="ACT 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Ku tunda ethso thsikati Saule wekarangireno. Wa endaurire mu Yerusalema momuhe o ku thza o rongithsa mu dithzina dya Fumu kondume. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Wa ambaurangire no ku cikanyekanga no Majuda awa ambire Thsigerike, ambene awo shime fotangire ku mwipaa. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Akwakutawa ou a i yuvire eyo, a mu thsindekethzire ku Sesarea ci a ka thze ku diumbo dyenthzi ku Tarese.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Mweyo kereke thzekarire mu thsiyaro mu ditunga dyodihe dya Judea no mu Galilea na Samaria. Thza tanarithsiwire, nakwakutawa a yoyire ko ku yapa Fumu. Ko ku tanarithsiwa ku Mupepo Oukenu, kereke thza vurerire anu.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peturu aa porithsa Enea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Peturu o ku thza o pitapitamo, wa thzire ku ka hungerithsa akwakutawa o mu Lida. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Oko wa ka wanineko mukwerume o dithzina dyo Enea oyu wa kukuterire erama myaka thzo mutanu na thzihatu o ku di podidi. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Peturu wa mu amberire ci: “Enea, Yesu Krisitu a ku porithse, o katuke o yarure odidi woe!” Popo wa katukire. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Anu wahe o mu Lida no mu Saroni a i monine awopo a thsiurukera kwa Fumu.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dokasi aa pinduriwa kwafu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Mu mbongi thza Jopa kwekarire thsirongwa o mbuyama o dithzina dyo Tabita nji ci Dokasi mu Thsigerike. Mwikati yoihe shime a tendangire enu yoiwa no ku kwathsa ahepwe. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Mwao mayuwa shime a korire no ku fa. Anu a yoire thsithzimbi no ku thsi paka mu koroi. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Pakuninga ci mbongi thza Lida thza cihatire nethzi thza Jopa, erongwa ou ya yuvire ci Peturu po mu Lida a di, ya tumineko akwerume aidi ku ka mu romba ci: “O adikane o yokorore o thze netu ku Jopa.”<verse eid="ACT 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Peturu wa katukire no ku thzano. Ou a ka kumine a ka mu twarire ku koroi. Mafakathzi oahe a mu konganenine o kwa dira, a mu monithsire ekoveyo no macanthzi eyi a wa rukerangire Dokasi o ku yoya. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Peturu wa punithserire anu wahe pora, wa tongamine no ku rombera. Ngou a thsiurukerire ku thsithzimbi no ku amba ci: “Tabita, o pinduke!” Tabita wa kengire, ou a monine Peturu wa pindukire no kwikara. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Peturu wa mu kwatire ku dyoko ku mu kwathsa ci emane. Ngou ethsire akwakutawa no mafakathzi no ku u wa pa o ku yoya.<verse eid="ACT 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Eyi ya yukire mu mbongi thza Jopa thzothzihe, karo anu owangi a tawire kwa Fumu. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Peturu wekarire mu Jopa mayuwa oangi ku nthzio thza mukwerume oyu nethsiwa Simoni mukwakunyuka etumba.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CC, HS, CT, TA</para>
  <para style="s1">Koneliasi aethsa Peturu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Mu mbongi thza Sesarea, kwekarire mukwerume o dithzina dyo Koneliasi, nedi muendithsi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Diywi dyo Thsigerike dyaa amba muendithsi o mashwarare o makumi o dikumi.</char></note> o mashwarare o Maroma, o ku ditunga dya Itali. <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Aye no mwanda wenthzi ouhe a cipakire kwa Nyambi no ku mu yapa. Wa pangire ekwathsa yoingi kwahepwe, no ku romberanga Nyambi thsikati thsothsihe. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Diyuwa dimweya runguro ko thsikati thso muthsihatu, wa monine thsimona, kangeru ka Nyambi ka keyire ku kwenthzi, no ku mwithsa ci: “Koneliasi!”<verse eid="ACT 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Ko ku yapa nene, Koneliasi wa rupukerire ako kangeru no ku tawa ci: “Fumu, ine?” Kangeru ka mu tawire ci: “Nyambi o na tambura erombero yoe nekwathsa yoe kwahepwe eci nupu. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />O tume anu ku mbongi thza Jopa a kethse mukwerume o dithzina dyo Simoni Peturu, <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />o mwenda oyu di ku nthzio thza Simoni mukwakunyuka etumba, oyu na tungera ku kakuro ko diwate.”<verse eid="ACT 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Ou ka thzire ako kangeru ka ambire nenthzi, Koneliasi wethsire aidi kwangambenthzi, no dishwarare dimweya edi dya cipakire kwa Nyambi koa a mu nyungangire. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Wa wa tongwerire yoihe eyi ya tendaharire, no ku wa tuma ku Jopa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Thsimona thsa Peturu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Diyuwa edi dya randireko awa tumiwire o kwa kokera ku Jopa, Peturu wa thzinine pa thsituwa thso kuyaramana thso nthzio ku ka rombera. Apo, nedi diyuwa o ku di di pa kaci ko mutwi. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Karo wa fire nthzara no ku fota ci nga na di. Uno honi o kwa mu kwamena edya kengeyo, wa monine thsimwithso. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Wa monine diwiru o ku di na yanthzuruka, no thsinu thso ku pitura eci dimbatu dyodikuru o ku thsi shurumuka pashi ko mikono thzathso thzine. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Mu kaci kadyo kwekarire mishovo thzothzihe thzeyama neharawi yo pa kaye nenyunyi yo mu wiru. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Diywi ngou dya mu amberire ci: “Peturu, o katuke! O wipae, o dye!”<figure style="fig" alt="Peter's vision of unclean animals" file="wa03963b.tif" size="col" loc="Act 10:9-16" copy="Wade" ref="10.9-16">Thsimona thsa Peturu thseyama yo kukana kukena</figure><verse eid="ACT 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Unone Peturu wa tawire ci: “Fumu, dyombo! Na diyerire ku dya yo kukana kukena, yo dithziro.”<verse eid="ACT 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Edyo diywi ngou dya mu amberire ro muthsidi ci: “Ethsi a na kenithsa Nyambi, wa thsi ninga ci kadi thsikenu.”<verse eid="ACT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Eyi ya tendaharire miendo thzihatu, mbeci honi di huthseriwe ku wiru.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Peturu o ku cikupaura ci ethso thsimona ne thsaa amba ine, awaya anu a tumine Koneliasi a wanine nthzio thza Simoni ko kwipaura, a nemanine pa thsero. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Ethsire no kwipura ci: “Ene kuno ku nthzio thzenu ne kwaa di mwenda oyu nethsiwa Simoni Peturu?”<verse eid="ACT 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Peturu o ku cikupaura kengeyo thsiya thsimona, Mupepo Oukenu wa mu amberire ci: “Kwa di akwerume ahatu awa ku fotafota. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />O katuke o shuruke o thzeno ko kukana ku tamangera, inene yame ni na wa tumu.”<verse eid="ACT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Peturu wa shurukire ku thzako, wa wa amberire ci: “Yame oyu mu fotafota. Ine mu neyera?”<verse eid="ACT 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />A tawire ci: “Koneliasi, muendithsi o mashwarare o Maroma na tu tumu. Munu o muwawa karo wa ku yapa Nyambi, aa remekiwa ku ditunga dyodihe dyo Majuda wahe. Kangeru kokakenu na ka mu ambera ci a kwithse o thze ku nthzio thzenthzi ci a ka yuve eyi o ka amba.” <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Peturu ngou a wa tamburire no ku wa twara mu nthzio kwikara endenthzi.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="ACT 10:23">Peturu mu nthzio thza Koneliasi</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Ou dya vire diyuwa wa thzireno, akwakutawa amweya o mu Jopa a thzire nenthzi.<verse eid="ACT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Diyuwa edi dya randireko, a ka kumine mu Sesarea. Koneliasi shime a wa tatererire, wa kongire apenthzi nambushenthzi. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Peturu ou engenine mu nthzio, Koneliasi wa mu shambawerire no ku tongama ku mauru enthzi, ku mu pa direma. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Unone Peturu wa mwimanithsire no ku mu ambera ci: “O wimane, name no munu o ku pitura eci owe.”<verse eid="ACT 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />O ku ambaura nenthzi kengeyo, Peturu wengenine mu nthzio no ku wana anu owangi o kwa na kongana. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Peturu ngou a wa amberire ci: “Amwe mwathsinda mu na dimuka nawa ci murao wetu o Thsijuda ka u tu tawethzire ku cipakerera nji kwingena mu nthzio thzo Munukenge. Unone Nyambi naa ni monithsa kuninga ci ka ni roerire ku toya munu ci kadi mukenu nji ci wa dithziro. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Mweyo, uya na ni kethsiwa na ni keya ko kukana ku kana. Pano honi mu ni tongwere eyi mu na ka nithsera.”<verse eid="ACT 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Koneliasi wa tawire ci: “Na ku piti mayuwa ane pohuma ko thsino thsikati, ko thsikati thso muthsihatu runguro o ku ni rombera mu nthzio thzange. Popo mukwerume oyu wa vatire yo kutethzima wa nemanine pa rupara rwange. <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />Wa ni amberire ci: ‘Koneliasi, Nyambi na yuvu erombero yoe no ku vuruka ekwathsa yoe kwahepwe. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />O tume anu ku mbongi thza Jopa ci a ka shimbe mukwerume o dithzina dyo Simoni Peturu. Shime naa turera ku nthzio thza Simoni o mukwakunyuka etumba oyu na tungera ku kakuro ko diwate.’ <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Yodiyo na ni tumena anu ko wanguwangu, i na roo uno o na keya. Mweyo honi, tu na kongana twahe pano pa rupara rwa Nyambi ci tu yuve yoihe eyi no raereriwa kwa Fumu.”<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Erongithsa ya Peturu mu nthzio thza Koneliasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Peturu ngou a tatekire ku amba ci: “Pano ni na dimuka honi shemwa ci Nyambi ka a wana mavwevwe, <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />unone aa tambura anu o matunga oahe awa a na mu yapa no ku tenda enu eyi i na roera. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Mu na dimuka muthzimbu ou a tumine Nyambi kwanua Isiraele, ao Muthzimbu Ouwa o thsiyaro ka Yesu Krisitu, aye Fumu wanu wahe. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Mu na dimuka eyi ya tendaharire mu ditunga dyodihe dya Judea, eyi ya tatekerire mu ditunga dya Galilea, munyima thzo korovethzo thziya a hongire Johani. <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Karo mu na dimuka ci Nyambi wa wethsire Yesu wa Nazareta ko Mupepo Oukenu nokoro. Wa thzire o kwama yoiwa no ku porithsa wahe awa a nyandithsiwire kwa shamaonga, inene Nyambi wekarire nenthzi.<verse eid="ACT 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />“Atwe po twa mambangi weyi enu yoihe a tendire mu ditunga dyo Majuda no mu Yerusalema. A mwipaire ko ku mwamba pa mbinda, <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />unone Nyambi wa mu pindurire kwafu mu diyuwa dyo muthsihatu no ku mu monaharithsa. <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />Ka a hokokire kwanu wahe unone shime ku kwetu atwe twa hanguriwire kwa Nyambi kwikara mambangi, atwe twa dire no ku nwa nenthzi munyima thzo kupinduka kwenthzi kwafu. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Wa tu raererire ci tu honge anu no ku pa ombangi ci yodiyo naa hanguriwa kwa Nyambi kwikara dihako wayumi nafu. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Yodiyo oyu a pire ombangi keyi yenthzi akwakukethza wahe ci yomuhe o ku tawa ku kwenthzi kenge a ku teteriwa evi yenthzi mu dithzina dyenthzi.”<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anukenge aa tambura Mupepo Oukenu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Peturu o ku amba eyi, Mupepo Oukenu wa shurumukerire panu wahe, awa teererire aa maywi. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Akwakutawa o Majuda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Majuda awa thza ku mukanda.</char></note> awa keyire na Peturu a komokire ou a monine thsipa thso Mupepo Oukenu o ku thsi piwa kongi noku kwAnukenge. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Inene shime a wa yuvire o kwa amba madimi no ku shangara Nyambi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:46">Peturu ngou a ambire ci: <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />“Ene kwaa di oyu nga wa kanithsa ci a korovethziwa ko meyu nji? Inene nawo a na tambura Mupepo Oukenu, eci dyodi na tu mu tambura atwe.” <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Ngou a raererire ci a korovethziwe mu dithzina dya Yesu Krisitu. Ou ya pwire eyo a rombire Peturu ci ekareno mu mayuwa oapu.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="rem">TC, HS, CC, CT, TA</para>
  <para style="s1">Peturu a tongonona ekwama yenthzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Tunganda nakwakutawa o mu Judea yomuhe a yuvire ci Anukenge nawo na tambura diywi dya Nyambi. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Mweyo, Peturu ou a hukire ku Yerusalema, a ka mu shomororire akwakutawa awa thza ku mukanda. <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />Awo ci: “Shime waa ka hungerithsa anu o kukana ku thza ku mukanda no ku ka dyano.”<verse eid="ACT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Peturu ngou a tatekire ku wa tongonwena yoihe edi ya ka tendaharire. <verse eid="ACT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />Wa ambire ci: “O ku ni di mu mbongi thza Jopa o ku ni rombera, na monine thsimona mu thsimwithso. Na monine thsinu thso ku pitura eci dimbatu dyodikuru o ku thsi shurumuka ku tunda ku wiru ko mikono thzathso thzine. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Ou na rondororiremo nawa na moninemo eyama yo kaye, ekondwama, eharawi, nenyunyi yo mu wiru. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Ngou na yuvire diywi edi dya ni amberire ci: ‘Peturu, o katuke, o pae o dye!’<verse eid="ACT 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />“Unone na tawire ci: ‘Dyombo, Fumu! Inene na diyerire ku paka mu kanwa yo dithziro yo kukana ku kena!’<verse eid="ACT 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />“Unone edyo diywi dya tawire ro muthsidi ku wiru ci: ‘Ethsi a na kenithsa Nyambi wa thsi ninga ci kadi thsikenu.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Eyi ya tendaharire miendo thzihatu. Ngou enu yoihe ya huthsiwire ku wiru.<verse eid="ACT 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />“Popo akwerume ahatu a kumine ku nthzio oku na kekarire, awa tumiwire ku tunda ku mbongi thza Sesarea. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Mupepo wa ni amberire ci ni thzeno ko kukana ku tamangera. Awa akwakutawa o mutanu na yofoci a ni thsindekethzire ku Sesarea no ku kengena mu nthzio thza Koneliasi. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Koneliasi wa tu tongwerire edi a monine kangeru o ku ka nemana mu nthzio thzenthzi no ku mu ambera ci: ‘O tume anu ku Jopa a kethse munu o dithzina dyo Simoni Peturu, <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />kenge naa ku tongwera maywi aa a ku ku retera ci o yoyithsiwe, owe no mwanda woe ouhe.’<verse eid="ACT 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />“Ou na tatekire ku amba, Mupepo Oukenu wa keyire kukwo eci edi wa keyire pa petu ku matatekero. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Ngou na ka vurukire maywi aa a ambire Fumu o ku ninga ci: ‘Johani wa korovethzire ko meyu, unone amwe kenge mwa ku korovethziwa ko Mupepo Oukenu.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Ngeci Nyambi na a pa Anukenge thsipa thsofoci nethsi a tu pire atwe ou twa tawire kwa Fumu Yesu Krisitu ne, nedi yame nodye ci ni kwangithse Nyambi?”<verse eid="ACT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Ou a yuvire eyi a tutwarire no ku shangara Nyambi ci: “Apo honi Nyambi naa pa nAnukenge ndau thzo ku cera no ku wana mwoyo!”<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kereke thzo mu Antioke o mu Siria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Akwakutawa awa panthzaanine mukaci ko kunyandithsiwa kuya kwekarireko munyima thzo kwipaiwa kwa Setefani a ka kumine ku Fenisia, Sipera no ku Antioke o kwa thza o rongithsa diywi dya Nyambi ku Majuda pohuma. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Uno honi kwekarire amweya mu kaciko, akwerume o ku Sipera na Sirene, awa a thzire ku Antioke no ku ka honga nAnukenge Muthzimbu Ouwa wa Fumu Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Okoro wa Fumu wekarireno, anu owangi a tawire no ku thsiurukera kwa Fumu.<verse eid="ACT 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Akwa kereke thzo mu Yerusalema a yuvire eyi, ngou a tumine Banabasi ku Antioke. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Ou a ka kumineko no ku ka mona thsihemo thsa Nyambi, wa nyanyukire no ku wa tanarithsa wahe ci ekarerere kwa Fumu ko micima thzo thzothzihe. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Banabasi po nedi munu o muwawa, o ku yara Mupepo Oukenu no thsitawo. Anu owangi a retiwire kwa Fumu.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Banabasi ngou a thzire ku Tarese ku ka fotafota Saule. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Ou a ka mu wanine wa ka mu retire ku Antioke. Momu widi wo a maninemo mwaka mutumbi o kwa ciwananga nanu omo mu kereke no ku rongithsa anu owangi. Mu Antioke modiyo mo kutanga akwakutawa kwithsiwa ci Makrisitu.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Mwao mayuwa akwakukethza amweya a urumukire ku tunda mu Yerusalema ku keya ku Antioke. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Yumweya kukwo o dithzina dyo Agabusi wemanine. Ko ku mu tangerera Mupepo Oukenu, wokethzire ci kenge kwa kwikara ndombo thzothzikuru mu matunga oahe aa a endithsiwa ku Maroma. (Eyi ya tendaharire Kilaude o ku di fumu shokuru mu Roma.) <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Mweyo, erongwa ya ciyuvire ci a tumithse ekwathsa kwaenthzo o ku Judea, munu no munu omu a twethserire momuhe. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />A tendire kengeyo, a pire eyo ekwathsa a Banabasi na Saule awa i twarire kwakuru o kereke o mu Yerusalema.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CC, HS, CT, TA</para>
  <para style="s1">Kunyandithsiwa kwaa civungithsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Mwethso thsikati, Fumu Heroda wa tatekire kwanga no ku nyandithsa amweya mu kereke. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Wepaire ko mwere Jakovo mukurwa Johani o mukwerume, <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Ou a monine ci eyi ya nyanyukithsire Majuda, wa shumunine no ku kwata Peturu karo. Eyi shime ya tendaharire pa Thsidika thso Makende o kupira Mamene. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Ou a manine ku mu kwata, wa mu pakire mu kamenga, no ku mu pa kwipani ine yo mashwarare eyi yekarire no mashwarare ane thsipani no thsipani ci a mu nyunge. Heroda shime a anekerire ku mu punithsera ku mbunga munyima thzo Paseka. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Mweyo, Peturu wa nyungiwire mu kamenga. Unone kereke thza takamithsire ku mu romberera kwa Nyambi.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peturu aa punithsiwa mu kamenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Othsiku o diyuwa edi a fotire Heroda ci a mu rete mu kuta ou di va, Peturu shime a rarire mu kaci ko mashwarare edi o ku nangiwa no madyenge edi. Karo akwakunyunga aidi shime a nyungire pa thsero thzo kamenga. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Popo kangeru ka Fumu ka nemanine ku nyonga thza Peturu, mumunyi oukuru wa munekire mu thsitokithsi omu ekarire Peturu. Kangeru ka pamarire Peturu pa dipee ku mu pindura, no ku amba ci: “O wimane wangu!” Madyenge a wire ku moko enthzi. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Kangeru ka mu amberire ci: “O vate, karo o cishupeke mashangu oe.” Peturu wa tendire kengeyo. Kangeru ka mu amberire karo ci: “O vate canthzi woe o ni shupwere.”<figure style="fig" alt="An angel delivers Peter from prison" file="wa03966b.tif" size="span" loc="Acts 12:6-10" copy="Wade" ref="12.6-10">Kangeru kaa punithsa Peturu mu kamenga</figure><verse eid="ACT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Peturu wa punine no ku shupwera kangeru ku tunda mu kamenga. Ka a dimukire ci eyi ka tendire kangeru po ya shemwa, shime a anekerire ci a mona thsimona. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />A pitererire thsipani thso kutanga thsakwakunyunga, nethsi thso muthsidi, a kumine pa thsikwaro thso thsifu thso ku punena mu mbongi. Thsa ciyanthzurukerire thsothsinda, awopo a punena pora. A endire kengeyo mu mukwakwa ofoci, popo kangeru ka mu thsiire.<verse eid="ACT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Peturu wa tatekire ku yuvithsithsa eyi ya tendaharire no ku amba ci: “Pano honi naa tawa shemwa ci Fumu na tumu kangeru kenthzi ku na ni patura mu moko a Heroda neyi a na taterera Majuda yoihe ci i tendahare.”<verse eid="ACT 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Ou a yuvithsithsire eyi ya tendaharire, wa thzire ku nthzio thza Madiya mama wa Johani Mareka, o kwa ciwanenine anu owangi o kwa rombera. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Peturu ou a ka ngongomonine pa thsero, kwa keyire ngamba o mbuyamaana o dithzina dyo Roda ku na mu tawa. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Ou a dimukire diywi dya Peturu, wa nyanyukire nene. Ka a yanthzururire no ku thsero, unone wa cirire ku huka ku ka tongora ci: “Peturu oyu nemana pa thsero!”<verse eid="ACT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Awo a mu huthsire ci: “Waa thzaruka!” Unone aye wa ooterire ci ya shemwa yodiyo. Unone awo a hukahukerire ku amba ci: “Ngwa kangeru kenthzi ako.”<verse eid="ACT 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Unone Peturu wa hukahukerire ku ngongomona. Ku hura a na mu yanthzurwerire, a komokire ou a mu monine ci yodiyo. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Wa wa tutwarithsire ko dyoko dyenthzi, no ku wa tongawera edi a mu punithsire Fumu mu kamenga. Wa wa amberire ci: “Mu ka i tongwere Jakovo naenthzetu akwakutawa.” Ngou a thzire ku ndau thzathzo.<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Ou dya vire, kwekarire mukwangarakanyi oukuru mu kaci ko mashwarare keyi ya tendaharire kwa Peturu. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Munyima thzo ku mu fotafota nene unone kadi wa ku wana, Heroda wa fotithsithsire akwakunyunga no ku tumina ci a paiwe. Heroda ngou a urumukire ku tunda mu Judea ku thza ku Sesarea oku a kekarire thsikati thsothsipu.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kufa kwa Heroda Agiripa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Heroda wa anthziperire nene anu o mu Tire na Sidoni, ngou a ciyuvire ci a ka cimone nenthzi. O kwa shime ku thzako, a tangire tango ku rakwithsa Bulasito ngamba wa fumu, ngou a thzire honi kwa Heroda ku ka romba thsiyaro, inene shime a kuruperire edya eyi ya tundangire ku ditunga edi a endithsire Heroda.<verse eid="ACT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Mwedyo diyuwa dya hanguriwire ku ciwana, Heroda wa vatire ekoveyo yenthzi yo thsifumu no kwikara mu ngunja ku amba ku mbunga. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Anu a hukahukerire ku yoomoka ku amba ci: “Oyu po kadi munu pohuma oyu amba, unone nyambi.”<verse eid="ACT 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Popo kangeru ka Fumu ka mu furire pakuninga ci shime a fotire ku remekiwa eci Nyambi, tuyoka to mu dira atopo tu mu dya ayepo fa.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Unone diywi dya Nyambi dya yukire nakwakutawa a vurire.<verse eid="ACT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Banabasi na Saule ou a ka manine ekwama yo, a ka hukire ku tunda ku Yerusalema, a shimbire Johani oyu wethsiwire ci Mareka.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CC, HS, CT2, TA</para>
  <para style="s1">Banabasi na Saule aa tumiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Mu kereke thzo mu Antioke kwekarire akwakukethza narongithsi: Banabasi, Simioni oyu wethsiwire o Mwiru, Lusiusi o ku Sirene, Manaene oyu wa kurerire pofoci na nguvuru Heroda, no Saule. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Diyuwa dimweya o kwa rombera Fumu no ku cikanga no nthzara, Mupepo Oukenu wa ambire ci: “Mu ni torwere a Banabasi na Saule a ka kwame ekwama eyi na ni wethsera.” <verse eid="ACT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Ou a manine ku cikanga no nthzara no ku rombera, a wa kambekire moko o no ku wa fundura.<figure style="fig" alt="Paul and Barnabas set apart for missionary work" file="wa03968b.tif" size="span" loc="Act 13:1-3" copy="Wade" ref="13.1-3">Paulu na Banabasi aa tororiwa ku ka honga diywi dya Nyambi</figure><verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Banabasi na Paulu mu Sipera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Ngou honi, momu widi wo, ko ku wa tuma Mupepo Oukenu, a urumukire ku Selusia no ku ka hunyuna ku thza ku diongo dya Sipera. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Ou a ka kumine mu Salamisi, a ka hongire diywi dya Nyambi mu masinagoge o Majuda. Johani Mareka wa endireno ku wa kwathsa.<verse eid="ACT 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />A endire mu diongo dyodihe shime ku ka kuma mu mbongi thza Pafosi. A ka waninemo mukwamasheno, karo o mukwakukethza o mbango o Mujuda o dithzina dyo Ba-Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Shime ekarire na nguvuru Seregusi Paulusi, mukwerume o maano. Oyu nguvuru wethsire Banabasi na Saule inene shime a fotire ku yuva diywi dya Nyambi. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Unone Elimasi mukwamasheno (inene eyo yo di na amba dithzina dyenthzi mu Thsigerike), wa wa shomororire no ku ereka ku kwangithsa oya nguvuru ku tawa.<verse eid="ACT 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Unone Saule, oya wethsiwire karo ci Paulu, ko kuyara Mupepo Oukenu wa rupukerire Elimasi no ku mu ambera ci: <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />“Owe mwana shamaonga, owe o mukwathsithzimbo thsowawa ouhe, o ku yara kwangera nomango. Ene mbera ko thsii ku petithsa makuñwa o kuoroka a Fumu? <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />O teerere! Pano honi Fumu o na ku piruka, kenge o wikara kapuputwa. Ko twethse ku mona shaanga mwethzi o diyuwa ko thsikati thsothsipu. Popo dyundu no mirema ya mu thsikire pa meho, ayepo fafatera ku fotafota munu o ku mu tangerera ku mu kwaterera ku dyoko.”<verse eid="ACT 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Oya nguvuru ou a monine eyi ya tendaharire, wa tawire diywi dya Nyambi, inene wa komokire nene kerongithsa ya Fumu.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu na Banabasi mu Antioke o mu Pisidia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Ku tunda mu Pafosi, Paulu naenthzenthzi a hunyunine ku thza ku Pega o mu Pamfilia, oku a ka wa thsiire Johani ku huka ku Yerusalema. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Unone awo a ka shumunine ku tunda mu Pega ku thza ku Antioke o mu Pisidia. Mu diyuwa dyo Savata, a kengenine mu sinagoge no ku kekara. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Munyima thzo ku vara mu vuka thzo murao nakwakukethza, aendithsi o sinagoge a wa rombire ci: “Andengenu, ngeci mu diko no maywi o ku tanarithsa mbunga mu a ambaure.”<verse eid="ACT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Paulu ngou emanine no ku wa tutwarithsa ko dyoko, no ku amba ci: “Amwe mwa Maisiraele, namwe mwAnukenge mu na remeka Nyambi, mu ni teerere!<verse eid="ACT 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />“Nyambi o Maisiraele wa hangurire akwathsañuruetu, wa ka wa kurithsire mwethsiya thsikati a kekarire mu Egepita, karo kokoro wenthzi wa wa tundithsire muya mu ditunga. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />Wa wa kundire mu myaka thzo makumi ane mu dikunguthsitu. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Wa yundithsire mishovo thzo mutanu na thzidi thzo mu Kanana, no ku pa edyo ditunga kwanuenthzi Maisiraele ci a di shwane di kare dyo. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Eyi yoihe ya shimbire myaka thzo ku twethsa ku kwana makumi o dikumi ane no myaka makumi mutanu (450). Munyima thzeyo, Nyambi wa wa pire akwakuratura shime ku ka kuma mu thsikati thsa mukwakukethza Samuele.<verse eid="ACT 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />“Ngou honi Maisiraele a rombire ku wa pa fumu, Nyambi ngou a hangurire Saule mwana Kishi o mu mukuta wa Benjamini kwikara fumu wo, oyu wa tuminine myaka thzo makumi ane. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Ou a tururirepo Saule, Nyambi wa pakirepo Davida ci a pwe fumu wo, oyu a pire ombangi yenthzi Nyambi ci: ‘Ni na ciwanena Davida mwana Jese, mukwerume oyu na shima ko mucima wange, kenge a ku kwama eshima yange yoihe.’<verse eid="ACT 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />“Kwanahoka oyu mukwerume ko naa tundithsa Nyambi Muyoyithsi o Maisiraele, aye Yesu, eci edi a i kumbwethzire Nyambi. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Yesu o ku shime ku keya, Johani wa hongire anu wahe o mu Isiraele ci a cere evi yo a korovethziwe. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Johani o ku manenena ekwama yenthzi wa ambire ci: ‘Ene mwaa anekera ci yame nodye? Kadi cingwa yame oyu mu na taterera, dyombo, unone kwaa di oyu keya munyima thzange, ka ni roerire shaanga ku putura mashangu o kwidyato yenthzi.’<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />“Andengenu, amwe mwana Aburahama namwe mwAnukenge amwe mu na remeka Nyambi, ku kwetu naa tumithsiwa aa maywi o kuyoyithsiwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Akwa Yerusalema naendithsi wo ka dimukire Yesu ci edye. Pa ku mu shomorora kwo, a retithsire ci eyi a ñorire akwakukethza i citombore, eyi i na variwanga dyo Savata no Savata. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Shaanga ci ka mu wanenine murandu o ku roera ku paiwera, a rombire Pilatu ci a mwipae.<verse eid="ACT 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />“Ou a manine ku kwama Yesu yoihe eyi ya ñoriwire keyi yenthzi, a mwamburire pa mbinda no ku mu paka mu thsidi. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Unone Nyambi wa mu pindurire kwafu, <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />karo mu mayuwa oangi Yesu wa hokokangire ko waya anu a tundire nenthzi ku Galilea ku thza ku Yerusalema, awa di honi mambangi enthzi ku Maisiraele.<verse eid="ACT 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />“Pano honi twaa mi retera Muthzimbu Ouwa ou a kumbwethzire Nyambi kwakwathsañuruetu, <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />i na na citombora ku kwetu twanahoka wo ko ku pindura Yesu kwafu eci edi ya ñoriwire mu Dimbo dyo muthsidi ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">“ ‘O mwanange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:33">ni na piruka tata woe rero.’<verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />“Nyambi wa mu pindurire kwafu ci orera mu thsidi, eci dyodi a ambire ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">‘Kenge na ku mi pa thsiyauthzi thsothsikenu no shemwa thsiya na kumbwethzire Davida.’<verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />“Karo wa i ambire ko kuyara mu Dimbo dimweya ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">‘Ko wa ku tawethza ci O Mukenu woe orere mu thsidi.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:10">Mem 16.10</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />“Inene Davida ou a manine ku kwamena Nyambi mu thsikati thsenthzi, wa fire no ku vumbekiwa oku kwa vumbekiwire akwathsañuruenthzi, karo erama yenthzi yorire, <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />unone aye oyu a pindurire Nyambi kwafu ka orire.<verse eid="ACT 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />“Mweyo, andengenu, naa fota ci mu dimuke ci kenthzi aye Yesu u hongiwa ku kwenu otetero wevi. <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />Kenthzi aye Yesu munu yomuhe oyu na tawa aa tendiwa o muwawa pa meho a Nyambi, eyi mwa kanine ku wana ko murao wa Mushe. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Mu mamere ci eyi a ambire akwakukethza ya ku tendahara ku kwenu.<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />“ ‘Mu mone, amwe mwakwa mushepuruthzi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">Mu komoke no ku fa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">Inene mu mayuwa enu kenge na ku tenda thsinu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">ethsi mwa ku kana ku tawa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">shaanga yoyu thsi mi tongwera munu.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Paulu na Banabasi o kwa puna mu sinagoge, anu a wa rombire ci a ku ka huke mu Savata ethzi thza randireko a ku na shumune ku rongithsa eyi enu. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Mbunga ethzi thzekarire mu sinagoge ou thza cimwaamwaire, Majuda owangi nAnukenge awa engenine mu thsitawo thso Thsijuda a shupwerire Paulu na Banabasi, awa rongithsire no ku wa karaethza ci a twarerere ku tanarithsa thsihemo thsa Nyambi.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Savata ethzi thza randireko, ongi wanu wahe o mu mbongi a ciwanawanine ku na yuva diywi dya Fumu. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Unone Majuda ou a monine oo mungi wanu, a wa tenderire mbamba no ku tateka ku rwithsa eyi a ambire Paulu no ku mwipithsa dithzina. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />A Paulu na Banabasi ngou a ambire kondume ci: “Ya roerire ci edi diywi dya Nyambi di tange ku tongoriwa ku kwenu. Uno honi mbeci po mu na di kana no ku ciratura mwathsinda ci ka mu roerire mwoyo o diyere, twaa thsiurukera honi kwAnukenge. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Inene eyi yodiyo a tu tuminine Fumu ou a ambire ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">“ ‘Ni na ku kwama kwikara mwethzi kwAnukenge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:47">ci o rete kuyoyithsiwa ku hura thzo kaye.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Anukenge ou a yuvire eyi a nyanyukire no ku shangara diywi dya Fumu. Karo owangi awa hangweriwire mwoyo o diyere a tawire.<verse eid="ACT 13:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Mweyo, diywi dya Fumu dya eranine muya mu ditunga dyodihe. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Unone Majuda a shovongorire ambuyama o ku remekiwa awa a cipakire kwa Nyambi nakwerume o wakuru mu thsivaka omo mu mbongi ci a rwithse Paulu na Banabasi no ku wa cithza mu ndau thzo. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Mweyo, a wa kukumwenine dikungu dyo kwidyato yo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ku monithsa ku kaniwa.</char></note> no ku thza ku Ikoniamu. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Unone awo akwakutawa o mu Antioke a nyanyukire no ku yara Mupepo Oukenu.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CC, HS, CT, TA</para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu na Banabasi mu Ikoniamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Mofoci no mu Ikoniamu, Paulu na Banabasi a kengenine mu sinagoge thzo Majuda. A ka rongithsire kokoro ku ninga ci Majuda no Magerike<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Munu o ku ninga ci kadi Mujuda.</char></note> owangi a tawire. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Unone Majuda awa kanine ku tawa a shovongorire Anukenge no ku firikanya maano o ku wa shemaethza ci a rwithse akwakutawa. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Mweyo, Paulu na Banabasi ekariremo, o kwa rongithsa ya Fumu kondume. Fumu wa pire ombangi o muthzimbu wenthzi o thsihemo ko ku wa twethsithsa ku kwama emonithso nekomokithsa. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Unone anu omo mu mbongi shime a citepire, amweya emanenine Majuda, amweya tunganda. <verse eid="ACT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Uno honi Majuda amweya nAnukenge amweya, naendithsi wo ou a fotire ku wa nyandithsa no ku wa povaura no mawe, <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />a i dimukire awopo a cirera ku Lisitira na Debe, mambongi o mu Likaonia, no mandau aa a na hatako. <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />Oko karo a ka shumunine ku honga Muthzimbu Ouwa. <figure style="fig" file="GPS_Paul1-BW final2.tif" size="col" ref="13.4—14.28" /><verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu na Banabasi mu Lisitira na Debe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Mu Lisitira kwekarire mukwerume o thsikunga oyu wekarire, ka a twethsire ku enda. Wekarire thsikunga ku tunda ku kwerekiwa kwenthzi karo wa diyerire ku enda. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Shime a teererire eyi a rongithsire Paulu. Paulu ko ku mu tanekera thsithzui no ku mona ci wekarire no thsitawo thso kuninga ci aa twethsa ku porithsiwa, <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />wa mu amberire ko diywi dyodikuru ci: “O wimane kedyato yoe!” Oyo munu wa reire no ku tateka ku endaura.<verse eid="ACT 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Mbunga ou thza monine eyi a tendire Paulu, thza yoomokire mu mushovo o Thsilikaonia ci: “Anyambi a na shuruka ku keya ku kwetu ko thsikupuro thsonu!” <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Banabasi a mu tire Zeusi, Paulu a mu tire Heremesi pakuninga ci nedi yodiyo mukwa ku amba. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Tembere thza nyambi oyu nethsiwa Zeusi shime thzekarerire po pepi no mbongi. Mupurisita wethzo tembere wa retire mapoho no makata o matemo ku mengeneno o mbongi inene aye no mbunga shime fotire ku kwamena Banabasi na Paulu eyambero.<verse eid="ACT 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Unone oto tunganda, a Banabasi na Paulu, ou a i yuvire a yaturire ekoveyo yo no ku cirera mu mbunga o kwa ka thza o kumba ci: <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />“Amwe mwanu, ine eyi mu tendera eyi? Natwe twanu eci amwe. Shime tu na mi retera pohuma Muthzimbu Ouwa ci mu tunde kweyi enu yo mbango mu thsiurukere kwa Nyambi oyu yoya, oyu wa kwamine diwiru no kaye no dikuruviya neyi i dimo yoihe. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Ku mayuwa o ku kare Nyambi wa thsiererire anu ci a yoye komu a foterire. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Unone ka a wa thsiererire kengeyo ko kukana ku wa monithsa ombangi keyi yenthzi, inene wa kwamine yoiwa ko ku mi pa mvura ku tunderera ku wiru, no ku mi pa njimo nawa ko thsikati ethsi thsi na roera, no ku mi pa edya yoingi no thsinyanyu mu micima thzenu.” <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Uno honi shaanga koa maywi, ya wa karuperire ku kwangithsa ethzo mbunga ku wa tendera thsiyambero.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Unone Majuda amweya awa tundire ku Antioke no ku Ikoniamu ou a twethsire ku shemaethza mbunga. A povaurire Paulu no mawe no ku mu koka ku mu tundithsa mu mbongi ko ku anekera ci o na fu. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Unone erongwa ou ya ciwanawanine no ku mu paka mu kaci, wa pindukire no kwingena mu mbongi. Diyuwa edi dya randireko, wa thzire na Banabasi ku Debe.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu na Banabasi aa huka ku Antioke o mu Siria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Paulu na Banabasi ou a manine ku honga Muthzimbu Ouwa mu mbongi thza Debe no ku wana erongwa yoingi, a hukire ku Lisitira no ku Ikoniamu no ku Antioke o mu Pisidia. <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />Aka tanarithsire micima thzakwakutawa no ku wa ambera ci a tanare mu thsitawo thso. A wa amberire ci: “Twaa roera kwingena mu makando oangi ci twa kwingene mu Kutumina kwa Nyambi.” <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />A Paulu na Banabasi a hangurire akuru o kereke mu kereke no kereke ko ku rombera no kucikanga no nthzara, no ku wa paka mu moko a Fumu oyu a tawire ku kwenthzi. <verse eid="ACT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Ngou a pitire mu Pisidia ku thza ku Pamfilia. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Ou a manine ku rongithsa diywi mu Pega, a urumukire ku thza ku Atalia.<verse eid="ACT 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Ou a tundire omo a hukire no dingunde ku Antioke o mu Siria, kuya pakiwire mu thsihemo thsa Nyambi mukaci kekwama iya a ka kwamine. <verse eid="ACT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Ou a ka kumine mu Antioke a ka wanekire akwakutawa pofoci, no ku wa tongawera enu yoihe eyi a ka wa kwamithsire Nyambi nedi naa ka yanthzurwera Nyambi Anukenge thsero thzo thsitawo. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Ekariremo thsikati thsothsire nerongwa.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CC, HS, CT, TA</para>
  <para style="s1">Mukopano o mu Yerusalema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Paulu na Banabasi o kwa di mu Antioke, kwa keyire anu awa tundire ku Judea no ku na tateka ku rongithsa akwakutawa ci: “Tumba mu yoyithsiwa, shime ci mu thze ku mukanda eci edi ku na ñoriwa mu murao wa Mushe.” <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Paulu na Banabasi ngou a wa kanenine no ku cikanyekano nene. Paulu na Banabasi nanu amweya ngou a hanguriwire ku kambama ku thza ku Yerusalema ku ka cimona no tunganda nakuru o kereke mukaci kethzi ngudi. <verse eid="ACT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Mweyo, ko ku tumiwa ku kereke, a pitire mu Fenisia no mu Samaria o kwa thza o tongaura ko kuyara yAnukenge edi a thsiurukerire kwa Nyambi, karo ya reterire thsinyanyu thsothsikuru akwakutawa wahe.<verse eid="ACT 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Ou a ka kumine mu Yerusalema, a ka tamburiwire ku kereke, no ku tunganda, nakuru o kereke. Paulu na Banabasi a ka tongaurire enu yoihe eyi a wa kwamithsire Nyambi. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Unone akwakutawa amweya o mu thsikwata thsAfarithsi a katukire no ku amba ci: “Kwaa roera ci Anukenge awa a na tawa a thze ku mukanda no ku tuminiwa ci a hengeke murao wa Mushe.”<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Tunganda nakuru o kereke a ciwanine pofoci ku yongora eyi. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Munyima thzo ku ciyongora thsikati thsothsire, Peturu wa katukire no ku amba kukwo ci: “Andengenu, namwe mu na dimuka ci Nyambi wa ni hangurire ku kare mu kaci kenu ci ko kanwa kange, Anukenge a yuve Muthzimbu Ouwa no ku tawa. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />No Nyambi, aye oyu na dimuka micima thzanu naa pa ombangi ci naa wa tambura pa ku wa pa Mupepo Oukenu eci dyodi a tendire ku kwetu. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Ka na a monithsa thsiano mu kaci ketu nawo, inene Nyambi naa kenithsa micima thzo ko thsitawo. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Pano honi ne, ine eyi mu fota ku erekera Nyambi ko ku paka njoko pa mathsingo erongwa, njoko ethzi a kanine ku twethsa ku shimba akwathsañuruetu nji atwe? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Dyombo! Uno honi twaa tawa ci twaa yoyithsiwa ko thsihemo thsa Fumu Yesu, eci edi a yoyithsiwa nawo.”<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Mbunga thzothzihe thza tutwarire ku teerera kwa Paulu na Banabasi o kwa wa tongawera emonithso nekomokithsa eyi a tendire Nyambi kwAnukenge ko ku wa cikwathsithsa.<verse eid="ACT 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Ou a manine ku tongaura, Jakovo wa tawire ci: “Andengenu, mu ni teerere! <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Simoni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Karo aethsiwa ci Peturu.</char></note> na mi tongwera Nyambi edi a tatekire ku vanda kwAnukenge, ku hangura mbunga mu kaciko kwikara anuenthzi. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Eyi yaa citombora no maywi akwakukethza, eci edi i na ñoriwa ci:<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />“Munyima thzeyi kenge na ku ka huka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">no ku na umba nawa nthzio thza Davida thziya na thzi u,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">Na ku na thzi pindure,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">no ku thzi huthsera,<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />ci mathsiarethzi wahe a ku fote Fumu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17">mofoci kengeyo nAnukenge awa a nethsiwa ko dithzina dyange,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">kwaa amba Fumu,<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />oyu wa dimukithsire eyi enu ku kare.<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />“Mweyo, naa anekera ci twa cakanithsa Anukenge awa a na thsiurukera kwa Nyambi. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Unone tu wa ñorere pohuma ci a thsie ku dyanga edya yo ku tupwera ekupuro, a tunde ku ruthziho, a dyanga nyama o thsiyama thso ku fa ku kathsinga nji ku dya difura. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Inene murao wa Mushe wandiwire kare o ku u hongiwa mu mambongi oahe no ku variwa mu masinagoge diyuwa no diyuwa dyo Savata.”<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nthzango thzaa ñorera Anukenge wakwakutawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Tunganda nakuru no kereke thzothzihe thzo mu Yerusalema ngou a hangurire anu mu kaciko no ku wa tuma na Paulu na Banabasi ku Antioke. Kwa hanguriwire Judasi oyu wethsiwire Basabasi, no Silasi, akwerume awa ekarire aendithsi mu kaci kakwakutawa. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />A piwire diñoro edi dya ñoriwire kenge ci:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="ACT 15:23">“Ku tunderera ku kwetu atwe twa tunganda nakuru o kereke, atwe twaenthzenu, twaa ñorera amwe mwAnukenge wakwakutawa o mu Antioke, Siria no mu Silisia, twaa mi vumenena. <verse eid="ACT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Pakuninga ci na tu na yuvu ci anu amweya na tundu kuno ku kwetu no ku na mi cakanithsa no ku mi pithsa ku micima kerongithsa yo eyi na tu kana ku wa raa, <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />na tu ciyuvu ku hangura akwerume no ku wa tuma oko ku kwenu nashimiwa etu a Banabasi na Paulu. <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />Awo po akwerume awa na shuvu myoyo thzo mukaci ko dithzina dya Fumu wetu Yesu Krisitu. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Mweyo, tu na tumu Judasi na Silasi ci na mi tongwere ko tunwa two eyi tu na ñoro.<verse eid="ACT 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Inene Mupepo Oukenu natwe kengeyo na tu mono ci ka tu roerire ku mi shimbithsa mupango ouremu shime ku hengeka eyi: <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />‘Mwa dya edya yo ku tupwera ekupuro, mwa dya difura nji eyama yo ku fa ku kathsinga, karo mu tunde ku ruthziho. Ngeci amwepo mu cihenga kweyo kenge mwa ku tenda nawa. Mu yoyepo nawa.’”<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Mweyo, ou a funduriwire, a urumukire ku thza ku Antioke, oku a ka wanekire akwakutawa no ku wa pa edyo diñoro. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Ou a manine ku di tara, anu a nyanyukire mukaci ko maywi etanarithsa yadyo.<verse eid="ACT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />A Judasi na Silasi ko kwikara akwakukethza, a ambaurire yoingi ku kwo, ku tanarithsa no ku koropithsa akwakutawa. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Munyima thzo mayuwa oapu, akwakutawa a wa fundurire ko thsiyaro ku huka kowa a wa tumine. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />[Unone Silasi aye wa fotire ci a thsiare.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka thzi di mu mañoro o kutanga. </char></note>] <verse eid="ACT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Paulu na Banabasi a thsiarire mu Antioke. Awo namweya owangi, a rongithsangire no ku honga diywi dya Fumu.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu na Banabasi aa cihanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Munyima thzo mayuwa oapu, Paulu wa amberire Banabasi ci: “Tu huke tu ka hungerithse akwakutawa mu mambongi oahe muya na tu thzi o rongithsa diywi dya Fumu, tu ka mone edi a di.” <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Banabasi wa fotire ci a thze na Johani oyu nethsiwa Mareka. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Unone Paulu wa monine ci ka ya roerire ku thza no munu oyu wa ka wa thsiire mu Pamfilia, oyu wa kanine ku ka shumunano mwikwama eyi a ka kwamine. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Kwa katukire dikanyi dyodikuru ku ninga ci mane a cihandire. Banabasi wa shimbire Johani Mareka no ku thza ku Sipera no dingunde. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Unone Paulu aye wa hangurire Silasi no ku thza, o kwa na pakiwa kwakwakutawa mu thsihemo thsa Fumu. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Wa thzire o hungerithsa matunga a Siria na Silisia, o ku thza o tanarithsa makereke.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CC, HS, CT, TA</para>
  <para style="s1">Timoti aa kwamena pofoci na Paulu na Silasi</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Paulu wa thzire ku Debe no ku Lisitira. Omo kwekarire thsirongwa thso dithzina dyo Timoti, mwana mbuyama o Mujuda o mukwakutawa, unone tata wenthzi nedi Mugerike. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Akwakutawa o mu Lisitira no mu Ikoniamu a shangarire Timoti. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Paulu ngou a fotire ci Timoti a mu thsindekethze, wa mu twarire ku mukanda pakuninga ci muya mu mandau a thzire shime kwekarire Majuda, inene anu wahe shime a dimukire ci tata wenthzi nedi Mugerike. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Ou a thzire o pita mu mambongi, a thzire o tongwera anu ku hengeka eanekera yo tunganda nakuru o mu Yerusalema. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Mweyo, makereke a koropire mu thsitawo nanu awa tawire a civungithsire diyuwa no diyuwa.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Thsimona thsa Paulu thso mukwerume o mu Masedonia</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />A Paulu na Silasi na Timoti a thzire mu ditunga dya Firigia no mu Galatia, inene Mupepo Oukenu wa wa kanithsire ku amba diywi mu Asia. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Ou a ka kumine po pepi na Misia, a erekire kwingena mu Bitinia, unone Mupepo wa Yesu wa wa kanithsire. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Ngou a pitererire Misia no ku urumuka ku thza ku Toroasi.<verse eid="ACT 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Othsiku Paulu wa monine thsimona thso mukwerume o ku Masedonia o ku nemana ku mu adikanena ku romba ci: “Naa ku romba, o keye ku Masedonia no tu kwathse.” <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Munyima thzo ku mona Paulu ethso thsimona, ko wanguwangu twa ciroithserire ku thza ku Masedonia, ko ku mona ci yoshemwa Nyambi naa twithsa ci tu ka honge Muthzimbu Ouwa kukwo.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lidia aa piruka mukwakutawa mu Filipi</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Ou twa hunyunine mu Toroasi twa tambire ku Samotirake, diyuwa edi dya randireko twa ka thsekerire ku Neopolisi. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Ku tunda omo twa thzire ku Filipi, mbongi thzo kutanga mu thsikiriti thsa Masedonia mu kutumina ko Thsiroma. Twekariremo mayuwa oapu.<verse eid="ACT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Dyo Savata twa tundire mu mbongi no ku thza ku kakuro ko rware, oku twa anekerire ci ngwa ko thzi di ndau thzo marombero. Ou twa ka kumineko, twa kekarire no ku tateka ku ambaura nambuyama awa ciwanenineko. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Yumweya kowa takamithsire ku tu teerera nedi mbuyama o dithzina dyo Lidia o mu mbongi thza Tiyatira, oyu wa urithsangire eto yo muvara o muhombohombo yo ku tura, karo shime a romberangire Nyambi. Fumu wa yanthzururire mucima wenthzi ci a teerere eyi a ambire Paulu. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Ou a pwire ku korovethziwa, aye no mwanda wenthzi, wa ambire ci: “Ngeci mwaa ni shimba ci no mukwakutawa kwa Fumu, tu thzenu mu kekare ku nthzio thzange.” Wa ooterire, shime ou twa thzire nenthzi. <figure style="fig" file="GPS_Paul2-BW final2.tif" size="col" ref="15.36—18.22" /><verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu na Silasi mu kamenga</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Diyuwa dimweya, o ku tu thza ku ndau thzo marombero, twa hanganine mupika o mbuyamaana o mupepo oumango o kuka yo ku rupara karo keyo wa wanithsire añathsire enthzi madi oangi. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Wa thzire o shupwangethza Paulu natwe, o ku thza o ambanga ci: “Awa anu awa po apika Nyambi, aye o Kuthzinama Nene, awa honga ku kwenu dikuñwa dyo kuyoyithsiwa.”<verse eid="ACT 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Wa shimbire mayuwa oangi o ku i tenda eyi. Ku hura Paulu wa anthzipire, wa cithsetukire no ku ambera uya mupepo ci: “Ko dithzina dya Yesu Krisitu, naa ku tumina ci o tunde mu mwenthzi!” Popo wa mu tundire.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Uno honi añathsire enthzi ou a monine ci okurupero wo o ku kwama madi u na pu, a kwatire Paulu na Silasi no ku wa purututera pa mbanthza thzo maurithsero ku wa twara kwaendithsi. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Ou a ka wa kumithsire kwakwakuratura a ka ambire ci: “Awa anu po Majuda karo aa reta mikwangarakanyi mu mbongi thzetu, <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />pa ku rongithsa ethsemwa eyi i na kana ku tawethziwa atwe twa Maroma ku i tambura nji ku i tenda.”<verse eid="ACT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Mbunga thza cipakererirepo ku rwithsa Paulu na Silasi, akwakuratura a tuminine ci a shupuriwe eto a furiwe. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Ou a manine ku wa fura nene epumu yoingi, a wa thsindekerire mu kamenga no ku raerera mukwakunyunga kamenga ci: “O takamithse ku wa nyunga awo.” <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Oya mukwakunyunga ou a yuvire ethsi thsiraerera, wa wa pakire mu thsitokithsi thso pa kaci ko kamenga, no ku paka edyato yo mu makuro.<verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Pa kaci kothsiku Paulu na Silasi shime romberire no kwimbera Nyambi membo, enthzinda imweya ayo shime ya wa teererire.<figure style="fig" alt="Paul and Silas in the Philippi prison" file="wa03976b.tif" size="span" loc="Act 16:25-28" copy="Wade" ref="16.23-24">Paulu na Silasi mu dikuro mu kamenga ko mu Filipi</figure> <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Popo kwekarire kungangama kokukuru ko kaye, no mishisho thzo kamenga thza ngangamine. Ko wanguwangu mathsero o kamenga oahe a yanthzurukire, no madyenge aa angithsire enthzinda yoihe a putukire. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Ou a ka tukerire mu wiru mukwakunyunga kamenga no ku mona ci mathsero o kamenga a na yanthzuruka, wa shwamunine mwere wenthzi ci a cipae, inene kuma a anekerire ci enthzinda i nombo. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Unone Paulu wa mwierire ci: “Wa cikurura, twahe mo tu di muno!”<verse eid="ACT 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Mukwakunyunga kamenga wa rombire mimunyi no ku yakamenamo ko wowa, o ku tutuma no ku ka tongama ku manwi ku rupara rwa Paulu na Silasi. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Ngou a wa punithsire pora no ku wepura ci: “Añathsire wange, ine eyi ni na roera ku tenda ci ni yoyithsiwe?”<verse eid="ACT 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />A ambire ci: “O tawe kwa Fumu Yesu, apo honi kenge o yoyithsiwa, owe no mwanda woe.” <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Ngou a hongire diywi dya Fumu ku kwenthzi no mwanda wenthzi ouhe. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Momo mu thsikati thsothsiku mukwakunyunga kamenga wa wa shimbire no ku ka wa yoa petwa yo. Ayepo korovethziwa, aye no mwanda wenthzi ouhe. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Wa wa twarire mu nthzio thzenthzi no ku ka wa pa edya. Wa nyanyukerire pofoci no mwanda wenthzi ouhe pakuninga ci wa tawire kwa Nyambi.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Ou dya vire diyuwa akwakuratura a tumine tupathso kwa mukwakunyunga kamenga ci: “O punithse Paulu na Silasi a cithzere.” <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Mukwakunyunga kamenga wa tongwerire aa maywi Paulu ci: “Akwakuratura a na tumina ci owe na Silasi mu punithsiwe. Mweyo, mu pune mu thze honi mu thsiyaro.”<verse eid="ACT 16:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Unone Paulu wa amberire tupathso ci: “Kuma na tu furera pa mbunga o ku tu shime ku raturiwa, karo no ku tu paka mu kamenga shaanga ci natwe twakwaditunga dya Roma! Pano honi ne ngou a fota ku tu punithsa ku mukunda nji? Dyombo! A keye wodiyo athsinda na tu tundithsemo.”<verse eid="ACT 16:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Tupathso twa hukire ku ka tongora eyi kwakwakuratura, a yapire ou a yuvire ci Paulu na Silasi po Maroma. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Ngou a keyire no ku na cidirerera kwa Paulu na Silasi. A wa punithsire no ku wa romba ci a tunde mu mbongi. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Ngou a punine mu kamenga no ku thza ku nthzio thza Lidia. A ka ciwanine nakwakutawa no ku wa tanarithsa, awopo a thza.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CC, HS, CT, TA</para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu na Silasi aa thza ku Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Paulu na Silasi a pitire mu Amifipolisi no mu Apolonia, no ku ka kuma mu Tesalonika omu mwekarire sinagoge thzo Majuda. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Eci edi naa kwamanga, Paulu wa kengenine mu sinagoge, karo wa shimbire Masavata ahatu o ku ambaurangano mu Mañoro. <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />Wa wa tongonwenine no ku wa monithsa ci Mesiya wa roerire ku nyanda no ku pinduka kwafu. Wa ambire ci: “Oyu Yesu ni mi tongwera yenthzi po yodiyo Mesiya.” <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Majuda amweya a rakwire no ku cipakerera na Paulu na Silasi, mofoci kengeyo no Magerike owangi awa a cipakire kwa Nyambi nambuyama owangi owakuru mu thsivaka.<verse eid="ACT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Unone Majuda amweya awa tenderire mbamba, ngou a kongire akwerume o mavangoka ku maurithsero. A kwamine thsipani no ku tateka ku tenda mukwangarakanyi mu mbongi. A cirerire ku nthzio thza mukwerume o dithzina dyo Jasoni o kwa ka thza o fotafota Paulu na Silasi ci a wa kwate no ku wa twara ku mbunga. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Uno honi ou a ka kwangire ku ka wa wana, a purututire Jasoni nakwakutawa amweya ku wa twara kwaendithsi o mbongi, o kwa kuerera ci: “Awa akwerume na reta mikwangarakanyi mu kaye kokahe na keya kuno honi, <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />Jasoni naa wa tambura ku nthzio thzenthzi. Awa anu awa wahe aa rwithsa mirao thza fumu shokuru Sesare,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fumu shokuru o Maroma.</char></note> inene aa amba ci kwaa di fumu yumweya, oyu nethsiwa Yesu.”<verse eid="ACT 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Mbunga naendithsi o mbongi a shangumunine mukwangarakanyi ou a yuvire eyi. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Ngou a ooterire Jasoni nakwakutawa amweya ku kura madi o mwima mbeci ku wa thsia ci a thze.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu na Silasi mu Berea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />O uya othsiku, ko wanguwangu akwakutawa a fundurire Paulu na Silasi ci a thze ku Berea. Ou a ka kumine a ka thzire ku sinagoge thzo Majuda. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Uno honi awa Majuda o mu Berea nedi anu o micima thzothziwa kupita waya o mu Tesalonika, inene a tamburire diywi dya Nyambi ko ku pakerako maano, no ku tatufa Mañoro diyuwa no diyuwa ku mona ci eyi a rongithsa Paulu ne yashemwa. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Mweyo, Majuda owangi a tawire, nambuyama o Magerike owangi owakuru mu thsivaka nakwerume kengeyo a tawire.<verse eid="ACT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Majuda o ku Tesalonika ou a yuvire ci Paulu aa honga karo diywi dya Nyambi mu Berea, a thzireko ku ka hongaura mbunga no ku wa undunganya. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Popo akwakutawa ngou a fundurire Paulu ci a thze ku kakuro, unone Silasi na Timoti a thsiarire mu Berea. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Awa thsindekethzire Paulu a ka mu kumithsire mu Atene. Ou a hukire, Paulu wa wa raererire ci a ka tongwere Silasi na Timoti ci a ka keye ko wanguwangu nekare pofoci nenthzi.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu mu Atene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Paulu o ku taterera Silasi na Timoti mu Atene, mupepo wenthzi wa cinyengire nene ou a monine ci mbongi thza yarire anyambi wekupuro. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Mweyo, wa cikanyekangire mu sinagoge no Majuda nAnukenge awa a cipakire kwa Nyambi, karo wa tendangire kengeyo diyuwa no diyuwa mu maurithsero nanu awa a waniwangiremo.<verse eid="ACT 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Eshimodimukero imweya yo mwikwata yo Epikure no Sitoiki nawo a tatekire ku cikanyeka nenthzi. Amweya kukwo epurire ci: “Ine eyi a fota ku amba oyu thsiyavayavi?” Awa ci: “Aa monahara ci aa honga yanyambi o ku matunga ao.” Shime ambire eyi pakuninga ci Paulu shime a hongire yo Muthzimbu Ouwa wa Yesu no kupinduka kwafu. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Ngou a mu shimbire no ku mu twara ku thsikwata ethsi thsi nethsiwa Areopagusi, a mwipurire ci: “Twaa fota ku dimukera nawa eyi erongithsa yoipe o rongithsa. <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Twaa yuva ci waa reta enu eyi twa kana ku yuva, mweyo twaa fota ku i dimukera ci yaa amba ine.” <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />Anu wahe o mu Atene no matundakure awa tungiremo a ambaurangire no ku teerera thsikati thsothsihe kwirongithsa yoipe.<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Paulu ngou emanine mu kaci ko nthzango thzo Areopagusi no ku amba ci: “Amwe mwakwerume o mu Atene! Naa mona ci mwanu o ku shima nene ku rombera momuhe momuhe. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Inene ou na ni thzi o thzinguruka no ku rondorora nawa enu eyi mu na romberanga, shime naa wana karo katara aka ka na ñoriwa ci: ‘Kwa nyambi shidimukiwa.’ Mweyo, eyi mu rombera i shidimukiwa, yodiyo eyi ni honga ku kwenu.<verse eid="ACT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />“Nyambi oyu wa tendire kaye neyi i dimo yoihe, yodiyo Fumu o diwiru no kaye, ka a tunga mu matembere o ku umbiwa ko moko anu. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Karo ka a kwameniwa ko moko anu, eci ko i di eyi a na piri, inene aye yodiyo na pa anu wahe mwoyo no mupuyo, nenu yoihe. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Yodiyo wa retire ci pa munu yofoci pa tunde matunga oahe ku na tunga muno mu kaye, no ku paka ekati yo yo ku yoya no mainthza o o muve.<verse eid="ACT 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />“Nyambi wa tendire eyi ci anu a mu fote, karo ci nga a mu fafatere no ku mu wana, shaanga ikare ci ka a di kokure no munu yomuhe ku kwetu.<verse eid="ACT 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />“ ‘Inene mu mwenthzi aye twaa yoya no ku endaura, karo ko tu di.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 17:28">“Karo yo i na ambiwa no mu maroko enu ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 17:28">“ ‘Natwe twanenthzi.’<verse eid="ACT 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />“Mweyo, ko kwikara ana Nyambi, ka tu roerire ku anekera ci onyambi po waa cipitura eci gauda, nji silivera, nji diwe; thsikupuro thso kumbiwa koñurungu neanekera yo munu.<verse eid="ACT 17:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />“Ku kare Nyambi wa thsiererire kukana ku dimuka enu kwanu, uno honi pano aa raerera anu wahe mu kaye kokahe ci a cere evi yo. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Inene naa hangura diyuwa edi a ku ratura anu wahe mu kaye kowawa, ko munu oyu naa hangura ku kwama kengeyo. Karo Nyambi naa mu monithsa kare kwanu ci naa mu hangura pa ku mu pindura kwafu.”<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Ou a yuvire Paulu o ku amba yo kupinduka kwafu, amweya kukwo a mu teururire, unone amweya a ambire ci: “Kenge twa ku fota ku yuva eyi erongithsa yoe karo.” <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Paulu ngou a wa thsiire. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Unone anu amweya a cipakererire nenthzi no ku tawa. Amweya kukwo nedi Dionisiasi, o mu nthzango thzo Areopagusi, no mbuyama yumweya o dithzina dyo Damarisi, namweya kengeyo.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CC, HS, CT, TA</para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu aa thza ku Korinte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Munyima thzeyi Paulu wa tundire mu Atene no ku thza ku Korinte. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Wa ka wanineko Mujuda o dithzina dyo Akwila, o ku Pontasi, o ku naa kumakuma ku ka tunda ku Itali na munu wenthzi Purisila, inene fumu shokuru Kilaude shime a raererire ci Majuda wahe a tunde mu Roma. Paulu wa thzire ku ka wa mona. <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />Pakuninga ci naye shime a kwamangire matende eci awo, wekarireno ku kwamena pofoci. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Dyo Savata no Savata wa ambaurangire mu sinagoge, ku ereka ku rakwithsa Majuda no Magerike.<verse eid="ACT 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Silasi na Timoti ou a kumine ku ka tunda ku Masedonia, Paulu wa pakerire nene maano pohuma ku ku honga, ku pa ombangi ku Majuda ci Yesu po yodiyo Mesiya. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Unone ou a mu rwithsire no ku mu shwahura, wa kukumunine evata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ku monithsa ku kaniwa.</char></note> yenthzi no ku wa ambera ci: “Onyinga wenu wikare pa mitwi thzenu! Ame ka ni di no murandu. Ku tunda pano kenge ni thzanga kwAnukenge.”<verse eid="ACT 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Paulu ngou a tundire mu sinagoge no ku thza ku nthzio thzo munu o dithzina dyo Titiasi Jusitasi, oyu wa romberangire Nyambi. Nthzio thzenthzi shime thza cihatire no sinagoge. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Kirisipo, muendithsi o sinagoge, wa tawire kwa Fumu, mofoci kengeyo no mwanda wenthzi ouhe. Nanu amweya owangi o mu Korinte awa yuvire Paulu a tawire no ku korovethziwa.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Diyuwa dimweya othsiku Fumu wa amberire Paulu mu thsimona ci: “Wa yapa, unone o twarerere ku rongithsa, karo wa tutwara. <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />Inene noe ni di, karo kwithsa oyu wa ku ku rwithsa nji ku ku kurura, inene ni di nanuange owangi muno mu mbongi.” <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Paulu ngou ekarire mwaka no maonda mutanu na thzofoci, o ku rongithsanga diywi dya Nyambi mu kaciko.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Uno honi Galio o ku di nguvuru o mu Akaya, Majuda a cikwatire ku rwithsa Paulu no ku mu reta pa diratwero. <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />Ngou a ambire ci: “Oyu mukwerume oyu aa karaethza anu ku rombera Nyambi komu u na kanithsera murao.”<verse eid="ACT 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Unone Paulu ou a fotire ku amba, Galio wa amberire Majuda ci: “Nga thsiamba thso ku ninga ci nepithsa nji okeremi, apo nga ni na tambura kooko thzenu. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Uno honi pakuninga ci ya mangudi o maywi no mathzina no murao wenu mwathsinda, mu i rature yoyamwe. Ame ka ni ratura enu yo kenge.” <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Ngou a wa cithzire mu kuta. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Wahe a kwatire Sositene muendithsi o sinagoge, no ku mu furera pa kuta, unone Galio ka a i twarire mucima.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu aa huka ku Antioke o mu Siria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Paulu wekarire mayuwa oangi mu Korinte. Ngou a vumenenine akwakutawa no ku hunyuna ku thza ku Siria, shime a mu thsindekethzire a Purisila na Akwila. Oku shime ku thza wa cikerithsire huki thzenthzi mu Sengeria inene shime a cangire. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />A ka kumine mu mbongi thza Efese, oku a ka thsiire Purisila na Akwila. Wa thzire mu sinagoge no ku ka cishikaura no Majuda. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Ou a mu rombire ci ekareno mayuwa oangi, wa kanine. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Unone o ku funduka wa wa kumbwethzire ci: “Kenge na ku ka huka ngeci Nyambi waa ku i shime.” Ngou a hunyunine ku tunda mu Efese. <verse eid="ACT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Ou a ka thsekerire mu Sesarea, wa ka kambamine ku thza ku Yerusalema ku ka vumenena akwakutawa no ku urumuka ku thza ku Antioke. <figure style="fig" alt="Paul sails from Achaia to Syria" file="wa03983b.tif" size="span" loc="Act 18:18-22" copy="Wade" ref="18.18-22">Paulu aa thsekura ku tunda mu Akaya ku thza ku Siria</figure><verse eid="ACT 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu mu Efese no mu Korinte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Munyima thzo kwikara mayuwa oangi mu Antioke, Paulu wa tundiremo no ku thza mu mandau oangi a Galatia na Firigia o ku ka thza o tanarithsa akwakutawa wahe. <verse eid="ACT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Mwethso thsikati, mukwerume o Mujuda o dithzina dyo Apolosi, oyu werekiwerire mu Alekisandiria, wa keyire ku Efese. Nedi munu o mu ñurungu mu kuamba, karo wa dimukire nene Mañoro. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Shime naa rongithsanga dikuñwa dya Fumu, karo ko ku pakerako maano wa rongithsangire nawa amweya ya Yesu, shaanga ci shime a dimukire pohuma yo korovethzo thza Johani. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Wa tatekire ku rongithsanga mu sinagoge kondume. Unone a Purisila na Akwila ou a mu yuvire, a mwithserire ku mbadi no ku ka mu tongonwena nawa yo dikuñwa dya Nyambi.<verse eid="ACT 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Apolosi ou a fotire ku thza ku Akaya, akwakutawa a mu koropithsire no ku mu pa diñoro edi dya thzire kwakwakutawa ci a ka mu tambure nawa. Ou a ka kumine, wa ka kwathsire nene awa tawire ko thsihemo thsa Nyambi, <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />inene wa kanenangire Majuda kokoro pa kaci ko mbunga, ko Mañoro wa wa monithsire ci Yesu po yodiyo Krisitu.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CC, HS, CT, TA</para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu aa rongithsa mu Efese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Apolosi o ku di mu mbongi thza Korinte, Paulu wa cinakanine pa kaci ko ditunga, shime ku ka kuma mu Efese. Omo wa ka waninemo erongwa imweya. <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />Wa ka ipurire ci: “Ene mwa tamburire Mupepo Oukenu ou mwa tawire?” Ya tawire ci: “Dyombo, ka twa i yuva no ku i yuva ci ko wekara Mupepo Oukenu.”<verse eid="ACT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Paulu ngou epurire eyo erongwa ci: “Korovethzo mwine honi ne mwa tamburire?” Ya tawire ci: “Korovethzo thza Johani.”<verse eid="ACT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Paulu wa ambire ci: “Korovethzo thza Johani po nedi thzo ku cera evi. Shime a tongwerire anu ci a ku tawe koyu wa keyire munyima thzenthzi, aye Yesu.” <verse eid="ACT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Popa ya yuvire eyi, ya korovethziwire mu dithzina dya Fumu Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Paulu ou a i kambekire moko, Mupepo Oukenu wa keyire peuru thzayo, ayopo i tateka ku amba madimi ao no kukethza. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Shime yekarire akwerume o ku twethsa ku kwana dikumi naidi yoihe.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Paulu wengenangire mu sinagoge, karo wa shimbire maonda ahatu o ku rongithsanga kondume, ku cishikaura no ku wa karaethza yo Kutumina kwa Nyambi. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Unone amweya ekarire no mukanayuva, a kanine ku tawa karo a ambire yoimango pa meho o mbunga keyi yo Dikuñwa dya Yesu. Paulu ngou a wa thsiire no ku thza nerongwa ku dicirongithsero dya Tirano, omu a ka cishikwerangire nanu diyuwa no diyuwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Wa tendire kengeyo myaka thzidi, ci nga anu wahe o mu Asia a yuve diywi dya Fumu, Majuda mofoci kengeyo nAnukenge.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Magerike nji ci anu awa di ci kadi Majuda.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ana Sikeva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Nyambi wa pire Paulu okoro o ku kwama ekomokithsa yoikuru, <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />mane shaanga tutauro nji eto eyi ya kunyunine Paulu ya twariwangire kwakwakukora, karo ekora yo ya porithsiwire, no mathzimu a tundangire ku kwo.<verse eid="ACT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Majuda amweya wanyambaethzi awa na tundithsanga mathzimu a erekire kwithsa pa dithzina dya Fumu Yesu o kwa ambanga ci: “Naa mi raerera mu dithzina dya Yesu oyu a na honganga Paulu, mu tunde!” <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Awa a tendangire eyo po nedi ana Sikeva o mutanu naidi, oyu wekarire mupurisita shokuru o Majuda. <verse eid="ACT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Unone diyuwa dimweya mupepo oumango wa wa tawire ci: “Yesu ni na mu dimuka, no Paulu ni na mu dimuka, uno honi amwe ne yamwe mwadye?” <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Oya mukwerume wekarire no mupepo oumango ngou a wa reerire no ku wa othza wahe. Wa wa furire nene ku ninga ci mane a pumathzokire mu nthzio thsisheshe o kwa na kuruka.<verse eid="ACT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Eyi ya dimukiwire kwanu wahe awa a tungire mu Efese, Majuda no Magerike. Wowa wa wengenenine wahe karo dithzina dya Fumu Yesu dya remekiwire. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Karo ongi wo awa a tawire a keyire ku na citawera no ku tongora eyi na tendanga. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Owangi awa a tendangire masheno a retire mavuka o o masheno, no ku na a tumekerera pa meho anu. Ou a tarire taro thzo madi ao mavuka, thza kumine mu madi o ku kwana <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dimadi dyofoci dyo muwayawaya o silivera ku di kwamena po shime diyuwa mutumbi.</char></note>50,000 o muwayawaya o silivera. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Mukaci keyo, diywi dya Fumu dya shumunine ku yuka no ku tanara.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Munyima thzeyi, Mupepo Oukenu wa anekerithsire Paulu ku thza ku Yerusalema ko ku pitera mu Masedonia na Akaya. Wa ambire ci: “Ou na ku ka kumako, naa roera ku ka hungera no ku Roma.” <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Ngou a tumine aidi kwanduthzienthzi, Timoti na Erasito ku Masedonia, aye wa thsiarire thsikati thsothsipu mu Asia.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukwangarakanyi mu Efese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Kethsiya thsikati kwa katukire mukwangarakanyi oukuru mu Efese keyi yo Dikuñwa dya Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Inene mukwakufura efu yo silivera yumweya o dithzina dyo Demetiriusi, oyu wa kwamangire mayambero a nyambi o mbuyama Atemisi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Karo aethsiwa ci Diana.</char></note> wa fumithsire nene akwakufura. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Ngou a wanekire awa akwakufura nakwakufura amweya mweyi ekwama no ku amba ci:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:25">“Andengenu, mu na dimuka ci rufumo rwetu po rwaa tunda peyi ekwama. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Karo mwaa mona no ku yuva oyu Paulu edi a rakwithsa no ku pambanithsa anu owangi ci anyambi o ku kwama ko moko po kadi anyambi shemwa, kadi muno mu Efese pohuma, unone no mu Asia yomuhe. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Po u di okaru, kadi pohuma ino ekwama yetu kwipa dithzina, unone no tembere thza nyambi shokuru o mbuyama Atemisi kwithsa oyu wa ku thzi vara, naye ka a ku remekiwa, aye oyu na romberiwa mu ditunga dyodihe dya Asia no mu kaye kokahe.”<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Ou a yuvire eyi a anthzipire nene no ku tateka ku yoomoka ci: “Atemisi o Maefese po mukuru mu thsivaka!” <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Kwekarire mukwangarakanyi mu mbongi thzothzihe. Anu a cirerire ku dipepero o kwa ka thza o purututa Gayusi na Arisitako awa a endire na Paulu ku tunda ku Masedonia. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Paulu wa fotire ku thzako oko ku mbunga, unone erongwa ya mu kanithsire. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Manduna amweya o mu ditunga dya Asia, awa ekarire ambusha Paulu, a mu tumithserire maywi o ku mu adikanena ci a thza no ku kengena mu dipepero.<verse eid="ACT 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Uno honi mbunga shime thzekarire mu mapurwapurwa. Awa ku kumba eyi, awaya ku kumba iya, mane ongi wo ka dimukire ci ine eyi a ciwanawanenine. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Majuda mu mbunga a thsindekerire Alekisanda ku rupara ro mbunga no ku mu ambera ci a tongonone eyi ya tendaharire. Wa tutwarithsire anu ko dyoko ci a ambe ku mbunga. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Unone mbunga ou thza dimukire ci nedi Mujuda, wahe a kumbakumbire mu thsikati thso ku twethsa ku kwana etunde idi ci: “Atemisi o Maefese po mukuru mu thsivaka!”<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Ku hura muñori o mbongi wa tutwarithsire mbunga no ku amba ci: “Amwe mwakwa Efese, ene kwaa di oyu na kana ku dimuka ci mbongi thza Efese po thzodiyo munyungi o tembere thza Atemisi shokuru, no diwe dyoshokenu edi dya wire ku wiru? <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Pakuninga ci eyi kadi ya ku tawa ku hamuriwa, mwaa roera ku tutwara no kukana ku yokwerera ku tenda thsimweya. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Inene awa akwerume mu na reta kuno kethzire mu tembere nji ku yengwera nyambi wetu o mbuyama.<verse eid="ACT 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />“Mweyo ngeci Demetiriusi naenthzenthzi akwakufura a di no kooko, makuta ko a di no manduna mwa di, aa twethsa ku cithzekithsa. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Uno honi ngeci ko i di imweya eyi mu na foto ku kumithsa, eyo kenge ya ku kengiwa mu kongano thzo murao. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Edi i di, tu di shemwa mukaru o ku twethsa ku thzekithsiwera yo mukwangarakanyi rero, inene kwithsa shemwa eyi nga tu amba ci yo i na reta ou mukwangarakanyi.”<verse eid="ACT 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Ou a manine ku amba eyi wa amberire mbunga ci thzi cishandoke. <figure style="fig" file="GPS_Paul3-BW final.tif" size="col" ref="18.23—21.17" /><verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CC, HS, CT, TA</para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu aa thza ku Masedonia no ku Gerike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Mukwangarakanyi ou wa pwire, Paulu wethsire erongwa. Ou a manine ku i tanarithsa micima, wa i vumenenine no ku thza ku Masedonia. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Ou a ka manine ku hungerithsa mandau oahe o mu Masedonia no ku ka tanarithsa micima akwakutawa, ku hura wa ka kumine mu ditunga dya Gerike, <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />oku a kekarire maonda ahatu. Pakuninga ci Majuda amweya shime a cekire ku mu rwithsa o ku ninga ci a thsekure a thze ku Siria, wa anekerire ku huka thzo ku pita mu Masedonia.<verse eid="ACT 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Wa thzire na Sopatera o ku Berea mwana Pirusi, no Arisitako na Sekundo o ku Tesalonika, no Gayusi o ku Debe, na Timoti, no Tikike na Tirofimo o ku Asia. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Awo a citangethzire no ku ka tu taterera mu Toroasi. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Unone munyima thzo Thsidika thso Makende o kupira Mamene, twa thsekurire mu Filipi no ku ka ciwanano mu Toroasi munyima thzo mayuwa mutanu, omu twa kekarire mayuwa mutanu na edi.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu aa hungera mu Toroasi ro mahurerero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Mu diyuwa dyo kutanga mu sunda, ou twa ciwanawanine pofoci ku Murarero wa Fumu, Paulu wa ambaurire kukwo thsikati thsothsire, shime ku ka kuma pa kaci kothsiku, pakuninga ci shime a anekerire ku funduka diyuwa edi dya randireko. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Omo mu koroi twa ciwanawanenine kwekarire tumbarambara totungi. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Mushumba o dithzina dyo Yutiko, oyu wekarire mu njaneno Paulu o ku rongithsa wa nyongerire no ku thza pa turo. Wa koromokire ku koroi thzo muthsihatu no ku wera pashi. Wa ka yeruriwirepo o ku na fu. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Paulu wa shirukire, wa ka mu kotamenine no ku mu paka mu moko enthzi, no ku amba ci: “Mwa cithzekera ka a fire, mu yumi!” <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Paulu ngou a hukire ku koroi. Ou a manine ku kuyaura dikende dyo Murarero wa Fumu no ku dya, wa ambaurireno thsikati thsothsire shime ku vithsa diyuwa, no ku funduka. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Anu a twarire oya mushumba ku diumbo o ku yoya, karo a karurukire nene.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu aa ciwana nakuru o kereke o mu Efese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Twa citangethzire ku thza ku dingunde no ku hunyuna ku thza ku Asoso, oku twa ka yomekerire Paulu, inene dyaa i pakire ci a thzeko no mauru. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Ou a ka tu wanine ku Asoso, twa ka mu yomekire mu dingunde no ku hunyuna ku thza ku Mitilene. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Twa thsekuriremo no ku ka kuma oshungashunga no diongo dya Kiosi diyuwa edi dya randireko. Mu diyuwa edi dya randireko karo twa reire ku thza mu diongo dya Samosi, karo mwedi dya randire edyo, twa ka kumine mu Mileta. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Paulu shime a anekerire ku piterera Efese ci katere a shimbe thsikati thsothsire mu Asia, inene shime a yokorwerire ku ka kuma ku Yerusalema mu diyuwa dyo Pentekota, nga ayopo i tawa.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Unone ou twa ka kumine mu Mileta, Paulu wa ka raire akuru o kereke mu Efese ci na ciwane nenthzi mu Mileta. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Ou a na kumine, wa wa amberire ci: “Mu na dimuka edi na yoyire mu kaci kenu thsikati thsothsihe ku tunda diyuwa dyo kutanga ku na dyata muno mu ditunga dya Asia. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Na kwamenangire Fumu ko kucihuthsa kushi nene no mihothzi neereka eyi ya ni keyerire mukaci ko tuyongo to Majuda. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Ka na thsiire ku mi rawera ngara thsinu thso ku twethsa ku mi kwathsa, na mi rongithsangire pa mbunga no mu manthzio enu. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Na pire ombangi ku Majuda no Magerike ci aa roera ku cera evi yo no ku thsiurukera kwa Nyambi no ku tawa kwa Fumu wetu Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />“Mu mone! Pano honi naa thza ku Yerusalema ko ku ni ootera Mupepo Oukenu, ame ka ni dimuka eyi ya ku ka tendahara ku kwange. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Naa dimuka pohuma ci Mupepo Oukenu waa ni dimukithsa ci mu mbongi no mbongi kupakiwa mu kamenga no makando i na ni taterera. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Unone ame ka ni varire mwoyo wange ci ukuru mu thsivaka ku kwange, efota yange po ku mana pohuma ekwama eyi naa ni pa Fumu Yesu, ayo ekwama yo ku pa ombangi o Muthzimbu Ouwa o thsihemo thsa Nyambi.<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />“Pano honi ni na dimuka ci kwithsa ku kwenu amwe na ni thzi o honga yo Kutumina kwa Nyambi oyu mba a ni mona karo. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Mweyo, naa mi tongwera rero ci ame ka ni di no murandu kunyinga wenu mwahe. <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Inene ka na thsiire ku mi rawera eanekera ya Nyambi yoihe.<verse eid="ACT 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />“Mu cinyunge no ku nyunga mutanga ou na mu hangweriwa ko Mupepo Oukenu kwikara atangereri. Mu vavarere kereke thza Nyambi, ethzi a ciurerire konyinga wenthzi shemwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Ni na dimuka ci munyima thzange kenge kwa ku keya winthzi o ku yapithsa karo ka wa ku na yuvera mutanga ñeke. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />No mu kaci kenu namo kenge kwa ku tunda anu awa ku tengurura oshemwa ku pambanithsa akwakutawa ci a wa shupwere. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Mweyo mu mamere! Mu vuruke ci mu myaka thzihatu ethzi nekarire nenu ka na thsiire ku nomenithsa munu no munu ku kwenu othsiku no mutenya ko mihothzi.<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />“Pano honi naa mi paka kwa Nyambi no ku diywi dyo thsihemo thsenthzi, adyo dyo ku twethsa ku miumba no ku mi pa etambura mu kaci kowa wahe awa a kenithsiwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Ka na cikumbwethzire silivera nji gauda nji evata yo munu. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Amwe mwathsinda mu na dimuka ci aa moko ange a tu reterire eyi ya fotaharire ku kwetu ame naenthzange. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Mwinu yoihe eyi na kwamine na mi monithsire ci ko ku kwama nene kenge, twaa roera ku kwathsa awa a na faratera, mu vuruke maywi a Fumu Yesu aa a ambire aye thsinda ci: ‘Mo thsi di thsiyauthzi nene mu kupa ku pita mu kupiwa.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Paulu ou a manine ku amba eyi wa tongamine no ku romberano wahe. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Wahe a dirire no ku mu kumbatera no ku mu yamwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Eyi ya wa yuvithsire nene mathsiwa po maywi aa a ambire o kuninga ci mbera ka mu mono karo. Ngou a mu thsindekethzire ku dingunde.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CC, HS, CT, TA</para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu aa thza ku Yerusalema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Ou twa cithsiireno twa hunyunine ku thzererera ku Koso. Diyuwa edi dya randireko twa thzire ku Rodesi, ou twa tundiremo twa thzire ku Patara. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Ou twa ka waninemo dingunde edi dya yavukire ku thza ku Fenisia, twa yomaminemo no ku hunyuna. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Ou twa monine diongo dya Sipera, twa di huthsire ku rumoho ku tamba ku Siria. Twa ka thsekerire mu diya dya Tire inene modiyo dya ka rongorwerire dingunde etenga eyi dya rongire.<verse eid="ACT 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Ou twa ka waninemo erongwa eyi yekariremo, twekarire nayo mayuwa mutanu na edi. Ko ku wa tangerera Mupepo Oukenu, a amberire Paulu ci a thza ku Yerusalema. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Mayuwa etu ou a pwire, twa fundukire no ku shumuna ruendo rwetu. Wahe, nanuwo nano a tu thsindekethzire ku tu tundithsa mu mbongi. Ou twa ka kumine ku diya twa ka tongamine no ku rombera. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Ou twa manine ku civumenena twa yomamine mu dingunde, awo a hukire ku diumbo.<verse eid="ACT 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Ou twa tundire mu Tire twa ka kumine mu Pitolemaisi, omu twa ka vumenenine akwakutawa no kwikarano diyuwa dyofoci. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Diyuwa edi dya randireko, twa fundukire no ku ka kuma mu Sesarea. Twa ka kumenine mu mwanda wa Filipu o ngambi, yumweya po waya o mutanu na aidi a hanguriwire mu Yerusalema. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Wekarire nana wambuyama ane wathzike awa okethzangire.<verse eid="ACT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Munyima thzo kwikaramo mayuwa oangi, mukwakukethza o dithzina dyo Agabusi wa keyire ku tunda ku Judea. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Wa keyire ku kwetu no ku na shimba mwiya wa Paulu no ku u cangithsa ku moko enthzi no ku mauru enthzi no ku amba ci: “Mupepo Oukenu wa amba ci: ‘Dyodino ni na cianga no uno mwiya, no Majuda mu Yerusalema dya ku kanga thsinda thso uno mwiya no ku mu pa mu moko Anukenge.’”<verse eid="ACT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Ou twa yuvire eyo, atwe nanu omo twa adikanenine Paulu ci a thza ku Yerusalema.<verse eid="ACT 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Unone Paulu wa tawire ci: “Ine eyi mu direra no ku ni yatura mucima? Ni na ciroithsera kadi kwangiwa pohuma, unone no ku ka fera mu Yerusalema mukaci ko dithzina dya Fumu Yesu.” <verse eid="ACT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Pakuninga ci ka a tawire ku thsiururiwa, twa i thsiire no ku amba ci: “Eshima ya Fumu i tendahare.”<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Munyima thzoa mayuwa twa ciroithserire no ku kambama ku thza ku Yerusalema. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Imweya kwirongwa yo mu Sesarea ya thzire netu no ku ka tu twara ku nthzio thza Manasoni oku twa ka turerire. Nedi mukwerume o ku Sipera, yumweya werongwa yo kutanga.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu aa hungerithsa Jakovo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Ou twa ka kumine mu Yerusalema, akwakutawa a ka tu tamburire ko thsinyanyu.<verse eid="ACT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Diyuwa edi dya randireko Paulu wa thzire netu ku ka mona Jakovo, karo akuru o kereke wahe pekarire. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Paulu wa wa vumenenine no ku pa muthzimbu ko kuyara keyi naa kwama Nyambi kwAnukenge mukaci kekwama yenthzi.<verse eid="ACT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Ou a yuvire eyi, a shangarire Nyambi. Ngou a amberire Paulu ci: “O na mono muenthzetu, mungi o ku kuma kupi o Majuda awa na tawa, karo wahe aa shima nene murao wa Mushe. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Shime na tongweriwa ci owe waa rongithsa Majuda wahe awa a na tungu mu kaci kAnukenge ci a thsie ku hengeka murao wa Mushe, karo ci a twaranga ano ku mukanda nji ku shupwera thsithsemwa thsetu thso Thsijuda. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Pano honi ne ine tu na roera ku tenda? Yoshemwa kenge a yuva ci o na kumu.<verse eid="ACT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />“Mweyo, o tende eyi tu ku tongwera. Kwa di pano akwerume ane awa na cethzera pa meho a Nyambi. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />O wa shimbe o thzeno ku Tembere, o kengeneno mu thsidika thso kukenithsiwa, karo o ka wa patarere mwikwama yoihe, ci huki thzo thzi ka keriwe. Apo honi anu wahe kenge a tawa ci eyi na yuvu keyi yoe po ya kwithsa, unone ci owe waa hengeka murao wa Mushe.<verse eid="ACT 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />“Eciko Anukenge wakwakutawa po na tu wa ñorera eanekera yetu ci a thsie ku dya edya yo ku tupwera ekupuro, no difura nji nyama weyama yo ku fa ku kathsinga, no ruthziho.” <verse eid="ACT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Ou dya vire, Paulu wa shimbire awo akwerume ane no ku ka cikenithsano. Wa thzire ku Tembere ku ka dimukithsa yo mayuwa aa kwa ku pwa kucikenithsa no thsikati thso ku pa thsiyambero thso munu no munu.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu aa kwatiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Ao mayuwa o mutanu na edi o ku a di po pepi no ku pwa, Majuda amweya awa a tundire ku Asia a monine Paulu mu Tembere. A shangumunine mbunga thzothzihe awopo a mu kwata. <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />A kumbire nene ku amba ci: “Amwe mwa Maisiraele mu tu kwathse! Oyu po yodiyo oyu na rongithsanga anu wahe kokuhe erongithsa yo ku rwithsa mbunga thza Isiraele no murao wa Mushe no Tembere. Kadi eyo pohuma, unone karo naa reta Anukenge<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Magerike nanu awa a di ci kadi Majuda.</char></note> mu Tembere no ku thsireka ethzi Ndau thzo Shokenu.” <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />A ambire kengeyo inene pa kutanga diya diyuwa shime aa mona Tirofimo o ku Efese o ku endaura na Paulu mu mbongi, awopo a anekera ci Paulu ngwa shime aa mu twara mu Tembere.<verse eid="ACT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Mbongi thzothzihe thzekarire shakashaka, anu a tundererire kokuhekokuhe o kwa keya o cira. A na kwatire Paulu no ku mu purututa ku mu tundithsa mu Tembere, popo mathsero a yanthzeriwire. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />O kwa fota ku mwipaa kengeyo, muthzimbu wa ka kumine kwa mukuru o mashwarare o Maroma ci mukwangaranyi u nengena mu Yerusalema yomuhe. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Popo wa shimbire mashwarare naendithsi amweya o mashwarare o Maroma no ku cirerako oko ku mbunga. Mbunga ou thza monine mukuru o mashwarare no mashwarare enthzi, a thsiire ku fura Paulu.<verse eid="ACT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Mukuru o mashwarare wa kwatire Paulu no ku tumina ci angiwe no madyenge edi. Ngou epurire honi ci nedi edye, karo ci ine a tendire. <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Amweya mu mbunga a kumbire eyi, amweya iya. Pakuninga ci muendithsi o mashwarare shokuru wa kwangire ku wana oshemwa mukaci ko mukwangarakanyi, wa tuminine mashwarare ci a tware Paulu ku thsirombo. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Paulu ou a ka kumine pa tuyako, mukwangarakanyi wa kurire nene ku ninga ci mane Paulu shime ou a mu yerurire mashwarare.<verse eid="ACT 21:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Mbunga ethzi thza wa shupwerire thza thzire o kumba ci: “O mwipae oyo! O mwipae oyo!”<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu aa ciambera ku Majuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Mashwarare o kwa fota kwingenithsa Paulu pa thsirombo, wa rombire muendithsi shokuru o mashwarare ci: “Ene naa tawethziwa ku amba thsimweya ku koe nji?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 21:37">Aye wa tawire ci: “O na dimuka Thsigerike nji? <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />Ene kadi yowe oya Muegepita oya wa retire mukwangarakanyi no ku thza nekeremi yo 4,000 mu dikunguthsitu?”<verse eid="ACT 21:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Paulu wa tawire ci: “Ame po no Mujuda o ku Tarese mu Silisia, no mukwa mbongi ethzi thzi pupaana. Naa adikana ci ni ambe ku mbunga.”<verse eid="ACT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Mukuru o mashwarare wa mu tawethzire, Paulu ngou emanine pa tuyako no ku tutwarithsa anu ko dyoko. Ou a tutwarire, wa ambireno mu Thsiheveru.<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CC, HS, CT, TA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />“Amwe mwaenthzange namwe mwatata, mu teerere nawa uno ni ciambera pa meho enu.” <verse eid="ACT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Ou a mu yuvire o ku amba Thsiheveru a tutwarire kuru. Paulu ngou a ambire ci:<verse eid="ACT 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />“Ame po no Mujuda, shime nerekiwerire mu Tarese o mu Silisia, unone na na kurerire muno mu Yerusalema. Gamaliele yo wa ni rongithsire, karo na fundithsiwire nawa murao wakwathsañuruetu. Na shimine nene ya Nyambi eci edi mu di amwe mwahe rerodino. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Na nyandithsire anu awa a na shupwera edi Dikuñwa mane no ku wepaithsa, kwanga no ku paka mu kamenga akwerume nambuyama kengeyo. <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Mupurisita shokuru no Nthzango thzakuru thzothzihe aa twethsa ku pa ombangi ci eyi ni amba ya shemwa. Na tamburire mañoro kukwo ku twara kwaenthzetu Majuda o mu Damaseka. Na thzireko ku reta awa anu ku Yerusalema o kwa nangiwa ci na pakiwe mu kamenga.<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu aa tongaura edi a tawire kwa Fumu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Ete 9.1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26.12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />“O ku ni di mu dikuñwa, karo o ku ni kokera ku Damaseka, mutenya diyuwa o ku di kokera pa kaci ko mutwi, popo mwethzi oukuru nene ou wa tundererire ku wiru wa munekire apa nekarire. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Na wererire pashi no ku yuva diywi edi dya ni amberire ci: ‘Saule, Saule, ine eyi o ni nyandithsera?’<verse eid="ACT 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />“Nepurire ci: ‘Yowe odye, Fumu?’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:8">“Wa tawire ci: ‘Yame no Yesu wa Nazareta oyu o nyandithsa.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Awa na endireno a monine oo mwethzi, unone ka yuvithsithsire diywi dyoyu wa ambire nange.<verse eid="ACT 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />“Ngou na ambire ci: ‘Ine ni na roera ku tenda, Fumu?’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:10">“Fumu ngou a ni amberire ci: ‘O katuke o thze mu Damaseka, modiyo o ka tongweriwa yoihe eyi o na piwa ku kwama.’<verse eid="ACT 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />“Pakuninga ci ka na twethsire ku mona mukaci ko kutethzima ko o mwethzi, awa na endireno a ni kwatererire ku dyoko ku ni twara mu Damaseka.<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />“Mukwerume o dithzina dyo Ananiasi wa keyire ku na ni mona. Nedi munu oyu wa cipakire ku ku hengeka murao, karo wa remekiwire ku Majuda wahe awa a tungire mu Damaseka. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Wa keyire no ku nemana ku nyonga thzange no ku ni ambera ci: ‘Saule muenthzange, o mone karo!’ Popo na twethsire ku mu mona.<verse eid="ACT 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />“Ngou a ni amberire ci: ‘Nyambi wakwathsañuruetu o na ku hangura ci o dimuke eshima yenthzi no ku mona O Muwawa, karo ci o yuve diywi dyo ku tunderera mu kanwa kenthzi. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Inene kenge wa kwikara mbangi wenthzi kwanu wahe keyi o na mono no ku yuva. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Pano honi ne ine eyi o taterera? O wimane o korovethziwe, o yoiwe kwivi yoe yoihe, ko kwithsa pa dithzina dyenthzi.’<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />“Ou na hukire ku Yerusalema, diyuwa dimweya o ku ni rombera mu Tembere na monine thsimwithso. <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />Na monine Fumu o ku ni ambera ci: ‘Yokorore o tunde mu Yerusalema popano, inene awa a dimo ka ku tambura ombangi woe keyi yange.’<verse eid="ACT 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />“Na tawire ci: ‘Fumu, awa anu a na dimuka shemwa ci shime naa thzanga mu sinagoge no sinagoge ku ka paka mu kamenga no ku fura awa a na tawa ku koe. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Karo uya wa viithsiwire onyinga wa mbangi woe Setefani, nemanine pa mbadi ku i tawethza no ku nyunga ekoveyo yo peuru yo waya a mwipaire.’<verse eid="ACT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />“Fumu ngou a ni amberire ci: ‘O thze, inene kenge ni ku tuma kokure, kwAnukenge.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Mbunga thza mu teererire shime ku na kuma pedyo diywi. Ngou a yoomokire wahe ci: “Oyo munu o kengeyo a tundithsiwe pa kaye! Ka a roerire ku yoya!” <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />O kwa yoomoka kengeyo no ku cishupaura ekoveyo yo no ku tuthsaera muve mu wiru, <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />muendithsi shokuru o mashwarare wa tuminine ci Paulu a twariwe pa thsirombo. Wa ambire ci a furiwe no kwipauriwa ci ku wanine ci ine eyi a mu yoomokerire anu kengeyo. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Uno honi o kwa na mana ku mwanga ci a furiwe, Paulu wa amberire muendithsi o mashwarare o Maroma oyu wemanine apo ci: “Ene murao ne waa tawethza ku fura Muroma o ku shime ku waniwa no murandu nji?”<verse eid="ACT 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Oyo muendithsi o mashwarare o Maroma ou a yuvire kengeyo, wa thzire kwa muendithsi shokuru o mashwarare no ku ka mwipura ci: “Ine eyi o fota ku tenda? Oyu munu po Muroma.”<verse eid="ACT 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Muendithsi shokuru ngou a thzire kwa Paulu no ku ka mwipura ci: “O ni tongwere, ene o Muroma nji?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:27">Aye wa tawire ci: “Ii, no Muroma.”<verse eid="ACT 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Oyo muendithsi shokuru wa ambire ci: “Na patarire madi oangi ci nikare no Muroma.” Uno honi Paulu wa tawire ci: “Ame po no Muroma ko kwerekiwa.”<verse eid="ACT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Popo anu awa a fotire kwipaura Paulu a hukire munyima. Muendithsi shokuru wa yapire ou a dimukire ci Paulu po Muroma, pakuninga ci wa tuminine ci angiwe no ku furiwa.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu mu Nthzango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Uno honi diyuwa edi dya randireko, muendithsi shokuru wa fotire nene ci a dimukere shemwa ethsi thsa retithsire ci Majuda a thzekithse Paulu. Wa mu puturire no ku tumina ci akuru o mapurisita no Nthzango thzothzihe a ciwane. Ngou a retire Paulu no ku na mwimeka pa rupara rwo.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CC, HS, CT, TA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Paulu wa kengererire ko thsithzui Nthzango thzothzihe no ku amba ci: “Andengenu, na ni yoyo ko mumoneno ouwa pa meho a Nyambi shime ku na kuma mu diyuwa dyo rero.” <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Mupurisita shokuru Ananiasi ngou a tuminine awa emanine ku mbadi thza Paulu ci a mu fure ku kanwa. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Unone Paulu wa ambire ci: “Nyambi kenge a fura owe o mukwamahetaheta! Eyi o nekarera apo po ku ni ratura ko murao, unone waa cora murao ko ku tumina ci ni furiwe.”<verse eid="ACT 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Awa emanine po pepi na Paulu a mu amberire ci: “Ine owe yo ku shwahwera kengeyo mupurisita shokuru wa Nyambi?” <verse eid="ACT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Paulu ngou a wa tawire ci: “Andengenu, ka ni i dimukire ci oyu munu po yodiyo mupurisita shokuru, inene ku na ñoriwa ci: ‘Katere o ambe thsothsimango kwa muendithsi o mbunga thzenu.’”<figure style="fig" alt="Paul before the council in Jerusalem" file="dn00511b.tif" size="span" loc="Act 23:1-8" copy="Dunham" ref="23.1-8">Paulu mu Nthzango mu Yerusalema</figure><verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Paulu ou a dimukire ci amweya omo mu Nthzango po nedi Asaduki amweya Afarithsi, wa kuererire ci: “Andengenu, name no Mufarithsi, mwanahoka wAfarithsi. Naa thzekithsiwa mukaci kokurupero o kupinduka kwafu.” <verse eid="ACT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Ou a manine ku amba kengeyo, kwa katukire dikanyi mukaci kAfarithsi nAsaduki, Nthzango athzopo thzi citepa. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />(Inene Asaduki awo a amba ci kwithsa kupinduka kwafu, karo kwithsa tungeru nji mipepo. Unone Afarithsi awo aa tawa eyo yoihe.)<verse eid="ACT 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Muyoyo wa kurire nene, unone arongithsi amweya o murao kwAfarithsi a katukire no ku kanyeka nene ci: “Ka a di no murandu oyu munu. Pamweya ngwa mupepo nji kangeru ka na amba nenthzi ne?” <verse eid="ACT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Mukwangarakanyi wa kurire nene ku ninga ci mane muendithsi shokuru o mashwarare wa yapire ci Paulu kenge a papuriwa. Ngou a tuminine mashwarare ci a ka u wa nyange no ku mu reta ku thsirombo.<verse eid="ACT 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Othsiku ou wa randireko, Fumu wemanine ku mbadi thza Paulu no ku amba ci: “O tanare mucima! Inene dyodi no pa ombangi keyi yange mu Yerusalema, dyo na roera ku ka pa ombangi keyi yange mu Roma.”<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kayongo ko kwipaa Paulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Anaci mathsiku, Majuda amweya a ciyongorire no ku cithziera ci kwithsa ku dya nji ku nwa shime o ku a nepaa Paulu. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Awa ekarire omo mu kayongo a pitererire makumi ane. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />A thzire kwakuru o mapurisita naendithsi o mbunga no ku ka amba ci: “Tu na cithziera ci kwithsa ku dya nji ku nwa shime o ku tu nepaa Paulu. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Mweyo, amwe no Nthzango mu rombe mukuru o mashwarare ci a rete Paulu kuno ko ku monithsa eci mwaa fota ku na fotithsithsa nawa thsiamba thsenthzi. Atwe tu na ciroithsera ku mwipaa o ku shime ku na kuma kuno.”<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Uno honi mwepwa Paulu wa yuvire aka kayongo, ngou a cirerire ku thsirombo thso mashwarare ku ka tongwera Paulu. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Paulu ngou ethsire yumweya kwaendithsi o mashwarare o Maroma no ku na mu ambera ci: “O tware oyu mushumba kwa muendithsi shokuru o mashwarare, ko i di eyi a fota ku ka mu tongwera.”<verse eid="ACT 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Ngou a mu shimbire no ku mu twara kwa mukuru o mashwarare no ku ka amba ci: “Paulu o thsinthzinda yo na nithsi no ku ni romba ci ni rete oyu mushumba ku koe, inene ko i di eyi a fota ku ku tongwera.”<verse eid="ACT 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Muendithsi shokuru o mashwarare wa kwatire oya mushumba ku dyoko no ku thza nenthzi ku mukunda no ku ka mwipura ci: “Ine eyi o fota ku ni tongwera?” <verse eid="ACT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Aye wa ambire ci: “Majuda amweya a na ciyuvu ci peunthza a ku ku rombe ci wa ku tware Paulu ku Nthzango ku monithsa eci aa fota ku ka kenga nawa thsiamba thsenthzi. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Unone wa ku rakwa yo, inene anu o ku piterera makumi ane kukwo a nondamena ku mwipaa. A na cithziera ci ka ku dya nji ku nwa shime o kwa na mwipaa. Awo a na ciroithsera, aa taterera pohuma ci o tawe.”<verse eid="ACT 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Oyo muendithsi shokuru o mashwarare ngou a thsiire oyo mushumba ci a thze, no ku mu ambera ci: “Katere o i tongwere munu ci ko i di eyi o na ni tongwera.”<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu aa tuturweriwa ku Sesarea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Muendithsi shokuru o mashwarare ngou ethsire aidi kwaendithsi enthzi o mashwarare o Maroma. Wa wa amberire ci: “Mu pake pofoci mashwarare o makumi o makumi edi (200), nakwatukambe o makumi mutanu na edi (70) no makumi o makumi edi (200) o mashwarare o makothzi. Mu ciroithsere mu katuke ko thsikati thso 9 thzothsiku mu thze ku mbongi thza Sesarea. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Mu roithse no tukambe apa a enda Paulu ci a ka kumithsiwe nawa kwa nguvuru Felekisi.” <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Ngou a ñorire diñoro edi dya ambire kenge ci:<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />“Yame no Kilaude Lisiasi, ku koe owe shokuru nguvuru Felekisi, naa ku vumenena. <verse eid="ACT 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Oyu munu shime na mu kwata Majuda awopo a fota no ku mwipaa. Ou na ni yuvu ci Muroma, ngou na ni thziko no mashwarare ange ku ka mu amwena. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Ko ku fota ku dimuka eyi naa thzekithsiwa, na ni mu twara mu Nthzango thzo. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Na ni wana ci aa thzekithsiwera yeamba yo dikanyi dyo murao wo o Thsijuda, uno honi eyi naa thzekithsiwa ka i roerire ku paiwera munu nji ku i pakiwera mu kamenga. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Ou na ni dimukithsiwa yo kayongo ko ku mwipaa, na ni mu tumithsa ko wanguwangu ku koe. Na ni tumina awa a mu thzekithsa ci a ku na kumithse ku koe eamba yo.”<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Mashwarare a tendire eyi a tuminiwire, a shimbire Paulu othsiku no ku mu twara ku mbongi ethzi thzi nethsiwa ci Antipatiri. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Diyuwa edi dya randireko, mashwarare aa a endire no mauru a hukire ku thsirombo, akwatukambe awo a twarire Paulu ku Sesarea. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Ou a ka kumine mu Sesarea, a ka pire diñoro nguvuru Felekisi no ku kumithsa Paulu ku kwenthzi. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Wa varire edyo diñoro no kwipura Paulu ci aa tunda mu ditunga dipi. Ou a yuvire ci wa ku Silisia, <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />wa mu amberire ci: “Kenge na ku kenga thsiamba thsoe awa a na ku thzekithsa ou a ku na kuma.” Ngou a tuminine ci Paulu a nyungiwe kengeyo o ku di mu marombe a Heroda.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CC, HS, CT, TA</para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu aa thzekithsiwa mu kuta thza Felekisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Munyima thzo mayuwa mutanu, Ananiasi mupurisita shokuru wa urumukire ku thza ku mbongi thza Sesarea nakuru amweya o Majuda no mukwa ku wemanena wo mwiamba o dithzina dyo Tetulo. A ka kumithsire eamba yo na Paulu kwa nguvuru. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Paulu ou ethsiwerire mu kaci, Tetulo wa tatekire ku kumithsa eamba kwa Felekisi ci:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:2">“Shokuru Felekisi, na twikara ko thsiyaro thsikati thsothsire mu kutumina koe, kumona koe yo ku rupara na ku reta epiruka muno mu ditunga dyetu. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Mu makuñwa oahe karo kokuhe, shokuru Felekisi, twaa tambura eyi kokanderero oukuru. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Uno honi ko kukana ku ku manena thsikati, naa ku romba ci ko thsihemo thsoe o tu teerereko kamanana.<verse eid="ACT 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />“Na tu wana ci oyu munu po thsishupi, aa reta mikwangarakanyi mu kaci ko Majuda mu kaye kokahe. Yodiyo mukuru o thsikwata ethsi thsi nethsiwa ci Manazareni. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />Karo shime aa fota ku thsireka Tembere, uno honi atwepo tu mu kwata. [Shime twaa fota ku mu ratura ko murao wetu o Thsijuda, <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />unone Lisiasi muendithsi o mashwarare ayepo wingenena eamba pa kaci no ku u tu nyanga kokoro, <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />no ku tumina ci awa a na mu thzekithsa a keye kuno ku koe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka thzi di mu mañoro o kutanga.</char></note>] O u cipawere othsinda kenge o wana ci eyi tu amba ya shemwa.”<verse eid="ACT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Majuda nawo ngou a cipakererire na mukwa ku wemanena ku tanarithsa ci eyi a ambire po ya shemwa.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Nguvuru ngou a rapethzire Paulu ci a ambe. Paulu wa tawire ci: “Ko ku dimuka ci no shimbi myaka thzothzingi o ku ratura muno mu ditunga, ni na nyanyuka ku citawera pa meho oe. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Waa twethsa ku fotithsithsa no ku wana ci ka na ku piti mayuwa o dikumi na edi ku tunda apa na ni thzera ku Yerusalema ku ka rombera. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Awa a ni thzekithsa ka na ni wana o ku ni cikanyeka no munu nji ku reta mukwangarakanyi mu mbunga nji mu Tembere nji mu masinagoge nji ku ngana mu mbongi. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Karo tumba twethsa ku monithsa ci eyi a ni thzekithsa ya shemwa.<verse eid="ACT 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />“Uno honi, eyi ni citawera pa meho oe po eyi, naa romberanga Nyambi wakwathsañuruetu ko ku shupwera Dikuñwa, edi ethsa awa ci thsipani. Naa tawa yoihe eyi i na citombora no murao wa Mushe neyi a ñorire akwakukethza. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Name nawo, twaa kurupera kwa Nyambi ci anu wahe owawawa nowa o dipethso kenge a ku pinduka kwafu. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Mweyo, naa kwama momuhe omu ni na twethsera ci mumoneno wange wikare ouwa pa meho a Nyambi nanu.<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />“Munyima thzo myaka thzothzingi, na hukire ku Yerusalema ku twara ekwathsa kwahepwe o mu ditunga dyange, no ku ka kwamena Nyambi eyambero. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />O ku ni kwama eyo, a ni wanine o ku ni na kenithsiwa mu Tembere. Ka kwekarire mbunga nji ku reta mukwangarakanyi. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Uno honi kwa di Majuda amweya o ku ditunga dya Asia awa ekarirepo, a na roera ku keya kuno pa meho oe ku na kumithsa eamba ngeci ko i di eyi a na ni thzekithsa. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Nji awa a di pano a ambe ngeci shime aa ni wanena murandu ou nemanine pa meho o Nthzango, <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />shime thsinu thsofoci ethsi na kuererire o ku ni nemana mu kaciko ci: ‘Ethsi mu ni thzekithsera rero po yo ku tawa ci ko ku di kupinduka kwafu.’”<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Uno honi Felekisi ko ku dimuka nawa yedyo Dikuñwa, wemekire eamba no ku amba ci: “Lisiasi muendithsi shokuru o mashwarare ou a ku na kuma mbeci na ku rature eamba yenu.” <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Ngou a raererire muendithsi o mashwarare o Maroma ci a nyunge Paulu, unone a mu pe kwikara ko ku rukuruka kamanana no ku tawethza ambushenthzi ku na mu kwathsa eyi i na fotahara.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Munyima thzo mayuwa oapu, Felekisi na munuwenthzi o Mujuda o dithzina dyo Dirusila a keyire no ku tuma munu ku kethsa Paulu. Wa mu teererire o ku ambaura yo thsitawo kwa Krisitu Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Paulu o ku ambaura yowawa, kucinyunga neyi yo raturo ethzi thzi keya, Felekisi wa yapire nene, ngou a ambire ci: “O thze honi ku na kwana pano! Ou na ku wana thsikati kenge na ku kwithsa karo.” <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Karo Felekisi shime a kuruperire ci ngwa Paulu kenge nga a mu pa madi o kweta, mweyo, wa mwithsangire rorungi no ku na ambaura nenthzi.<verse eid="ACT 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Ou kwa pitire myaka thzidi, Posiasi Fesitusi wa shwanine Felekisi. Uno honi ko ku fota ku roerithsa Majuda, Felekisi wa thsiire Paulu mu kamenga.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CC, HS, CT, TA</para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu aa thzekithsiwa mu kuta thza Fesitusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Ou kwa pitire mayuwa ahatu ku tunda pa kukuma kwenthzi mu Sesarea, Fesitusi wa kambamine ku thza ku Yerusalema. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />Akuru o mapurisita naendithsi o Majuda a ka kumithsire ku kwenthzi eamba yo na Paulu. <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />A rombire Fesitusi ci a wa monithse thsihemo ku ka huthsa Paulu ku Yerusalema, inene shime a cekire ku mundamena ci a mwipaere mu dikuñwa. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Unone Fesitusi wa tawire ci: “Paulu po aa nyungiwa mu kamenga ku Sesarea, ni tamba ku hukako. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Aendithsi enu a thze nange, ngeci ko i di eyi na epithsa, aa twethsa ku ka mu thzekithsera ko kuya.”<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Munyima thzo kwikarano mayuwa mutanu na ahatu nji o dikumi, Fesitusi wa urumukire ku thza ku Sesarea. Diyuwa edi dya randireko, wekarire mu thsipura thsenthzi mu kuta no ku tumina ci Paulu a retiwe. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Paulu ou a na kumine, Majuda awa a tundire ku Yerusalema a mu thzingurukire no ku mu capa yoingi yoikuru, unone ka twethsire ku monithsa ci ya shemwa.<verse eid="ACT 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Paulu ngou a ciamberire ci: “Kwithsa ethsi na nipithsera murao o Thsijuda nji Tembere, nji ku rwithsa Sesare.”<verse eid="ACT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Uno honi Fesitusi ko ku fota ku roerithsa Majuda wepurire Paulu ci: “Ene kenge nga o tawa ci tu kambame ku thza ku Yerusalema o ka thzekithsiwereko pa meho ange eyi eamba?”<verse eid="ACT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Unone Paulu wa ambire ci: “Mu kuta thza Sesare muno ni nemana, mo ni na roera ku ratweriwa. Kwithsa ethsi na ni pithsera Majuda, eci edi o na i cidimukera nawa nowe. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Ngeci po na nipithsa no ku roera ku paiwa, ka ni kanine ku fa. Uno honi ngeci eyi a ni thzekithsera awa Majuda po kadi ya shemwa, kwithsa oyu na roera ku ni pa mu moko o. Naa cirombera ci a ka ni rature Sesare!”<verse eid="ACT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Munyima thzo ku i ciyongora no nthzango thzenthzi, Fesitusi ngou a ambire ci: “Pakuninga ci o na cirombera ku thza kwa Sesare, kenge o thza kwa Sesare!”<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu pa meho a Agiripa na Berenisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Munyima thzo mayuwa oapu, fumu Agiripa na Berenisi a kumine mu Sesarea ku na pa direma kwa Fesitusi. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Pakuninga ci ekariremo mayuwa oangi, Fesitusi wa ambaurire na fumu Agiripa eamba ya Paulu. Wa ambire ci: “Kwaa di mukwerume kuno oyu naa thsii Felekisi mu kamenga. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Ou na ni thzi ku Yerusalema, akuru o mapurisita naendithsi o Majuda na ka mu capa eamba no ku ni romba ci ni mu rature. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Na ni ka wa tongwera ci ko thsithsemwa thso Thsiroma kadi ya ku tawa ku ratura munu o ku shime ku cishikaura o kwa na citanekera noyu mu thzekithsa ci nga a wane thsikati thso ku ciambera keyi a thzekithsiwa. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Ou na keya kuno nange, ka na ni tamangera, unone mu diyuwa edi dya randireko nekarire mu kuta no ku tumina ci Paulu a retiwe. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Awa a mu thzekithsa ou emanine ci a ambe, ka mu thzekithserire eamba yoimango eci edi na anekerire. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Unone shime a cikanyekire yo mangudi nenthzi keyi yo thsitawo thso neyi yo mukwerume oyu wa fa o dithzina dyo Yesu, oyu a ningire Paulu ci muyumi. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Na kwangire dyo ku fotithsithsa enu yo kengeyo, ngou na mwipurire ci ngeci kenge nga a tawa ku thza ku Yerusalema ci i ka thzekiwereko. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Uno honi Paulu ou a ciromberire ci a pakiwe kengeyo mu kamenga ci Sesare a ku tete thsiamba thsenthzi, na tuminine ci a nyungiwe kengeyo shime ou na ku mu tumithsera kwa Sesare.”<verse eid="ACT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Agiripa ngou a amberire Fesitusi ci: “Naa fota ci nga ni na u ciyuvera oyu mukwerume.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 25:22">Aye wa tawire ci: “Peunthza kenge wa ku u ciyuvera.”<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Diyuwa edi dya randireko, Agiripa na Berenisi a keyire o nunaera nene no ku nengena mu diambero naendithsi o mashwarare nakwerume o ku remekiwa omo mu mbongi. Ko thsiraerera thsa Fesitusi, Paulu wa retiwire. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Ou a na kumine Paulu, Fesitusi wa ambire ci: “Fumu Agiripa namwe mu di muno mwahe, mu na mu mono oyu mukwerume! Majuda wahe ku Yerusalema no kuno ku Sesarea aa ootera ci ka a roerire ku yoya karo. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Kwithsa ethsi na ni wana ethsi na epithsa thso ku roera ku paiwera munu, unone pakuninga ci naa cirombera ku thza kwa fumu shokuru, na ni hangura ku mu tumithsa ku Roma.<verse eid="ACT 25:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />“Unone kwithsa eyi ni na roera ku ñorera fumu Sesare keyi yoyu mukwerume. Mweyo, ni na mu reta ku kwenu mwahe, nene po kwa fumu Agiripa ci ku hura thzo ku mwipaura ni wane yo ku ñora. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Inene naa mona ci ka ku roerire ku tumithsa thsinthzinda ko kukana ku ñora eyi na epithsa.”<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CC, HS, CT, TA</para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu aa citawera pa meho a Agiripa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Agiripa ngou a amberire Paulu ci: “O na piwa thsikati thso ku citawera othsinda.” Paulu wemekire dyoko dyenthzi no ku tateka ku amba kenge ci: <verse eid="ACT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />“Fumu Agiripa, naa mona ci ni di no thsiyauthzi rero kwimana pa meho oe ku ciambera mwinu yoihe eyi a ni thzekithsa aendithsi o Majuda. <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />Thsikurupo pakuninga ci o na dimuka nawa ethsemwa no makanyi o Majuda. Mweyo, naa ku romba ci o kwate mucima o ni teerere nawa.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />“Majuda wahe a na dimuka mikarero thzange ku tunda ku wanuke wange. Mu ditunga dyetu na kurerire no mu Yerusalema. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Na ni dimuka thsikati thsothsire, ngeci a na i shimi aa twethsa ku pa ombangi ci no yumweya o mu thsikwata thsAfarithsi ethsi na thsi tanarithsanga nene thsitawo thsetu. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Pano honi aa ni thzekithsera yo ku tawa no ku kurupera thsikumbwethzo thsa Nyambi ethsi a kumbwethzire kwakwathsañuruetu. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Mikuta thzetu thzo dikumi na thzidi thza Isiraele thzaa kurupera ku mona ethsi thsikumbwethzo o ku thsi citombora, uno a rombera nene Nyambi mutenya nothsiku. Fumu Agiripa, ou okurupero odiyo ou a ni thzekithsera awa Majuda! <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Ine eyi i mi karupera amwe mwa Majuda ku tawa ci Nyambi aa twethsa ku pindura afu?<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />“Name na tawire shemwa ci naa roera ku tenda momuhe omu ni na twethsera ku rwithsa dithzina dya Yesu wa Nazareta. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Eyo yodiyo na tendire mu Yerusalema. Ko ku ni pa okoro akuru o mapurisita, na pakire mu kamenga akwakutawa owangi, karo ou a ratweriwire kufa na tawire kengeyo. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Rorungi o ku ni thzanga ku masinagoge ku ka wa pa humbithso no ku wa ootera ci a yengwere Yesu. Na wa nyandithsire nene kuninga ci mane shime naa wa shupweranga no ku mambongi o ku matunga ao.<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu aa tongaura edi a tawire kwa Fumu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Ete 9.1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">22.6-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />“Diyuwa dimweya na thzire ku Damaseka ku endera eyo kokoro no thsitumiwa thsakuru o mapurisita. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Pa kaci ko mutenya, Fumu wange, o ku ni di mu dikuñwa kengeyo popo mumunyi o kwethsa nene kupita diyuwa wa tundire ku wiru ku ni paka mukaci nowa na endireno. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Twahe twa wererire pashi, ngou na yuvire diywi edi dya ni amberire mu Thsiheveru ci: ‘Saule, Saule, ine eyi o ni nyandithsera? Kwithsa eyi nga i kwathsa owe ku rwithsa eshima yange.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Waa cikurura othsinda ko ku raha ku mushengera eci puru oyu nyakura ku dikonato dya ñathsire wenthzi.</char></note>’<verse eid="ACT 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />“Na ambire ci: ‘Yowe odye, Fumu?’ Edyo diywi dya tawire ci: ‘Yame no Yesu oyu o nyandithsa. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Uno honi o katuke o wimane kedyato yoe, inene ni na hokoka ku koe ku na ku hangura ci o wikare mupikange no mbangi wange keyi o na mono neyi na ku ku monithsa ku rupara. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Kenge na ku ku amwena kwanu oe a Isiraele no ku kwAnukenge oku ni ku tuma pano, <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />ku ka yanthzurura meho o, ci nga a thsiuruke ku tunda mu mirema ku thza mu mwethzi, no ku wa tundithsa kukoro wa Satana a thze kwa Nyambi. Wangu honi a ku tambure otetero wevi no ku wana ndau mu kaci kanua Nyambi awa a kenithsiwa ko thsitawo thso ku kwange.’<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu aa ambaura yekwama yenthzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />“Mweyo, Fumu Agiripa, na ni hengeka nene ethsi thsimona thsa tundire ku wiru. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />Ngou na tangire ku rongithsa mu Damaseka, mu Yerusalema no mu Judea yomuhe mbeci honi kwAnukenge, ci a cere no ku thsiurukera kwa Nyambi no ku tenda etenda yo ku monithsa kucera kwo. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Eyi yodiyo a ni kwaterire Majuda mu Tembere no ku fota ku nipaa. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Unone Nyambi naa ni nyungu shime ku na kuma mu diyuwa dyo rero, pano ni nemana muno ku pa ombangi kwanu wahe, owaonye nowa owakuru. Kwithsa yayo eyi ni na amba shime eyi aa ambire akwakukethza na Mushe ci kenge ya ku tendahara. <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />Ayo yo ku amba ci Mesiya kenge a ku nyandithsiwa karo kenge a kwikara o kutanga ku pinduka kwafu, no ku raura muthzimbu o mwethzi ku Majuda no ku kwAnukenge.”<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Paulu o ku ciambera kengeyo, Fesitusi wa mu yukukerire ci: “Waa thzaruka Paulu! Kucirongithsa nene koe kwaa ku thzarukithsa!”<verse eid="ACT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Paulu wa tawire ci: “Shokuru Fesitusi, ka ni thzarukire. Eyi ni amba po ya shemwa karo ya maano. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Inene Fumu Agiripa na dimuka eyi enu ngeyi ni ambera kondume. Naa rakwa ci eyi etandahara yoihe na i mu kumena, inene ka na i tendiwera ku mukunda. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Fumu Agiripa, ene waa tawa yakwakukethza nji? Ni na dimuka ci waa i tawa.” <verse eid="ACT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Agiripa ngou a amberire Paulu ci: “Ene owe ne waa anekera ci kenge nga o ni thsiurura mu thsikati thsothsipu ci nikare Mukrisitu nji?” <verse eid="ACT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Paulu wa ambire ci: “Yaa twethsa kwikara thsikati thsothsipu nji thsothsire, naa rombera kwa Nyambi ci kadi owe pohuma unone wahe awa a ni teerera rero nga ekare eci ame, ku tundithsako pohuma aa madyenge.”<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Ngou fumu, nguvuru, Berenisi nowa ekarireno emanine no ku thza. <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />Ou a punine, a tatekire ku i ciambithsana ci: “Oyu munu kwithsa ethsi na epithsa thso ku roera kwipaiwera nji ku pakiwera mu kamenga.”<verse eid="ACT 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Agiripa wa amberire Fesitusi ci: “Oyu munu nga ka na a cirombera ku thza kwa Sesare nga aa punithsiwa.”<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CC, HS, CT1, TA, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu aa twariwa ku Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Ou a manine ku ciyuva ci twaa roera ku thza ku Itali no dingunde, Paulu nenthzinda imweya a pakiwire mu moko a muendithsi o mashwarare o Maroma o dithzina dyo Juliasi, muendithsi o thsipani thso mashwarare ethsi thsi nethsiwa Agusitu. <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Twa yomamine mu dingunde edi dya tundire ku diya dya Adiramiti edi dya roerire ku thza o kura mu maya o ditunga dya Asia, atwepo tu hunyuna. Arisitako, Mumasedonia o ku Tesalonika wekarire netu.<verse eid="ACT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Diyuwa edi dya randireko twa ka thsekerire mu Sidoni. Juliasi wa monithsire thsihemo thsothsikuru kwa Paulu, wa mu tawethzire ku thza kwambushenthzi ci nga a ka mu peko eyi ya fotaharire. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Twa thsekurire omo no ku pitera ku wiko wa Sipera inene shime twa ramathsire mupepo. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Twa reerire dikuruviya po pepi no kakuro ka Silisia na Pamfilia, no ku ka thsekera mu Mira, mbongi thzo mu Lisia. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Omo modiyo a ka wanine muendithsi o mashwarare o Maroma dingunde edi dya tundire ku Alekisandiria ku thza ku Itali, ngou a tu yomekiremo.<verse eid="ACT 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Twa vuire nawanawa mayuwa oangi no ku ka kuma kokaru pepi na Kinido. Ou wa tu kwangithsire mupepo ku henyako, twa vuerire ku mbadi thzo diongo dya Kirete, ku ka piterera huku thza Salumone. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Twa endire kengeyo kokaru ku mbadi thzo dikuruviya shime ku ka kuma mu ndau ethzi thzi nethsiwa Diya Dyonawa, pepi no mbongi thza Lasea.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Twa shimbire thsikati thsothsire nene omo, ku vua mu dikuruviya kwa thzire o yapithsa inene nedi o ku na di piti Diyuwa dyOtetero.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Diyuwa dyo kucikanga no nthzara.</char></note> Paulu ngou a ambire ci:<verse eid="ACT 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />“Andengenu, naa mona ci runo ruendo ku tunda pano kenge ru karupa ngeci o tu shumune. Dingunde netenga kenge twa ku i yawa, mane no myoyo thzetu kengeyo.” <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Unone oya muendithsi o mashwarare o Maroma ka a rakwire eyi a ambire Paulu, aye shime a tawire pohuma eyi a ambire thsitumi o dingunde no thsinda wadyo. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Pakuninga ci edyo diya kadi diwa kwikaramo pa kufu, ongi wo awa ekarire mu dingunde a ciyuvire ci ku hunyuniwe, ko ku kurupera ku ka kuma mu Fenekisi no ku kekaramo kufu yomuhe. Fenekisi po nedi diya dyo mu Kirete edi dya tanekerire ku mboera o mutoko no ku wiko o mutoko.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dyungu mu diwate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Ou kwa pepire mupepo oupu ku tunda mu mboera, anu a anekerire ci ku di nawa. A yerurire dinjanga no ku vuera ku mbadi thzo rupimingi rwa Kirete, pepi no dikambo. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Unone mu thsikati thsothsipu mupepo o dyungu ou u nethsiwa o ku wiko o ku muvo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu Thsigerike po: Eurakilo.</char></note> wa vukukire ku tunderera pa diongo. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Wa na furire pa dingunde, karo pakuninga ci twa kwangire kwingena pa dyungu, twa i cihupwerire atwepo tu ka thza o puka.<verse eid="ACT 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Ou twa ka pitire ku mbadi thzo kaongoana ka Kauda, twa ka twethsire kokaru ku kokera mu dingunde katoana ko ku dingunde. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Ngou a thzingerire nene miothzi dingunde ku di tanarithsa. Shime yapire ku pukera ku diheke dya Sitisi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ku nganga thza Afurika.</char></note> ngou a huwire dimbatu dyodikuru dyo dingunde, no ku thsia dingunde ci di cipukere ku mupepo.<verse eid="ACT 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Mupepo o dyungu wa twarererire ku pepa, mweyo diyuwa edi dya randireko a tatekire ku konthzaera etenga imweya mu meyu. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Mu diyuwa dyo muthsihatu a konthzerire mu dikuruviya ekwamithsa imweya yo dingunde ko moko o. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Twa shimbire mayuwa oangi tu mono diyuwa nji matungwethzi, karo mupepo wa twarererire kengeyo ku ngundunga. Ku hura twa cihupwerire okurupero o kuninga ci kenge twa ku yoya.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Anu a shimbire thsikati thsothsire kwithsa ku dya, Paulu wemanine pa rupara rwo no ku amba ci: “Andengenu, shime na mu roera ku ni yuva iya na ni amba ci twa tunda mu Kirete, eyi na ipa neyi na i yawiwa nga ka na i dikara. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Pano honi naa mi romba ci mu tanare micima, kwithsa shaanga yofoci ku kwenu oyu wa ku fa shime dingunde pohuma dyo dya kwipa. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Inene uya othsiku u na pu ni na mono kangeru ka Nyambi oyu ni kwamena no ku rombera aka ka na nemana ku nyonga thzange, <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />no ku ni ambera ci: ‘Wa yapa Paulu, o na roera ku kemana pa rupara rwa Fumu shokuru Sesare! Karo ko thsihemo thsenthzi Nyambi, na ku pa myoyo thzowa o endano wahe.’ <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Mweyo, andengenu, mu tanare micima, inene naa kurupera Nyambi ci kenge a tenda dyodi a na ni ambera. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Uno honi kenge tu pukera pa diongo dimweya.” <figure style="fig" file="GPS_Paul4-BW final4.tif" size="col" ref="27.1—28.14" /><verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dyungu dyaa pukithsera dingunde pa diongo</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Pa kaci kothsiku o mu dikumi na ane o ku tu pukithsiwa kengeyo ku dyungu mu dikuruviya dya Adiria, avui o dingunde a anekerire ci ngwa aa kokera pa dikambo. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Ngou a shurumunine muothzi o dinjanga no ku wana ci nedi othzungi o ku kwana mauru o 120. Munyima thzo thsikati thsothsipu a erekire karo no ku wana ci nedi othzungi o ku kwana mauru o 90. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Shime yapithsire ci dingunde dyetu kenge di cirenga pa mawe. Ngou a pakire manjanga ane mu meyu o ku dihuto dyo kunyima no ku rombera ci nga di ve diyuwa.<verse eid="ACT 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Avui o dingunde a fotire kwomboroka mu dingunde, a shurumwenine katoana mu meyu, ku monithsa eci aa fota ku ka shurumuna manjanga o ku dihuto dyo ku rupara. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Unone Paulu wa amberire muendithsi o mashwarare o Maroma no mashwarare kengeyo ci: “Ngeci awa avui o dingunde kekaramo muno mu dingunde, mwahe kenge mu fa.” <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Mashwarare ngou a tetire miothzi thzako katoana no ku ka thsia ci ka thze o puka no meyu.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />O ku di fota ku va diyuwa, Paulu wa adikanenine anu wahe ci a dye. Wa ambire ci: “Na mu shimbi mathsunda edi o ku mu cithzekera kwithsa no ku dya. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Pano naa mi romba ci mu dye ci mu wane okoro mu yoye. Inene kwithsa shaanga dihuki dyofoci edi di thzuruka ku mitwi thzenu.” <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Ou a manine ku amba eyo, wa shimbire dikende no ku kanderera kwa Nyambi o kwa na mu tanekera wahe. Wa di kuyurire no ku tateka ku dya. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Wahe a tanarire micima, awopo a dya nawo. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Twahe atwe twekarire omo mu dingunde po twakwa 276. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Ou a dire wahe kwikuta, a konthzaerire mathsaka o vuroto mu meyu ku rethzupithsa dingunde.<figure style="fig" alt="Shipwrecked on the island of Malta" file="wa03995b.tif" size="span" loc="Act 27:33-44" copy="Wade" ref="27.39-44">Dingunde dyaepa pa diongo dya Malita</figure><verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Ou dya vire diyuwa avui o dingunde ka dimukire edyo ditunga, a monine pohuma diko dyo dikambo dyo ruheke, a anekerire ku thsekeramo nga ayopo i tawa. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Ngou a tetaurire manjanga no ku a thsia mu diwate, karo a puturire mapepe o ku thsiururithsa dingunde. Ngou emekire dimbatu dyo ku rupara ci mupepo u pukithsere dingunde ku dikambo. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Unone dingunde dya cirengire pa diheke. Dihuto dyo ku rupara dyo dingunde dya kakaterirepo no ku kwanga ku tundapo, maci thzadyo thza cothzauriwire epinthzipinthzi ku mañithsingi aa a cipumaurirepo.<verse eid="ACT 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Mashwarare a cekire kwipaa enthzinda ci katere i yoe no kwomba. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Unone muendithsi o mashwarare o Maroma wa wa kanithsire ku kwama kengeyo inene shime a fotire ku yoyithsa Paulu. Ngou a tuminine ci anu wahe o ku twethsa ku yoa a tange ku reera mu meyu ku thza pa dikambo. <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />Awa thsiarerire a thzire pa dikambo ko ku kwaterera pepara nji epinthzi yo diya dingunde. Kengeyo dyodiyo a ka kumine nawa waheno pa dikambo.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CC, HS, CT, TA</para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu mu diongo dya Malita</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Ou twa ka kumine nawa pa dikambo, mbeci tu dimuke ci diya diongo dya ethsiwa Malita. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Anu o muya mu diongo a tu tamburire no ku tu monithsa thsihemo thsothsikuru nene. Pakuninga ci mvura shime a rokire, karo shime kwomborire, a tu fakarerire mudiro.<verse eid="ACT 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Paulu wa ka koakoire yaara, ou a na i pakire pa dithziko, pa tundire diyoka edi dya cirire ku kupya, adyopo di mu humenena ku dyoko. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Anu o muya mu diongo ou a monine diyoka o ku di kunthzerera ku dyoko dyenthzi, a ambire mu kaciko ci: “Yoshemwa oyu munu thsikenyembwa. Shaanga ci na para ku meyu, pano nyambi shiwana mavwevwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nyambi o shiwana mavwevwe po yodiyo nyambi o mbuyama oyu a dimukire awo mwethso thsikati.</char></note> ka a mu tawethzire ku yoya.” <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Paulu wa kukumwenine edyo diyoka mu mudiro, unone ka dya mu kururire. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Anu shime anekerire ci kenge a tuumana nji ku wera pashi popo no ku fa, unone ou kwa pitire thsikati thsothsire kadi ya ku tendahara, a pirurire eanekera yo no ku amba ci Paulu po kanyambiana.<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Muya mu diongo po pepi nopa twombokerire, kwekarire makanda a nduna odyo diongo o dithzina dyo Pabuliasi. Wa tu tamburire ko thsihemo mu mayuwa ahatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Tata wa Pabuliasi shime a rarire podidi o ku kora nene dihokoma no ku tuhuka onyinga. Paulu wengenine mu nthzio thzenthzi ku ka mu romberera, wa ka mu kambekire moko no ku mu porithsa. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Munyima thzo ku tendahara eyi, akwakukora wahe amweya o muya mu diongo nawo a keyire no ku na porithsiwa. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />A tu pire direma dyodikuru, karo o ku tu fota ku hunyuna a tu pire enu yoingi eyi ya fotaharire mu ruendo rwetu.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu aa kuma mu Roma</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Munyima thzo maonda ahatu, twa hunyunine no dingunde dyadyo, dyo ku diya dyo mbongi thza Alekisandiria, dyo thsidimukithso thso Anyambi o Marambi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kasitore na Polukisi.</char></note>, edi dyekarire omo mu diongo kufu yomuhe. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Twa ka thsekerire mu mbongi thza Sirakusi omu twa ka onthzire mayuwa ahatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Ou twa tundire omo twa vuire no ku ka kuma mu Regio. Diyuwa edi dya randireko mupepo o ku mboera wa keyire, edi dya randireko karo twa ka kumine mu Puteoli. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Omo twa ka waninemo aenthzetu akwakutawa awa a tu rombire kwikarano thsunda. Ngou honi twa ka kumine mu Roma.<figure style="fig" alt="Paul arrives at Rome" file="wa03998b.tif" size="span" loc="Act 28:11-14" copy="Wade" ref="28.11-14">Paulu aa kuma mu Roma</figure><verse eid="ACT 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Akwakutawa o mu Roma a yuvire ci twaa keya, mweyo a keyire ku Maurithsero a Apiasi no ku Maturero Ahatu Enda ku na ciwana netu. Paulu ou a monine awa akwakutawa, wa kandererire kwa Nyambi, karo ya mu tanarithsire mucima.<verse eid="ACT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Ou twa kumine mu Roma, Paulu wa tawethziwire kwikara yofoci no dishwarare dyo ku mu nyunga.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu aa honga mu Roma</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Munyima thzo mayuwa ahatu, Paulu wethsire aendithsi o Majuda. Ou a ciwanawanine, Paulu wa wa amberire ci: “Andengenu, shaanga ci ka nepithserire mbunga thzetu nji thsithsemwa thsakwathsañuruetu, nangiwire mu Yerusalema no ku piwa mu moko o Maroma. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />A nipaurire awopo a fota ku ni rukurura, inene ka ni wanenine murandu o ku roera kwipaiwera. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Unone Majuda ou a kanine, na ciyuvire ci ni rombe ku retiwa kwa Fumu shokuru Sesare. Kadi cingwa ko i di eyi ni fota ku thzekithsa anuange. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Eyi ngeyi na ni mithsera ku na mi mona no ku amba nenu. Eyi a niangerire noa madyenge po yo ku tawa koyu a na kurupera Maisiraele.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Paulu ou a ambire ci “Oyu a na kurupera Maisiraele,” Majuda a dimukire ci aa amba yo Mesiya oyu wa keyire.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />A mu tawire ci: “Kwithsa mañoro aa na tu mono aa na tundu ku Judea o ku amba yoe, karo kwithsa munu kwaenthzetu oyu naa tunduko ku na tu tongwera yoimango eyi no kwama. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Unone atwe twaa fota ku yuva eanekera yoe, inene kokuhe anu aa rwithsa ethsi thsipani.”<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />A ciyuvire diyuwa dyo ku ciwana na Paulu. Mwedyo diyuwa anu a keyire kongi oku a turerire Paulu. Ku tateka mathsikuthsiku ku twara kanguronguro wa tongononine no ku pa ombangi o Kutumina kwa Nyambi. Wa erekire ku wa rakwithsa ya Yesu ko ku cikwathsithsa Murao wa Mushe no mu mañoro Akwakukethza. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Amweya a rakwire eyi a ambire Paulu, unone amweya ka i tawire. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Majuda a kwangire ku ciyuva, a tatekire ku thza munyima thzo ku amba Paulu aa maywi ci: “Mupepo Oukenu wa amberire akwathsañuruenu yo shemwa ka mukwakukethza Isaya ci:<verse eid="ACT 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />“ ‘O thze o ka tongwere awa anu ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">“Ku yuva kenge mwa ku yuva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">unone ka mwa ku yuvithsithsa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">ku mona kenge mwa ku mona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">unone ka mwa ku monithsithsa.”<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Inene awa anu po akwa mukanayuva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">a na civuku mu matwi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">no ku cithzimenena meho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">ci meho o a mona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">no matwi o a yuva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">ci ekara no maano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">o ku thsiurukera ku kwange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">ci ni wa porithse.’ ”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Isa 6.9-10</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Paulu wa shumunine ku amba ci: “Mweyo, mu dimuke ci oku kuyoyithsiwa na ku tundu kwa Nyambi na ku tumiwa noku kwAnukenge, karo kenge a ku teerera.” <verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />[Paulu ou a manine ku amba eyo, Majuda a tundiremo o kwa ka thza o cikanyeka nene.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka thzi di mu mañoro o kutanga.</char></note>] <verse eid="ACT 28:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Paulu wekarire myaka thzidi mu nthzio thzo ku patara, wa tamburangire nawa anu wahe awa keyangire ku na mu mona. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Wa hongangire kondume yo Kutumina kwa Nyambi neyi ya Fumu Yesu Krisitu, ko kukana ku kwangithsiwa.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>